The state-owned enterprises and advantageous private enterprises entered the old revolutionary area of Gannan.
From September 26th to 27th, in order to deepen and expand the educational achievements on the theme of "not forgetting the original intention and keeping the mission in mind", the Central Military-Military Integration Office, the National Defense Science and Industry Bureau, and the All-China Federation of Industry and Commerce jointly organized "state-owned enterprises and advantageous private enterprises into Gannan's old revolutionary district" research activities, revisited the history of the revolution, pursued red footprints, inherited red genes, and carried out the demand docking between related enterprises and Ganzhou.
Jin Zhuanglong, executive deputy director of the Central Civil-Military Integration Office, deputy director of the Central United Front, party secretary and executive vice-chairman of the All-China Federation of Industry and Commerce Xu Lejiang, director of the National Defense Science and Technology Bureau Zhang Kejun, deputy secretary of the Jiangxi Provincial Party Committee, and Li Bingjun, secretary of the Ganzhou Municipal Party Committee, participated in the investigation.
The enterprises that participated in the research activities included China Aerospace Science and Technology Group Co., Ltd. and other 8 military industry group companies, Hunan rare earth metal materials research institute and other 15 advantageous private enterprises.
During this period, the investigators visited the Memorial Garden of the Central Red Army Long March, commemorated the revolutionary martyrs, accepted the traditional education of the revolution, reviewed the difficult history of the Red Army's Long March period, investigated 7 enterprises and a testing center in Ganzhou City on the spot, held a special symposium, reached 8 cooperation projects, and conducted on-the-spot contracts.
At the special symposium of research activities, Ganzhou introduced its unique industrial advantages and introduced high-quality projects to the participating enterprises.
China Armament Industry Group Co., Ltd., China Steel Research and Technology Group Co., Ltd., Xi'an Tianhe Defense Technology Co., Ltd. and Jiangxi Jinli Permanent Magnetic Technology Co., Ltd. made a speech on behalf of the Military Industry Group Corporation, Minkou's state-owned enterprises, private enterprises and local enterprises, saying that it will continue to strengthen the needs of state-owned enterprises and advantageous private enterprises in Jiangxi Province and Ganzhou.
Through this research activity, we will further understand the unique industrial development advantages of Gannan Revolutionary Old District, clarify the key tasks of the economic and social development of the old revolutionary area at this stage, strengthen the belief of state-owned and private enterprises in serving the people and entrepreneurship, and play an important role in promoting the transformation, structural adjustment and people's well-being of the Central Soviet District of Gannan.
Beijing market supervision departments to carry out comprehensive law enforcement before the festival commodity prices are basically stable
BEIJING, Sept. 27 (Reporter Du Yan) In order to strengthen pre-holiday market supervision and law enforcement, the Beijing Municipal Bureau of Market Supervision inspects more than 2,000 various business entities on the eve of the National Day.
According to the inspection, the supply of daily necessities such as grain and oil, meat, fruits, vegetables and egg milk sold in the market is sufficient, the commodity price is basically stable, no serious illegal activities have been found, and the market business order is generally stable.
Today, the reporter learned from the Beijing Municipal Bureau of Market Supervision that the bureau carried out "comprehensive law enforcement inspection day" activities in the whole city, focusing on price, industrial and commercial, quality supervision, food and medicine, commerce and other full factors, all aspects of law enforcement inspections in key areas and key areas, and comprehensively standardized the market business order.
According to reports, five law enforcement teams such as price, industrial and commercial, quality supervision, food and medicine, and business of the Beijing Municipal Bureau of Market Supervision coordinated and closely cooperated, led by the heads of various law enforcement agencies to conduct joint law enforcement inspections of some randomly selected business entities.
During the inspection, law enforcement officials focused on price behavior, advertising, food safety, measurement standards, production safety systems and so on.
The market supervision bureaus of various districts have also simultaneously organized joint law enforcement inspections, a total of more than 1,600 law enforcement personnel to inspect more than 2,000 households in various types of business entities, and the inspection showed that the supply of daily necessities such as grain and oil, meat, fruits, vegetables, and egg milk sold in the market is sufficient, commodity prices are basically stable, business operators are able to abide by the law, no serious illegal activities have been found, and the market business order is generally stable.
The Beijing Municipal Bureau of Market Supervision said that during the National People's Day, it will continue to carry out inspections and inspections of the market, quickly deal with all kinds of market supervision issues in accordance with the law, and once the business violations reported by the public are verified, they will be dealt with seriously in accordance with the law, so as to effectively safeguard the legitimate rights and interests of consumers.
Confucius Institute of the Royal Cambodian Academy of Sciences "China in my heart" Chinese essay contest announced
With the theme of the 70th anniversary of New China, the "China in my heart" Chinese essay competition was announced and held at the Confucius Institute of the Royal Cambodian Academy of Sciences on the 26th.
Diplomats of the Chinese Embassy in the Republic of Cambodia, representatives of the Cambodian-Cambodia-Cambodian Council and President of the Jiangxi Chamber of Commerce in Cambodia Wei Siyu, presented the awards to the winning guests.
The competition lasted for two months and was aimed at Cambodian elementary school students, secondary school students (including specialized students) and university students (including social personnel).
Diplomats of the Chinese Embassy in Cambodia have issued certificates for Lin Weicai, the first prize winner of the university group, and Guo Lina, the first prize winner of the primary and secondary school group.
Zack Qing said that the entries are carried out separately according to the university group and the primary and secondary school groups, inviting the judging committee of Cambodia's senior Chinese-speaking experts, and through the initial evaluation, re-evaluation and final evaluation, the final selection of the first prize in the university group, 2 second prizes, 3 third prizes, and 10 excellent awards in the primary and secondary school; 1 first prize in primary and secondary schools, 5 second prizes, 10 third prizes, and 20 outstanding awards.
Lin Weicai, winner of the first prize in the university group, said that he has been learning Chinese for 15 years and has had a huge impact on himself.
Through the essay contest, it is to use words to describe the well-being brought by Cambodia and the traditional friendship between the two countries under the “Belt and Road”, hoping that the younger generation will continue to contribute to the China-Cambodia friendship.
The guests and the winners.
Guo Lina, the first prize winner of the primary and secondary school group, said that as an overseas Chinese, she has the opportunity to express the emotion of "China in the heart" and win the prize through the national language.
Organizers said that through the competition, it has not only created a positive atmosphere in China-Cambodia relations, but has also attracted more and more Cambodian students to learn Chinese and study in China.
The United Nations International Atomic Energy Agency (IAEA) released a report on the 26th pointed out that Iran has begun to use advanced centrifuges to accelerate the production of enriched uranium, in further violation of the 2015 nuclear agreement with world powers.
Iran's advanced centrifuges at Iran's Natanz Nuclear Facility are "accurating or ready to accumulate enriched uranium," the IAEA report said.
Since U.S. President Donald Trump’s withdrawal from the nuclear deal in May last year and imposed sanctions on Iran, Iran is gradually violating the restrictions of the 2015 nuclear agreement with major powers.
The agreement stipulates that Iran can only extract uranium with the first-generation IR-1 centrifuge.
Other signatories to the agreement, Britain, China, France, Germany and Russia, have been trying to salvage it, but Tehran has repeatedly accused Europe of not doing enough.
According to Japan's Kyodo News Agency, on the afternoon of the 25th local time, Japan's Foreign Minister Motegi held talks with Russian Foreign Minister Lavrov in the United States in New York, and confirmed that it will promote the conclusion and negotiation of a peace treaty, including the territorial issue of the four northern islands (Japan-Russia disputed islands (Japanese-Russian disputed islands, known as the "Southern Kuril Islands" in Russia), and the development of bilateral relations in a wide range of political and economic fields.
This is the first consultation with Russia as head of the peace treaty conclusion negotiations after Motegi took office as foreign minister.
Motegi told the Russian side that "including the promotion of common economic activities (on the four northern islands), we hope to effectively carry out consultations."
According to the Japanese government, there was no detailed discussion on territorial issues.
At the Japan-Russia summit meeting in December 2018, the foreign ministers of the two countries were confirmed to accelerate the negotiations.
At the meeting, the foreign ministers of the two countries welcomed the progress of consultations on common economic activities in the fields of tourism and garbage disposal.
Motegi expressed his expectation on the tourism pilot business scheduled to be carried out in October: "I hope it will be successfully implemented to promote the next step."
In addition, the meeting also confirmed that Lavrov will cooperate with the G20 foreign ministers' meeting in Nagoya to visit Japan in November.
Tuionetoa has been the new prime minister of Tonga.
On the 27th, the parliament of the South Pacific island of Tonga elected the current minister of finance and national planning, Bohiva Tuionetoa, as Tonga's new prime minister to replace former Prime Minister Akilisi Bohiva, who died earlier this month due to illness.
According to MATANGI, Tonga's main media outlet, Tonga's parliament is unicameral and consists of 26 MPs.
On the same day's parliamentary vote, Tui Onetoa received 23 votes, defeating rival Deputy Prime Minister and Minister of Infrastructure and Tourism Semizi Sika and was successfully elected.
Tonga is a constitutional monarchy with a segregated system of executive, legislative and judicial separation of powers.
Tuyonetoa was also required to accept the king's appointment.
Tonga’s next parliamentary elections will take place in 2021.
The women's volleyball team is expected to defend the World Cup ahead of schedule!
On the 27th, against the Dutch women's volleyball team, the Chinese team was pulled back to a city by its opponents in the case of winning two games in a row, and finally with 3:1, the Netherlands ushered in nine consecutive wins.
The schedule of the World Cup is nearing the end, although the defending is in sight, but in the face of Serbia, the Chinese women's volleyball team still can not be taken lightly.
In the first two games with the Netherlands, the performance of the Chinese women's volleyball team was as strong as ever, starting with 25:19 and 25:16 respectively, until the third game, the team suffered a setback.
The Dutch women's volleyball team strengthened the attack of the service in the case of backwardness, the Chinese team was hit, coupled with the girl's attack, the mistakes also began to increase, and finally with 21:25 was pulled back to a city by the opponent.
Lang Ping also pointed out in an interview after the game: â€œThe â€œthird game, because of a mistake, we sent about eight points.â€
Of course, the Dutch women's volleyball strength can not be underestimated, the Chinese women's volleyball also made a difficult preparation before the game, although losing a game, but everything is still in Lang Ping's control, â€œItâ€TMs very normal to win or lose with the strong team, and it’s very normal to play five games, so we told the players to focus,â€ Lang Ping said.
In the fourth game, the players actively adjusted the state, Zhang Changning in the offensive side of the fire, a single game to get 8 points, for the team to win a big contribution.
So far, there have been only two rounds left in the 11-round confrontation, although the Chinese women's volleyball team has touched the championship trophy with one hand, but in the game against the Netherlands, it has indeed sounded the alarm for the Chinese women's volleyball team: the more the key moment, the more you have to go all out.
In the other game on the 27th, the Russian and American women's volleyball volleyball teams filled 5 games, and the U.S. team failed to take all three points from their opponents, so that the Chinese women's volleyball team as long as they took all three points in the game against Serbia.
All kinds of situations are moving towards a favorable situation for China's women's volleyball team.
However, although the six main forces of the Serbian team are absent, this does not mean that they will easily give the three points to the Chinese team.
Judging from the current form of the standings, the Serbian team has basically missed medals, which means that they can be "lightly loaded" against the Chinese women's volleyball team, putting down the burden to attack the opponent, while the Chinese team is burdened with the pressure to win the championship, the state may rise and fall.
In addition, the replacement of the Serbian team is also not a "man-killing" lamb, previously with the Dutch team in a battle, the two sides of the war 5 games, the Serbian second team finally 3:2 reversed the Netherlands's main line-up, which shows the depth of its lineup thickness.
Before the start of the third stage of the game, Lang Ping also said that the two teams are not easy to deal with: â€œThe game in Osaka is going to be very difficult, we still have to, as always, seriously prepare.â€
Now the defending trumpet has been blown, the game has really entered the "white-hot stage".
When it comes to strength, the Chinese women's volleyball team is above the opponent, only the final critical moment, but also depends on whether the women's volleyball girls are able to play a normal level and release themselves on the court.
The University of Macau held the "2nd Macao Stem Cell Symposium" today (27), attracting more than 100 experts and scholars from countries and regions such as the United States, Singapore, the Mainland, Hong Kong and Macao to engage in "outbound stem cell" research, and share and discuss the latest technology and development of stem cell research with teachers and students of Macao universities.
Vice-Chancellor (Research) Ge Wei said that stem cell research is of medical value and is also one of the key scientific research projects of the University, and the seminar will help promote Macao's research and development in the field of stem cells.
Ge Wei said that as a leading international and comprehensive university on the west coast of the Guangdong-Hong Kong-Macao Greater Bay Area, the University is committed to building a talent training base and a scientific and technological innovation center on the west coast of the Greater Bay Area to contribute to the innovation and development of the Bay Area.
The seminar brought together stem cell research experts at home and abroad to share the latest technology, which will help promote stem cell research and development in Macao.
The dean of the University's School of Health Sciences said that in recent years the University has continuously strengthened scientific research, innovation and transformation, which has also significantly improved the number and quality of papers, and the University has also achieved fruitful results in stem cell research.
At the meeting, a group of well-known scholars shared the cutting-edge knowledge and cutting-edge technology of stem cell research.
Academician of the Chinese Academy of Sciences and dean of Yunnan Kunming University of Science and Technology primate transformation medical school Ji Weizhi, explained the use of 3D culture system to study monkeys and human embryos in vitro process and its molecular mechanism; the Chinese Academy of Sciences Shanghai Institute of Biochemical Cells researcher Jing Naihe, from a single-cell and molecular level to explain the spatial and temporal changes in the cell lineage of the mouse embryo after implantation of mouse embryos.
Chen Guokai, Vice-Dean (Research) of the College of Health Sciences of the University of Australia (Research), Chen Guokai, assistant dean, and Wang Chunming, Associate Professor of the Australian Institute of Traditional Chinese Medicine, also introduced their newly published important results.
The "Second Macao Stem Cell Symposium" was organized by the School of Health Sciences of the University of Macau, co-organized by the Chinese Medical Research Institute of the University of Macau and the National Key Laboratory of Chinese Quality Research of the Macao University of Science and Technology, with the participation of Chen Peng'an, acting senior manager of the Macao Science and Technology Development Fund.
There are a total of 11 academic reports, including embryonic development and tissue generation, translational medicine, mechanism research and translational applications of stem cells, biological materials and applications.
The atmosphere of the seminar was lively, and the participants actively discussed and shared the latest research and views on related technologies.
Xu said that the seminar provided a platform for exchanges and cooperation for stem cell experts in the Greater Bay Area and other regions, as well as providing students with valuable learning opportunities.
The awarding ceremony of the State Medal of the People's Republic of China and the National honorary title will be solemnly held.
With the approval of the Central Committee of the Communist Party of China, the awarding ceremony of the State Medal of the People's Republic of China and national honorary titles will be solemnly held in the Great Hall of the People on September 29 at 10 a.m.
The General Secretary of the Communist Party of China, the President of the People's Republic of China and the Chairman of the Central Military Commission, Xi Jinping will award the "Order of the Republic", "Order of Friendship" and the National Medal of Honor and make an important speech to the recipients of the State Medal and the National Medal of Honor.
With the approval of the Central Committee of the Communist Party of China, the awarding ceremony of the State Medal of the People's Republic of China and national honorary titles will be solemnly held in the Great Hall of the People in Beijing at 10:00 a.m. on September 29.
This is the â€œOrder of the Republicâ€ .
The "Order of the Republic" is based on red and gold, the body adopts elements such as the national coat of arms, the five-pointed star, the Yellow River, the Yangtze River, the peaks, peony and other elements, the chapter chain adopts elements such as the elements of Chinese knots, such as Ruyi, orchids, the overall use of cold pressed molding, silk inlaiding, enamel and other craftsmanship, symbolizing the huge contribution made by the medal winners for the construction and development of the Republic.
It's the "Medal of Friendship."
The "Order of Friendship" is based on gold and blue, the body adopts elements such as peace doves, the earth, handshake, lotus flowers and other elements, the chapter chain adopts elements such as Chinese knots, youth, peony, jade, orchids, etc. The overall use of traditional crafts such as yarn inlaid and enamel is hand-crafted, symbolizing the friendly unity and friendship between the Chinese people and the people of all countries.
This is a national honorary title medal.
The national honorary title medal is based on red and gold, the chapter body adopts five-stars, Tian'anmen, peony, peony, flags, light and other elements, the chapter chain adopts elements such as Chinese knots, flowers and other elements, the overall use of cold pressing molding, silk inlaiding, enamel and other craftsmanship, symbolizing the major contributions made by national honorary title winners in various industries in various industries, highlighting the demonstration and leading role, inspiring the people of all ethnic groups throughout the country.
The Central Radio and Television Station and Xinhua Network will broadcast the awarding ceremony live, and new media platforms such as People's Network, CCTV Network and China Network will be synchronized with new media platforms such as the People's Daily, the Xinhua News Agency client and the CCTV news client.
“For more than 70 years, NATO’s containment and defensive measures have been based on maintaining technical advantages,” Stoltenberg said in a speech at the U.S. Military Academy at West Point.
He said the times are changing.
Stoltenberg said: â€œWe are facing more and more competition.
Therefore, we should redouble our efforts now in order to be sure that no one will overtake us."
"Some of these new technologies have not been developed by NATO member states, but in authoritarian countries," he said.
Chinese companies are researching 5G networks.
Russia is developing an independent Internet and investing heavily in the development of next-generation weapons, such as hypersonic missiles.”
Stoltenberg said that NATO's future security “depends on the ability to understand, receive and apply the latest advanced technologies.”
On September 24th, "a ferry ticket to take me to see" love and disability activities were held in Changsha Orange Head, and more than 100 people with disabilities from Changsha were invited to board the Orange Star Cruise to enjoy the magnificent scenery of the Xiangjiang River and jointly celebrate the 70th anniversary of the founding of the People's Republic of China.
Most of the more than 100 people with disabilities who participated in the event boarded the cruise for the first time.
The 56-year-old Zhao Zhengang is a mutilated person who rarely goes out due to the inaccessibility of his feet.
He said, â€œToday for the first time on a cruise, close to enjoy the splendour of the Xiang River, feel the pulse of Changsha's development, the mood is very exciting, it's hard to forget."
The volunteers from Changsha Fukang Social Work Service Center and the Blue Sky Rescue Team provided meticulous services for people with disabilities.
Especially for people with severe physical disabilities, the volunteers will carry them up and down the cruise.
The relevant person in charge of Fukang Social Work Service Center said that in the past 70 years, with the support of the party and the government, the cause of persons with disabilities in Changsha City has continued to develop and progress, more and more people with disabilities have truly become participants, contributors and recipients of socio-economic development.
The Republic is about to celebrate the 70th anniversary, and the spotlights of the various media are shining, so that many images that we don't usually remember, glittering - it's them, for our glittering days to bring thermal energy and light sources.
However, if the hero walks around, it will also look as ordinary as me.
Yuan Long Ping, persevering in the study of rice, bred good seeds all over the world, so that more than a dozen billion people no longer have a hunger, great, this man is usually just like an old farmer who likes to walk in the field in the field; Nan Rendong, scrupulously to let China's "eye-to-eye" angry chief scientist, a person, a lifetime, only do one thing in a lifetime, in the mountains of Guizhou.
As long as they are immersed in the unspeakable and self-righteous, as long as they are immersed in the unspeakable business of outsiders, it is very easy for them to be happy, and they don't care about the name Lisso, the wealth and glory.
Just like in Jin Yong's novels, Shaolin Monastery's sweeping monk, although it has a shocking martial arts, it is not dazzling, and there is no joy and no sorrow.
Behind every "sweeping monk", every bare child's heart, there's a country behind me.
The responsibility of the country is not only carried on the shoulders of heroes, but also in the hands of hundreds of millions of people.
Once, the words of a female middle school student were turned crazy by netizens, "When the hero passes by, there must always be people sitting on the side of the road to applaud... I don't want to be a hero, I want to be a person who sits on the side of the road to applause."
In fact, there is no contradiction between a hero and applause to a hero.
People who applaud on the side of the road are also conveying heat and light, and they are also illuminators.
Ordinary like you like me, there are always some opportunities in my life, there are some moments, there is an accumulation, but also to shape the appearance of a hero.
Zou Bihua, an excellent judge in Shanghai, shouldered the burden of judicial reform, but at the annual meeting let the communication room teacher Fu take the stage to tell his own story, received and sent countless newspaper letters a year, from no mistake, "to do simple things, is not simple", Zou Bihua led the judges will applause to the "sweeping monk"-style old message.
It’s a pity between the heroes, and it’s a hero’s applause for another.
There are Shaolin Monasteries, Yuan Longping has a vast rice experimental field, Nan Rendong has the "eyes of the sky", Qin Yi has the stage, Zhou Ruchang has a pulpit... Whether you can be a hero, you don't just rely on your own efforts, you must have a good environment and a positive incentive mechanism.
For example, the "Chinese Eye" now seems to be a myth.
In the 1990s, China's scientific and technological community was still struggling, and the novelist Liu Cixin had not yet written "three bodies".
At that time, the best "eyes" were the one-sided caloriber radio telescope in the valley of the island of Puerto Rico in the United States - Arecibo, with a diameter of 350 meters, which is considered to be the "invincible" in the world.
At that time, the diameter of the Chinese radio telescope was less than one-tenth.
In Japan to enjoy world-class scientific research conditions and salary, Nan Rendong insisted on returning home, bringing back an almost crazy idea: to build a new generation of radio "big telescopes" in China to receive more information from outer space!
Has China spent a lot of money to play with the stars?
The motherland trusted Nan Rendong, and the "Heaven's Eye" project kicked off.
It took 12 years to select the site, and it took another 9 years to complete the project.
The 500-meter-caliber â€œHeavenly Eyeâ€ is opened, and China has made a great scientific project that has no precedent to follow and â€œunique in the world.â€
Therefore, the "eyes of the sky" are great, the South Rendong people are great, and the republic that is large and stands tall is remarkable.
With the country's trust and the goodwill of the people, the Nanrendong side has the opportunity to become the soul of the country.
There are young talents and white-haired heroes passing by, and there are people gently clapping on the side of the road, such a country is very beautiful and harmonious.
Garbage classification education into Jilin Kindergarten environmental protection concept starting from the doll
On the 27th, a kindergarten in Jilin City, Jilin Province carried out a garbage classification education class to teach young children to distinguish recyclable garbage and other types of garbage.
It is reported that this is the first time that garbage classification has entered the local early childhood education classroom.
A few days ago, the nine departments of Jilin Province jointly issued the work plan for promoting the classification and disposal of prefecture-level urban domestic waste in Jilin Province.
In 2019, on the basis of the compulsory classification of domestic waste in Changchun City, the province decided to carry out the classification of domestic waste in prefecture-level cities.
The city of Jilin is one of them.
Through this event, we hope to realize the effect of driving families with young children and driving the society in kindergarten, and advocate the concept of environmental protection.
Liu Lijuan, executive director of the International Kindergarten who organized the event, said.
On the same day, the director read the environmental protection proposal and hoped that the classification of garbage would start with the children.
After the children performed the "low-carbon babe" dance, they set up a small game of garbage classification in groups.
The instructor also issued “recyclable” and “other garbage” labels, advising the children to stick the label to the trash when they go home and record small videos.
Liu Lijuan introduced that the kindergarten has always advocated the concept of low-carbon and green environmental protection, and has regularly opened environmental protection lecture halls.
There are also taxable garbage bins set up at the garbage disposal site in the park, which is marked with the placement category.
The teacher teaches the children what can be recycled 苍雁
According to preliminary statistics, the amount of urban domestic garbage generated in Jilin Province in 2018 was about 5,465,22 million tons, all of which entered the domestic waste disposal site for processing.
Among them, the sanitary landfill is 3.2929 million tons, the incineration is 2.0923 million tons, and the comprehensive utilization process is 80,100 tons.
After many years of hard work, all the cities and counties in the province have the ability to deal with the harmless treatment of domestic waste.
Jilin Province has been issued to promote prefecture-level municipal domestic waste classification and disposal work plan, clearly requires in-depth garbage classification into schools, teaching materials, into the classroom and other activities, through the creation of garbage classification songs, songs, cartoons, micro-video and other works, to strengthen the interaction between students and parents, to achieve the effect of "educating a child, affecting a family, driving a community, cultivating a new generation".
According to data released by Mazda on September 27, the global sales in August were 117,715 units.
Sales in China fell by 21% due to the impact of insufficient delivery of new cars and the reduction in price cuts.
Japan's domestic sales were reduced by 6%, and there was limited demand for the last bus before consumption tax increases in October.
Mazda sold 17,729 vehicles in China in August.
August 2018 also decreased by 13% from the previous year, and sales continued to decrease.
China's main SUV "CX-4" sales decreased by 14%.
The "CX-4" was listed in 2016 so far in the past for a long time, and the effect of the new car has declined.
Due to the long-term point of view to improve the brand value of the strategy to reduce the price reduction, it is also reported to have a great impact on the sales volume.
Mazda's sales in the United States increased by 7% year-on-year, reaching 27,482 units after a 14-month increase.
In August, the seller's business day was one day more than the previous year, coupled with "increased publicity and other promotional activities" ( Mazda), which led to an increase in the sales volume of the SUV "CX-5".
Japan's domestic sales fell 6% to 14,422 units.
The company said that the emergency rush before the tax increase "doesn't reach the level of the last (2014)."
There has been a reduction in sales of small cars such as “Demio”.
Jacques Chirac's political legacies
On the 26th local time, former French President Jacques Chirac passed away at the age of 86.
At a time when the world is in the midst of unprecedented changes in the past year, many of the political legacies left by the French politician when he came to power are still worthy of our praise.
Chirac served as President of France for 12 years in a very humiliating manner.
He not only inherited the diplomatic spirit of De Gaullism's independent and independent diplomacy, but also firmly supported European integration, and was a representative of the "European dream".
At the same time, he also strongly advocates multi-polarization and multilateralism in the world, and is a politician with a strategic vision.
For this reason, the French media described him as "France's outstanding representative on the world stage".
One of Chirac’s relish political decisions was his opposition to the U.S.-led war in Iraq.
Under his leadership, France joined hands with Germany to withstand the pressure of the United States and was at the forefront of the anti-war.
A year after the outbreak of the war, he predicted that the war in Iraq would exacerbate terrorist activities and make the world even more dangerous.
Later it turned out that Chirac’s warning was correct.
At a time when Europe's integration is raging and the unilateralism of the United States is becoming more and more prominent, Chirac's strategic thinking and choices in international politics and global affairs undoubtedly have a strong inspirational significance.
Chirac is also a French politician who makes the Chinese feel familiar and affectionate.
He is one of the promoters and creators of the "Golden Decade" of Sino-French relations, and after being first elected president of France in 1995, he promoted the rapid development of Sino-French relations with the strategic vision of politicians.
In 2004, China and France established a comprehensive strategic partnership, and China-France bilateral exchanges entered a completely new stage.
During Chirac's administration, the bilateral trade volume between China and France has grown rapidly, and the cooperation between the two countries in various fields such as aviation, nuclear energy and railway transportation has made breakthrough progress.
The China-France Cultural Year initiated by Chirac has created a completely new model of cultural exchange in the history of China and France.
Chirac’s lifelong love for Chinese culture is particularly impressive.
It is understood that according to his Chinese diplomat, Chirac can carry some poems of Li Bai and Du Fu, and can even accurately judge the historical age of Chinese bronzes.
“I didn’t really go to Egypt without looking at the pyramids, and I didn’t really go to China without looking at Qin” – this quote comes from Chirac.
In an interview with the Xinhua News Agency, Chirac said: "The West is concerned about China's political and social development, the ecological problems caused by China's economic growth, and China's political position in the world.
I have full confidence in China.
I believe that China is a country with a long history of civilization, and its experience is enough to help it establish concepts and values to achieve harmonious development and assume its responsibilities on the world stage for a long time.”
I also believe that China's rejuvenation will bring new creative vitality to the world's culture and enrich the world's culture.
The Sith people have gone, but Chirac's political legacies and apocalypses to the world will endure.
With the theme of "counting light valleys and wisdom to enjoy the future", the "7th China Computer Society's Big Data Academic Conference" was opened in Wuhan on the 27th, with nearly a thousand experts, scholars and industry leaders in the field of big data research, paying attention to big data hot research issues and interpreting the technological progress of big data in the era of artificial intelligence.
Hosted by the Chinese Computer Society (CCF) and co-hosted by the CCF Big Data Expert Committee and Huazhong University of Science and Technology, the conference organized 5 invited reports and 188 forum reports, and set up 33 thematic technology and industry sub-forums to exchange and discuss the research results of big data basic theory, big data education, big data visualization, big data finance and science and technology.
The CCF big data academic conference to strengthen contacts and exchanges between domestic and foreign scholars engaged in the field of big data, to promote multi-disciplinary cross-integration and the development of the big data industry for the purpose, after seven sessions, it has developed into a big data academic conference based on the exchange of scientific research results and the most influential in the country, and the content of the conference extends to basic theory, technical application and other fields.
Members of the Legislative Council of the Hong Kong Special Administrative Region have signed a petition against the United States Hong Kong-related bill.
On the 27th, some established members of the Legislative Council of the Hong Kong Special Administrative Region issued a joint statement expressing their strong opposition to the passage of the Hong Kong Human Rights and Democracy Act of 2019.
According to the statement co-signed by the 40 established MPs, Hong Kong's current rights are vested in the Basic Law of the Hong Kong Special Administrative Region, including maintaining the status of a free trade port and a separate customs territory, signing and implementing bilateral and multilateral agreements with different countries and regions around the world in different fields such as economy, finance, shipping, trade, trade, communication, tourism, culture and sports.
These rights are not granted by any foreign government or legislature.
Hong Kong has always strictly adhered to international agreements, international rules, laws and business ethics, traded with different countries and regions, and participated in cooperation in many related fields.
The statement pointed out that it is not necessary for the Foreign Affairs Committees of the U.S. Senate and House of Representatives to pass the relevant bill, but only to respond to the call of their agents, as a means of crudely interfering in Hong Kong's internal affairs and gaining political leverage for their agents in Hong Kong.
Formed lawmakers expressed their deep regret at the U.S. move and strongly objected.
The statement pointed out that Hong Kong is an important trading partner of the United States and the source of the largest trade surplus.
Hong Kong's excellent rule of rule of law, fair and free business environment and clean society make it a good place for American businessmen to do business.
If the United States adopts this bill, in addition to cracking down on the interests of Hong Kong and the United States itself, it will also aggravate Sino-US relations, without any benefit and harm to others.
The statement said that Hong Kong will, as always, unswervingly implement the principle of "one country, two systems", continue to enjoy the rights enshrined in the Basic Law, and earnestly fulfill its obligations.
Whether in the past, the present or the future, Hong Kong will continue to make its due contribution to the international community and international trade.
According to the European Times on the 26th, the two houses of the French parliament will discuss immigration policy reform next week.
French President Emmanuel Emmanuel Emmanuel Macron recently claimed that France cannot “accept everyone”, but at the same time strives to “receive it properly.”
According to the report, Macron is trying to find a compromise route on immigration affairs to slow the impact of the upcoming debate.
Recently, Macron said in an interview on the sidelines of the general debate of the United Nations General Assembly in New York that he hopes to have a real "two-pronged" solution on immigration policy to find a balance between humanitarianism and efficiency.
â€œFrance canâ€TMt accept everyone if it wants to be able to take in (immigrants) properly,â€ Macron said.
Macron listed four priorities for immigration policy: granting asylum status to refugees in need of protection as soon as possible; more efficient promotion of integration of migrants; reception and protection of all migrants entering French territory; and more efficient resettlement of those who enter France illegally and who are unsuitable to stay.
Whether illegal immigrants should be protected by the "National Medical Assistance" (AME) system has been the most discussed topic from all walks of life.
Macron said that he hoped to "assess" the system, but did not remove it, but put some restrictions on it.
After Macron's remarks, the far-right "National Alliance" leader Le Pen tweeted that Macron's statement was "empty talk".
The right-of-the-thrigo-residence and president of the right-leaning Republican party also said that immigration policies should be discussed in a “mitative” but “face-to-reality” way, indirectly criticizing Macron.
Valau, a member of parliament for the left-wing Socialist Party, argued that France should “accept more and better” on immigration, and criticized Macron for “manipulating” the issue.
One year after the enactment of the new asylum and immigration law, it has led to differences of opinion within the ruling party, but at the same time failed to appease right-wing opposition parties.
In the next general election of 2022, the issue of immigration policy will once again become the focus of attacks on the far right, and Macron needs to make a difference on this issue, but it will also run the risk of irritating those on the left wing within the ruling party.
According to reports, the lower house of the French National Assembly will debate immigration policy on September 30, and the Senate will debate from October 2.
There are indications that China's A-shares are ushering in a "repurchase tide", and many listed companies have come up with "real gold and silver" to repurchase the company's shares.
According to financial data service provider Oriental Fortune statistics, as of the 27th, the total amount of A-share listed company repurchase in 2019 has more than 100 billion yuan (RMB, the same below), which is far higher than the data of the same period in previous years, setting a record high in the number of A-share stock repurchasing funds.
In this regard, Xu Yang, chairman of Shanghai Mei Kerong Information Consulting Co., Ltd., said that the overall valuation of the A-share market this year is relatively low, repurchasing shares at a relatively low price, which is conducive to listed companies to improve the efficiency of the use of funds, which also reflects the willingness of listed companies to actively manage their market value and abundant cash flow, which is conducive to boosting investor confidence.
In addition, the continuous improvement of the share repurchase system has also promoted listed companies to actively carry out share repurchases.
For example, at the beginning of this year, the Shanghai Stock Exchange and the Shenzhen Stock Exchange issued the implementation rules for repurchasing shares of listed companies, which provided detailed share repurchase norms and guidelines for listed companies.
According to media statistics, since the beginning of this year, the listed companies that have implemented the repurchase plan are mainly concentrated in the infrastructure industry, the real estate industry, the information technology industry and the electronic equipment manufacturing industry.
In addition, from the point of view of repurchase payments, there have been six listed companies repurchased more than 1 billion yuan this year.
Among them, in the first place is Yili shares, and its repurchase amount is more than 5 billion yuan.
What is the impact of repurchasing shares of listed companies on the market?
Zhao Xijun, vice dean of the School of Finance and Finance of Renmin University of China, said in an interview with the China News Agency that on the one hand, the repurchase shows that listed companies have strong economic strength and a better financial situation, have the ability to maintain the stability of the stock price and give investors confidence; on the other hand, it also shows that listed companies and their controlling shareholders are responsible to the company, the market is responsible and responsible for investors.
The former is based on the company's good business performance, and the latter requires listed companies and their controlling shareholders to have high quality.
For the capital market, this is the core basic elements.
The repurchasing of shares by listed companies is conducive to boosting investor confidence and supporting the stock prices of listed companies.
According to the Oriental Securities Research Report, according to the expected number of share repurchases set by A-share listed companies as a whole since the beginning of this year, as well as the average price of repurchased shares, the incremental funds brought by repurchased shares for the A-share market this year are expected to exceed 150 billion yuan.
It took nearly two months, and the restoration of the large-scale mural of the Tiangong Palace in Tianjin, a national key cultural protection unit, was announced on the 26th and will be re-opened to the public during the National Day this year.
"Temperance Map" is a large-scale traditional mural that comprehensively reflects the life of Mazu.
With the approval of the relevant state departments, it was drawn from 1991 to 1994 by Cai Changkui, the former director of the Tianjin Folklore Museum ( Tin Hau Palace).
It is understood that this mural was painted on the south and north palace walls of Tiangong, with a total length of 32 meters and a height of 2.6 meters, divided into upper and lower two parts, with more than 30 stories such as giving birth, crossing the sea by seat, and ascension to heaven, 358 characters have recreated the life and deeds of Mazu.
In recent years, in recent years, it has been rainy in Tianjin in the summer and dry in the winter, which has led to a rupture of murals, and the ruptured part accounts for 60% of the entire mural area.
In order to protect and salvage the mural murals, the ancient cultural street management committee of Nankai District of Tianjin City and the Tin Hau Palace have launched the restoration project of frescoes in the Tin Hau Temple and the temple.
The restoration project was led by Cai Changkui and invited four famous national painters to participate.
The restoration work is based on the principle of â€œreplicating the old as oldâ€ , and at the same time, the original murals have been adjusted for the local content, and the places where the murals were originally not perfect have been repaired.
In the restoration, we have also innovated and experimented with colors, materials, pen and ink and so on.
After the restoration, the style, spirituality, spiritual and artistic style of the original murals were maintained.
Tin Hau Palace was built in 1326, formerly known as Tianfei Palace, commonly known as the Mother's Palace, has been rebuilt many times, it is the oldest building group in the urban area of Tianjin, and is also one of the earliest mazu temples in China's extant age.
On September 25, Beijing Daxing International Airport's operation ceremony was grandly held.
Beijing Daxing International Airport terminal's styling meaning "Phoenix wings", known as the "new world seven wonders" first.
At present, Beijing Capital International Airport has been overloaded, carrying more than 100 million passengers last year, becoming the world's second airport with an annual passenger throughput of more than 100 million after the Atlanta airport in the United States.
It is estimated that by 2022, the passenger throughput of Beijing Daxing International Airport will reach 45 million passengers, accounting for 20% of international flights; by 2025, passenger throughput will reach 72 million, and the proportion of international flights is expected to reach 30%.
As the â€œnew national gateâ€ , how cool is it?
Beijing Daxing International Airport is located between Beijing Daxing District and Guangyang District of Langfang City in Hebei Province, with a straight-line distance of 46 kilometers from Tian'anmen, which is currently the world's largest newly built airport.
The surface projection area of the roof cover steel structure of its terminal has an area of 180,000 square meters, with the size of 25 standard football fields.
Beijing Daxing International Airport is the world's first terminal with two arrivals and two departures - F1-F4 is international arrivals, domestic arrivals, domestic departures and international departures.
The double-decker bridge connecting the high-speed high-speed and the airport outside the terminal, respectively, corresponds to the terminal F3 and F4 - the international departure level, and the two floors of domestic departure can be.
The first flight of Beijing Daxing International Airport ushered in the era of Beijing's "dual airport".
The new airport is positioned as a large-scale international aviation hub, a new power source for the development of the country, and the Beijing-Tianjin-Hebei regional integrated transportation hub that supports the construction of the Xiong'an New Area, and as of now, a total of 66 airlines intend to enter Beijing Daxing International Airport, including 20 domestic airlines, 46 Hong Kong, Macao and Taiwan regional and foreign airlines.
In the winter and spring seasons of 2019, Beijing Daxing International Airport is expected to open 116 routes, including 101 domestic routes and 15 international routes; covering 112 destinations around the world, including 97 domestic destinations and 15 international destinations.
This has formed a "dual hub" airport pattern with coordinated development, moderate competition and international first-class competitiveness, which not only alleviates the operating pressure of  saturation capacity of the capital airport, but also can better meet the urgent need for the rapid growth of air transport in Beijing and surrounding areas, and effectively enhance the international competitiveness of China's civil aviation industry.
In order to ensure efficiency and quality, Beijing Daxing International Airport gives full consideration to the relationship between the geographical location, the airport and the surrounding airspace and the operating environment. For the first time, the airport's runway adopts the "universal-oriented" layout for the first time, adopts the world's largest air traffic management automation system, and establishes China's largest terminal control area, which can maximize the efficiency of aviation operations.
For the first time, domestic airports of this scale use localized baggage automatic processing and information management systems, using innovative baggage transfer modes to improve the efficiency of baggage system processing.
Beijing Daxing International Airport's first flight indicates that the phoenix spreads its wings.
It has created more than 40 international and domestic first new airports with a localization rate of more than 98%, which will have a direct and indirect economic impact on the industries in the surrounding areas and inject vitality into Beijing's economic development.
The garrison is tentatively scheduled to hold a general meeting in November to reduce the party's age to the age of 16.
The rabble tentatively held a central congress in early November to amend the party constitution to the age of admission to the party until the age of 16.
With the National People's Congress lowering the voting age for the general election, the MHOC announced that the 66th Central Committee Congress, which will be held this year, put forward a proposal to amend the party's constitution, which includes lowering the age to join the party, from the current age of 18 to 16.
MCA President Datuk Seri Wei Jiaxiang said that the MCA Central Committee was originally scheduled to hold a central congress on November 2 and 3 this year, but due to the by-election of the by-election for the National Assembly seat in Tanjung Piai, the date of the congress may be changed.
He said that since the election commission will meet only on October 1 to finalize the by-election nomination day and polling day for the Tanjung Piai presidency, they will meet the next day, October 2, to discuss whether to change the date of this year's Central Congress.
He also explained that the purpose of yesterday's (26th) meeting of the Central Committee was aimed at finalizing the date of the congress and the amendment of the party constitution, but it just coincided with the death of Datuk Mohamad, a member of parliament of the Indigenous Solidarity Party of Tanjung Piai, and thus joined the agenda of the by-election of the national seat.
Shandong original Shouguang County Party Committee Secretary Wang Bixiang - Qiang County Fumin Akihito-Xinhua.com
Wang Boxiang, Shandong Shouguang, was born in February 1943, participated in the work in 1967, and successively served as the party secretary of the township party committee, the secretary of the county party committee, the mayor and other positions.
In 1986, Wang Boxiang served as the party secretary of Shouguang County in Shandong Province, when Shouguang was the poor county of Weifang.
In the five years of Shou Guang's tenure, Wang Boxiang focused on doing three things with the hearts of the people: one is to promote the industrialization of vegetables; the other is to develop Shoubei saline beach; the third is to lay the foundation for the transformation of the industry, so that Shouguang people have raised their pockets and raised their waistboards since then.
Shouguang farmers have a tradition of planting vegetables, and there are also lessons of growing vegetables.
In the early 1980's, Shouguang's vegetable harvest could not be sold and rotted in the ground.
Wang Baixiang's research found that the key to catching vegetables is to do a good job in circulation.
Shouguang took the lead in building a vegetable wholesale market, opening the prelude to the development of the market economy.
Party members and cadres should take the lead, screw up, and bear all the losses in the county.
In 1989, with the support of Wang Boxiang, 17 party members such as Sanyuan Zhucun Wang Leyi set up 17 winter-warming vegetable greenhouses, when the village spewed 17 "20,000 households".
Subsequently, a promotion group was set up in the prefecture, and under the mobilization of Wang Boxiang, Wang Leyi toured and guided in various townships; more than 5,000 vegetable greenhouses were promoted in the first year, after which vegetable greenhouses were pushed to the whole county and even to the whole county and even the whole country.
For thousands of thousands of years, the 1.6 million acres of land in Shoubei, in addition to the saline and alkali beaches, are shallow beaches.
The life of the local people is very difficult.
Shounan has a vegetable greenhouse, what to do?
Wang Boxiang organized hundreds of thousands of people to engage in conference battles, encamped on deserted alkali beaches for 40 or 50 days.
The leading cadres in the county ate and ate and lived on the construction site, with migrant workers like trolleys, the people saw that they all stretched their thumbs and admired their hearts... At that time, Shoubei developed 150,000 acres of shrimp ponds, 200,000 acres of salt fields, 600,000 acres of cotton fields, and developed a "corner pot" on the saline beach.
In July 1986, for the first time, he participated in the Weifang City Industrial Conference as a county party secretary.
During the meeting, issued a "Weifang 12 counties of urban industrial and economic digital comparison table", at first glance, the total industrial output value, Shouguang is not bad, ranked fourth.
However, if the original salt is removed, Shouguang's pure industrial output value is only 119 million yuan, ranking third to the bottom.
With more than 70 people's learning groups, Wang Boxiang ran to the field to "change their minds".
In less than a year, the whole county invested 150 million yuan and went to 77 projects.
Since then, it has been organized every year to Shenzhen, Dongguan and Shanghai and other places.
There is a shortage of enterprises and a shortage of entrepreneurs.
Wang Boxiang held a special meeting: in the whole county to openly select the manager of the factory manager, 40 "careful people" stood out and were pushed into the front line of the industry.
In 1991, Shouguang entered the ranks of the country's top 100 counties, and Wang Beixiang was transferred to Weifang as the deputy mayor of Weifang City.
What he left behind is more than 200 thousand vegetable greenhouses, 1.2 million acres of cotton fields, salt fields and shrimp ponds, 4854 enterprises, and more than 100,000 â€œmillion households â€œmillion householdsâ€ , which is a cadre team recognized by the people.
On September 26, local time, State Councilor and Foreign Minister Wang Yi presided over the Foreign Ministers' Meeting between China and the African Member States of the Security Council at United Nations Headquarters in New York.
Foreign Minister Tano of Côte d'Ivoire, Foreign Minister of Equatorial Guinea Oyono, South African Foreign Minister Pandora Pandora and Foreign Minister Carla and Tunisian Foreign Minister Jesinawi attended the meeting.
Wang Yi put forward a four-point proposal to strengthen cooperation between the two sides in the Security Council.
First of all, by uniting strength.
The biggest challenge in the current international situation is unilateralism, and the direct consequence is that the basic norms governing international relations have been challenged, and the role of the United Nations has been affected, harming the interests of the vast number of developing countries and small and medium-sized countries, including African countries.
To deal with this challenge, it is necessary for Central and Africa to stand hand in hand and side by side in order to be united.
In the Security Council, the three African countries are speaking with one voice, focusing not just three votes, but the entire African continent.
China and Africa will not only stand with four votes, but will lead other countries to follow suit and influence and shape the agenda of the Security Council.
Since the beginning of 2018, China has established a "3+1" coordination mechanism with African members of the Security Council, which should make full use of this coordination mechanism.
The second is to solve disputes through consultation.
The Chinese side has always advocated the political settlement of hot-spot issues. Africa has a good tradition of consultation, as well as the successful mediation experience of African regional and subregional organizations.
Many of the complex problems on the Council's agenda, particularly the hot spots in Africa, are largely the root causes of colonialism, and some are directly related to external factors.
We should jointly make good use of Chapter VI of the Charter of the United Nations and give full play to the role of the United Nations in good offices and mediation.
The third is self-reliance.
African countries and people know Africa's problems best, and Africa also has the ability and wisdom to solve their own problems.
The Security Council's handling of Africa's hot-spot issues should focus on listening and respecting Africa's wishes, should play the role of regional and subregional organizations, and should encourage and support endogenous solutions from Africa.
The Chinese side is willing to strengthen coordination with the African side and firmly promote the capacity-building of Africa's autonomous peace operations.
Fourth, it is based on development.
China and the vast majority of African countries are developing countries, and we must put economic and social development first and support each other's development path.
China is willing to closely align the Belt and Road Initiative with the African Union's 2063 Agenda, the United Nations 2030 Agenda for Sustainable Development and the development strategies of African countries to help African countries enhance their development capabilities and eliminate the root causes of conflict.
We must jointly push the United Nations to increase investment in Africa's development.
The Ebola outbreak in the Democratic Republic of the Congo (DRC) has made and will continue to make every effort to provide human and material assistance within its capacity, and is willing to coordinate actions with African countries, mobilize the United Nations and the World Health Organization to increase their assistance, and give full play to the role of the United Nations Stabilization Mission in the Democratic Republic of the Congo (DRC).
The neonatology and other relays to save small lives.
It's scary!
The two-year-old pregnant mother had an early attack on the way to the hospital, a 32-year-old premature baby couldn't wait to be born on his father's car co-pilot.
Fortunately, obstetricians and neonatologists dealt with them in a timely manner, and the relay saved this small life.
Coincidentally, on the 19th, 20th and 21st, the obstetrics and neonatology department of Hubei Provincial Maternal and Child Health Hospital received 3 premature babies born on the road for three consecutive days, the other two of which were born in 120 emergency vehicles, all of which were 29-week-old premature babies.
Ms. Cheng is a second-born mother, September 19 at 7 o'clock in the morning, she felt a little pain, thinking that she has been pregnant for 32 weeks, and the first baby is also premature, she packed up the waiting items, ready to go to the hospital after taking a bath.
At 9:30 p.m., Ms. Cheng packed up and let her husband drive from Xu Dong’s home to the hospital.
I didn't expect that the car had just left the house, and the baby couldn't wait to be born on his father's co-pilot.
After 20 minutes, Ms. Cheng and the baby finally arrived at the Obstetrics and Gynecology Building of Hubei Provincial Maternal and Child Health Hospital.
The security guard of the hospital saw the panicked couple and the baby, and immediately informed the maternity ward, and the deputy chief physician Zhang Huan and other four doctors and midwife Liu Yanyan rushed downstairs with delivery bags and umbilical cord plates.
"At that time, the mother was half lying on the car co-driver, with amniotic water and blood under her, and a baby boy was next to him, also associated with an umbilical cord."
Zhang Huan asked to know that the baby is a 32-year-old premature baby, the parents on the road did not have the time to cover the package for the child, the morning of the early autumn there was already cool, he froze pale skin, did not cry, the extremity of the extremities.
Liu Yanyan quickly went to the co-pilot to deal with the umbilical cord for the baby's umbilical cord, Zhang Huan drilled into it from the cab, quickly opened the delivery bag, with the inside of the therapeutic towel and the bag of the package for the child to pack a few layers of warmth, and to clean the respiratory tract for the newborn (pictured), and then carried the baby to the 12th floor of the neonatal department.
When the neonatologist learned of the news, he immediately rushed to the nurse's station to rescue the premature baby.
At that time, the baby's violet face, suffocation and lack of oxygen, the doctor immediately gave him a tracheal intubation, less than a minute, the baby to restore the heartbeat, the skin color is also gradually restored rosy, the recovery was successful.
After being admitted to the hospital, the 32-year-old baby was put on an invasive ventilator, after continuous rescue, breathing was stable, and the plane was successfully withdrawn the next day.
After a week of treatment, the baby's vital signs are stable, his breathing is smooth, and a small amount of breastfeeding has begun.
Coincidentally, on the 19th, the 20th and 21st, the obstetrics and neonatology department of the hospital received 3 premature babies born on the road for three consecutive days, the other two were born in 120 emergency vehicles, all 29 weeks of premature babies, and are currently actively treated in the neonatology department.
Sun Guoqiang, director of the obstetrics department of the provincial maternal and child health center, said that in recent years, the province's mothers and children have treated a large number of babies who were born on the subway and in a private car, which may threaten the safety of mothers and children.
Director Sun reminded that pregnant mothers should come to the hospital as soon as they experience abdominal pain, broken water, see red and other phenomena.
In the case at home or on the road, the mother should be as flat as possible, you can put a blanket under your hips, so as to prevent the baby from hitting the ground after delivery, the child should be warm immediately after delivery, as soon as possible to be sent to the hospital.
Việt Nam-Singapore Aviation Technology Corporation Officially Opens
VSTEA's establishment is one of the refinements of the memorandum of cooperation signed in April 2018 between VAECO and ST Engineering Aerospace, which marks the launch of Vietnam's first aircraft equipment maintenance and repair joint venture.
Việt Nam and two leading aviation technology companies from Vietnam and Singapore have cooperated to provide aircraft equipment maintenance and repair services to domestic and foreign airlines.
Yang Zhicheng, general manager of Vietnam Airlines, said that ST Engineering Aerospace, the company's joint partner, is the world's largest and highest-level aircraft maintenance group.
Vietnam Airlines believes that this cooperation will bring benefits to the two sides and is also the beginning of the promising cooperation between the two sides in the future.
Lim Serh Ghee, president of ST Engineering Aerospace, said that Vi��t Vietnam Airlines and ST Engineering’s shared rich experience will help the associated companies to be able to provide maintenance and repair services at the international level and contribute to the flight safety of various airlines.
The birth of VSTEA has enabled Vietnam Airlines to join the huge aircraft equipment maintenance and repair market.
At the same time, there is a great opportunity to contact modern technology and train senior aviation technicians.
In order to better meet the sustainable development needs of Vietnam's aviation industry.
The research shows that the manufacturing industry has become the focus of the world's major countries
A few days ago, the national intellectual property operation public service platform released the "global manufacturing innovation index white paper" in Hefei, Anhui.
The white paper shows that the manufacturing industry has become the focus of attention of major countries around the world.
This is the reporter's understanding at the "2019 World Manufacturing Conference Intellectual Property Operation and Protection Forum" held in the "2019 World Manufacturing Conference Intellectual Property Operation and Protection Forum".
The forum focused on intellectual property rights to help China's manufacturing upgrade, from the macro level of policy interpretation and the micro perspective of corporate practice, comprehensively explore innovative measures of intellectual property operation and protection in the manufacturing sector, in-depth discussion on the hot topic of intellectual property protection in the manufacturing industry, continue to improve the ability of high-quality use of intellectual property rights, and accelerate the construction of the advantages of intelligent upgrading in the manufacturing industry.
The forum invited experts from the State Intellectual Property Office, scholars of the Chinese Academy of Sciences and relevant domestic and foreign industry organizations and professional research institutions to share their experiences and suggestions on how to strengthen the protection of intellectual property rights and promote the use of intellectual property rights.
At the forum, the Anhui Provincial Market Supervision and Administration Bureau issued the "Princitary Navigation Innovation and Development Quality Analysis and Evaluation" report, according to the calculation results of the patent navigation regional innovation and high-quality development index, the 2018 patent navigation regional innovation high-quality development index ranked eighth in the country's 31 provinces and cities, and the innovation factor agglomeration index ranked fourth in the country.
The forum was hosted by the Anhui Provincial People's Government and co-hosted by the Anhui Provincial Market Supervision and Administration Bureau, the national public service platform for intellectual property operation and the China Intellectual Property Development Alliance.
The 2019 Chinese Open Today, a number of Olympic champions participated in the opening ceremony.
A large number of Olympic champions will participate in the opening ceremony, and the audience will sing "me and my motherland" with the young choir
The main event of the 2019 China Open will be officially opened today at the National Tennis Center, and the organizing committee will hold a short and solemn opening ceremony before the first match of the evening, and a number of Olympic champions and luminaries in the sports world will gather at the Diamond Court to participate in the opening ceremony guests and spectators who will sing "me and my motherland" with the children of the youth choir.
In the next nine days, including the 11th Golden Week, Beijing will once again usher in a tennis craze, and the National Tennis Center will become a good place for fans for the holidays.
Since its establishment in 2004, the China Open has gone through 15 spring and autumn, and this is the 16th time this year.
In this year, the total award amount of the net competition also reached a new record high, reaching 11.16 million U.S. dollars.
Among them, the women's crown game total bonus of 7.64 million U.S. dollars, compared with the Indian Wells, Miami, the last two women's singles competition is 96, while the net is 60 signatures, so for the players, the network competition is more "cost-effective".
The total prize money of the men's ATP 500 is an all-time high, rising from $3.4 million last year to $3.52 million, and the number of prizes continues to lead the ATP 500, while the ATP 500 in the same week's total prize money is about 2 million U.S. dollars.
There will be a short and grand opening ceremony ahead of the first game scheduled at Central Court tonight.
Participating in tonight's opening ceremony, in addition to leaders and some players, there will also be ten leaders in various fields from China's sports industry, including Olympic champions and world champions.
After the opening ceremony, the first battle of the Central Stadium is a WTA first-round event, played by China's Jinhua Peng Shuai against Russia's Kasakina, and the next second match is American rookie Sophia Kenning's challenge to the 2015 Chinese Open women's singles champion Muguraza.
The most beautiful unmarried princess in the world!
According to the British "Metro News" news, Buckingham Palace announced on the 26th that British Princess Beatrice and Mozi are engaged.
Mozi is a 34-year-old Italian billionaire who specializes in real estate development.
Beatrice will marry the real estate tycoon next year (2020).
Princess Beatrice is the granddaughter of Queen Elizabeth II, the eldest daughter of Prince Andrew and her ex-wife, Sarah Ferguson, Duchess of York, ranking fifth in the order of heirs to the British throne and known as "the most beautiful unmarriitted princess in the world".
“We are very pleased to announce that Princess Beatrice and Monsieur Motzi are engaged,” the Duchess of York said on the social network on the 26th, saying: “We are very pleased to announce that Princess Beatrice and Mr Mozi are engaged.”
The British side said that the two were engaged in Italy earlier this month.
The engagement was filmed by Beatrice's sister, Eugenie.
In a statement, they said we are very pleased to share the news of their engagement.
We’re so excited that we’re able to embark on a journey together, and we can’t wait to get married.
We have many similar interests and ideas that will make us more stable, full of love and happiness in the years to come.
Do you have a maximum of three free throws?
Beijing time on the 27th, the NBA Development League announced the trial of the new free-throw rules, each penalty shot only once, the value is determined by the foul situation.
O'Neal has a very low free-the-go shooting rate among NBA stars.
According to the new regulations, a two-point shooting foul penalty can get 2 points, a three-point shooting foul penalty can get 3 points, and a foul plus a penalty to score 1 point.
The last two minutes of the regular season and the overtime game follow the previous free-throw rules.
Although this rule will only be piloted in the NBA development league in the new season, fans are more concerned about the impact it will have on the current players if the regulations are implemented in the NBA.
At present, a lot of people think that the new rules may be beneficial to "bearded" Harden, and the penalty is relatively not so good James, to suffer.
Wuhan promotes the intelligent transformation of industrial enterprises with a maximum subsidy of 20 million yuan
On the 27th, the reporter learned from a series of urban conferences held by the News Office of the Wuhan Municipal Government on the 27th that since the beginning of this year, the city has accelerated the promotion of industrial intelligent transformation and implemented a transformational subsidy measure of up to 20 million yuan.
Up to now, it has collected information on the intelligent transformation needs of more than 800 large-scale industrial enterprises.
Zhang Hong, deputy director of Wuhan Municipal Bureau of Economy and Information Technology, said that since this year, Wuhan has launched an action plan for the intelligent transformation of industrial enterprises to provide free consultation and diagnostic services and put forward solutions for industrial enterprises above designated size, and comprehensively promote a new round of high-level enterprise technological transformation.
In accordance with the plan, Wuhan will publicly select a number of specialized diagnostic service institutions every year, and carry out an intelligent transformation needs census for all industrial enterprises above designated size in the city through the opening of columns, questionnaires, and door-to-door reports.
Up to now, it has collected information on the intelligent transformation needs of more than 800 regulated industrial enterprises, accounting for nearly one-third of the city's industrial enterprises.
The five municipal-level diagnostic platforms have organized teams in batches to carry out "one-to-one" on-site evaluation and program demonstrations.
At present, the city is organizing and implementing 373 intelligent transformation projects, with a total planned investment of 29.76 billion yuan, the first 5G intelligent production line of Hongxin Communications in China, Motorola's national leading intelligent mobile phone production line, Wuhan Siemens transformer digital unmanned factory, the first batch of satellite production lines in the aerospace science and industry in the country, the world's leading new veterinary drug intelligent production line, Oubang smart home Internet of Things intelligent production line.
In addition, the city of Wuhan has also increased its financial and financial support for intelligent transformation projects.
Among them, including the implementation of the intelligent transformation of industrial enterprises, according to its actual completion of investment; including equipment and hardware investment, research and development soft investment, given 8%, up to 20 million yuan of transformation subsidies.
At the same time, it actively unites financial institutions, such as the Wuhan branch of the Zhejiang Commercial Bank, to provide individualized financial services specifically for the intelligent transformation of industrial enterprises, so as to effectively alleviate the financing pressure of enterprises.
Trudeau "continuous collapse", can he be successfully re-elected?
It was Trudeau who tripped Trudeau out of a "big hole" this time, and it was Trudeau who dug it out a little bit by himself.
Recently, the Canadian media successively exposed a number of old photos of the current Prime Minister of Trudeau, in the photo Trudeau dressed himself as a black image.
This is considered to be an obvious act of racial discrimination, causing an uproar in Canada.
After the incident, Trudeau repeatedly apologized to the public.
However, the Canadian people are not buying much.
Trudeau threw stones at his own feet.
As political commentator Riley and others have pointed out, since the emergence of the "anti-blackface movement" in the United States, Trudeau and the federal Liberal Party have been high-profile to accuse the opposition party or those who dissent in the party of "a big loss" in this regard, and repeatedly threatened that "no matter who commits this mistake, they should be dismissed immediately".
In simple terms, the "big hole" that studdted Trudeau this time, it was Trudeau who dug out a little bit.
Trudeau is the son of former Canadian Prime Minister Pierre Trudeau, a young and handsome young man who just broke a whirlwind of “political idols” when he first came out.
Originally a "politic amateur", after taking over as the leader of the federal Liberal Party, he fought an unexpectedly beautiful battle in Canada's federal legislative elections in 2015 - the federal Liberal Party won more than half of the seats in the lower house of the federal government and obtained the valuable individual cabinet.
At that time, Trudeau put forward a number of demented political platforms and concepts, such as "ethnicity and gender equality", "ecological environmental protection" and "economic rejuvenation", emphasizing the elimination of corruption and "the wind of injustice".
However, in the past five years in power, he has been in power in almost all of the above-mentioned areas.
Taking the issue of "ethnicity and gender equality", let's not talk about the "black face" incident, after which he "voised and unsubstantiated" on a series of issues related to the aboriginal people, so that aboriginal groups and leaders moved their protest tents on the 150th anniversary of Canada's founding.
At the end of last year, at the beginning of this year, Trudeau was embroiled in the "Lan Wanling incident".
It has been exposed, in their hometown of the construction engineering company "Lan Wanling" major violations of private fraud cases, to be responsible for the departments and officials in charge of the investigation and punishment of pressure, the latter to "raise their noble hands".
In addition, Trudeau, after the incident, was angered by the officials who disclosed the nefarious case - Wang Zhoudi, who was the first to disclose the case and directly handled the case, the Attorney General of Canada at the time.
Although there are still doubts about the case itself, its suspicions are difficult to wash away.
Many observers have pointed out that Trudeau's five-year-long collapse is mainly caused by his own "plying hole", and the biggest "pits" are "tiger tail", "self-defeating" and "benevolent self-censorship, stricter than the law".
Canada's most authoritative Angus-Red poll data shows that since 2015, the number of supporters of Trudeau has slid from more than 60% to more than 30%, but opponents have soared from less than 30% to more than 60%.
Although the performance of the other opposition parties and their party leaders is equally poor, even a considerable number of voters who are still willing to vote for the federal Liberal vote are now disapproving of the federal prime minister, the leader of the ruling party.
On October 21, the new Canadian federal legislative election is about to begin, can Trudeau repeat the drama that won the victory five years ago?
The answer may be in one word: difficult.
Whether from the level of enterprise competition, the consumer experience level, or from the regional aviation integration, Beijing-Tianjin-Hebei development integration level, it has a far-reaching impact and positive significance.
On September 25, Beijing Daxing International Airport was officially navigable.
The Beijing News reporter learned from the Beijing Municipal Development and Reform Commission that the capital's airport has been in a state of ultra-saturated operation, and the opening of Daxing International Airport will enhance the capital's air service capabilities.
After Shanghai, Beijing has become the second city with two airports in the same city, and Shanghai Hongqiao International Airport mainly for domestic aviation affairs, Pudong airport is similar to international shipping and aviation, the future capital airport and Daxing airport will also serve the different domestic and international aviation business differentiation positioning, to provide a more subdivided service.
Daxing airport navigation, from the perspective of business development, is more of a positive impact for the capital airport.
The passenger throughput of the capital airport exceeded 100 million passengers in 2018, ranking first in the whole country, but compared with the fast-growing business demand, there is still a significant difference in capacity, especially the demand for international routes has a large gap.
In order to better serve the needs of domestic and foreign passenger tourism and travel, and to meet the urban development trend of Beijing's increasing openness and international standards, Daxing International Airport is positioned as a large-scale international hub airport, and it is planned to meet the annual passenger throughput of 100 million passengers and 4 million tons of cargo and mail throughput in the future.
Therefore, the positioning of the two airports does not overlap, for different customer groups, but also have sufficient market space.
From the perspective of economic accounting, Daxing International Airport will obviously form a win-win effect, alleviate the tension of Beijing's aviation capacity, accelerate the growth rate of passenger and cargo throughput, and create an incremental cake for the dual-core operation of Capital Airlines.
From the user's point of view, with Daxing International Airport's navigation, the future does not have to be concentrated in the capital's airport, but also to reduce a series of problems brought about by the excessive concentration of routes, such as the extension of the station security time, the slow boarding speed of passengers, indirectly increase the residual time of aircraft and passengers at the airport, exacerbate the burden of airport operation, through the capital airport shipping burden, in fact, but also improve the travel experience of passengers.
According to the media's calculation of a variety of traffic routes to large-scale international airports, for example, starting from the southern fifth ring of the high-speed directly on the Daxing airport high-speed, 50 minutes by car, the oil money back and forth about 40 yuan, the high-speed fee of 15 yuan; and the choice of rail transit subway Daxing airport line, the distance according to the distance of 20 kilometers, 30 kilometers, the fare can be divided into 10 yuan, 25 yuan, 35 yuan; the public can also take the Jingxiong intercity, from Beijing west station to Daxing airport.
In general, there are a variety of modes of transportation for citizens to Daxing airport, and the cost and time are also within a reasonable range.
From the point of view of trend development: Daxing Airport's positioning is a Beijing-Tianjin-Hebei transportation hub, so it is a little farther away from the urban area of Beijing, but it strengthens the radiation to Hebei and Tianjin, which is convenient for more people to travel, which is of great significance to the economic development of Hebei and Tianjin.
In the future, Hebei and Tianjin passengers will be able to enjoy more international air route services provided by Daxing International Airport, which can be seen from the transportation planning of Daxing Airport.
The supporting transportation facilities of Daxing Airport are very perfect, in addition to the new airport line directly to Daxing Airport in Beijing District, there are also a number of expressways connecting Daxing Airport and the surrounding areas.
Just as passengers from Guangdong Dongguan, Foshan, Qingyuan and other cities can go to Guangzhou Baiyun Airport through highways such as Guangfo and Guangshen, residents of Langfang and Xiongan New Area around Beijing will also benefit from Daxing Airport to obtain convenient and efficient aviation services.
It can be seen that the navigation of Daxing International Airport not only adds a few runways and a number of aircraft, whether it is from the level of enterprise competition, consumer experience level, or from regional aviation integration, Beijing-Tianjin-Hebei development integration level, has far-reaching impact and positive significance, not only related to the long-term layout and development of Beijing's shipping industry, providing diversified choices for the travel of the vast number of Beijing-Tianjin-Hebei residents, promoting the further improvement of the service quality of the Beijing shipping industry.
Therefore, for Daxing Airport's navigation, we should not only calculate the small accounts of individuals in the economy, but also the big account of the overall development.
On the 27th, the small and medium-sized board index increased by 1.46% - Xinhua
Xinhua News Agency, Shenzhen, September 27 (Reporter Zhao Ruishi) On the 27th, the small and medium-sized board index opened high and walked, and finally reported 6077.23 points, up 87.55 points from the previous trading day, an increase of 1.46%.
On the same day, the transaction value of small and medium-sized boards was 108 billion yuan, a decrease of 31.9 billion yuan compared with the previous trading day.
Among the stocks traded on the same day, 668 stocks closed and rose, and 15 stocks, such as Honggao Creative, rose and stopped; 222 stocks closed and fell, and 4 stocks, such as Shunwei shares, fell and stopped; Weixing shares and other 40 stocks closed.
2019 Vietnam Forum on Economic and Social Issues Held in Chengtian Hue Province
The deputy director of the Economic Committee of the National Assembly of Vietnam, Nguyen Dejian, revealed that at the beginning of this year, Vietnam's economic and social development showed a lot of new developments and continued to grow.
The forum focused on the economic and social issues highlighted in the first few months of 2019, and proposed measures for economic and social development at the end of 2019 and in 2020.
At the forum, the participants exchanged in-depth views and views on the economic development situation in 2019 and the impact of some free trade agreements, some outstanding issues of Vietnam's economy in 2019, outstanding issues in Vietnam's society and culture in 2019, as well as predictions and suggestions for Vietnam's economic and social development in 2020.
Delegates generally believe that in the first few months of 2019, global economic growth slowed down and increased risks and challenges.
Trade frictions among the major economies have further shrunk global trade and investment.
According to the International Monetary Fund (IMF), although the global economy is full of uncertainty, 70% of the world's economies have stagnated in growth, Vietnam's economic development has still made many gratifying achievements, stable macroeconomic operation, inflation has been effectively controlled, in the first half of 2019, the consumer price index increased by an average of 2.64% in the first half of 2019, the lowest growth rate in the past three years.
In the first half of 2019, GDP increased by 6.76%, which is lower than 7.05 percent in the same period in the same period in the same period of the same period in the 2011-2017 period.
When making a forecast for Vietnam's economic development trends in 2019-2020, Deng Deying, deputy director of Vietnam's national economic and social forecasting center, said that in the context of the turmoil of the world economy, Vietnam's economy showed a high growth momentum in 2019.
It is expected that by 2020, Vietnam's macro economy will continue to remain basically stable, the implementation of various free trade agreements will boost the development of trade, the adjustment of economic structure and the improvement of the business environment will be further strengthened, due to the impact of trade frictions, Vietnam's foreign export activities will show a downward trend.
Therefore, it is necessary to strengthen the monitoring and early warning mechanism, actively seek trade relief measures for Vietnam's exports, find opportunities to expand new export markets, and create convenience for the export of various commodities such as agricultural and aquatic products.
At the same time, the inflation rate should be kept at a reasonable level to promote the development of ancillary industries and to support the development of high-tech agriculture, organic agriculture and ecological agriculture.
Liu Zhijie, director of the consular office of the Chinese Embassy in Siem Reap, held a reception in Siem Reap on the 26th to celebrate the 70th anniversary of the founding of the People's Republic of China.
Liu Zhijie said that in the 70 years since the founding of the People's Republic of China, China has actively participated in international affairs, contributed more Chinese wisdom and Chinese solutions to improving global economic governance and promoting global common development, made important contributions to world peace and development, and brought tangible benefits to Cambodia's economic development and people's well-being.
As the world's second largest economy, China's contribution to world economic growth is more than 30%, especially China's â€œBelt and Roadâ€œBelt and Roadâ€ initiative, and the cooperation between China's local provinces and cities and Siem Reap and manipulative provinces continues to deepen.
He said that this year is the beginning of the 61-year anniversary of the establishment of diplomatic relations between China and Cambodia, the two countries have fraternal friendship, and the mutually beneficial cooperation between China and Cambodia will become a driving force for local economic and social development.
Siem Reap Governor Disaiha highly praised the great achievements made by New China in the past 70 years, and congratulated the two countries on their achievements in friendly cooperation.
The two sides hope that the two sides will continue to work together to promote friendship and cooperation between China and Cambodia, strengthen mutual trust and mutual benefit, and continuously improve people's living standards.
Siem Reap province and China's provinces and cities of friendly exchanges are eye-catching, so far with China's 28 provinces and cities have concluded a friendly city relationship, a large-scale cultural and performing arts project "Angkor Smiling" and "Angkor Dynasty" landed, Siem Reap-Guangxi Agricultural Demonstration Park, Siem Reap new international airport project, Siem Reap provincial government officials special training courses, Siem Reap students to study in China scholarship, rural diagnosis, the transformation of urban roads, catarus rehabilitation public welfare projects.
Secretary of State of the Cambodian Ministry of National Defense Ken Wensong, Chairman of the Siem Reap Provincial Council Weng Heng, governors of the five prefectures, Siem Reap branch of the Cambodian-Chinese Council, volunteer teachers, Siem Reap Branch of the Cambodian-Chinese Chamber of Commerce, representatives of Chinese-funded enterprises, representatives of Chinese-funded enterprises, and representatives of foreign leaders stationed in Siem Reap attended the reception.
In the small town of Yunqi to witness the digital China's ten-year "cloud rise" - Xinhua
If the local website forum in 2009 is used as the starting point, the 2019 Yunqi Conference held in Hangzhou from the 25th to the 27th has gone for a full decade.
From the concept of â€œthe fog in the cloudsâ€ to the practice of â€œcloudâ€ , big data and cloud computing have become one of the core technologies supporting China's economic development, social management, and public services in the past 10 years.
In the Zhengtai new energy photovoltaic cell workshop in Haining, Zhejiang Province, there have been many new "colleagues" equipped with Aliyun's artificial intelligence next to recent quality inspectors.
It is open for 24 hours, the recognition speed is more than twice the manual, and the accuracy rate of quality inspection is stable at more than 95%.
According to the person in charge of the company, the "quality inspector" with the camera has focused on learning more than 40,000 flaw samples, and with the cloud computing power behind it, it can quickly convert infrared images into a binary language, and there will be flawless battery cells.
This company is just a microcosm of today's cloud computing to help the transformation of the manufacturing industry.
In 2018, the Ministry of Industry and Information Technology issued the "Guideline for Promoting the Implementation of the Cloud for Enterprises (2018-2020)" and proposed that by 2020, we will strive to achieve a significant increase in the awareness and enthusiasm of the enterprise on the cloud, and significantly improve the proportion and application depth of the cloud.
Wang Jian, the founder of Alibaba Cloud, said that today, data-centric cloud computing has built a bridge and opened the way for data as a digital economy with key elements.
At the same time, in the past 10 years, the scale of China's cloud computing industry has also continued to expand.
China Academy of Information and Communications Technology in July this year released the "cloud computing development white paper (2019)" shows that in 2018, China's overall cloud computing market size reached 96.28 billion yuan, an increase of 39.2% over 2017.
In addition to becoming a key technology to support industrial transformation and the development of the digital economy, the invisible "cloud" has also unconsciously changed urban management and social life.
At this year's Yunqi conference, the "urban brain", which debuted for three consecutive years, is still attracting attention.
At present, the urban brain has become the center of urban management from transportation management tools, and related cooperative applications have been extended to 23 cities around the world.
Through camera perception and artificial intelligence algorithms, the city's brain has enabled new urban management service functions such as "stop first and pay after payment", "the real-time perception of the number of visits" and "tourist line design" have been realized through powerful computing power.
In the field of government affairs services, using "one cloud" to dock with "one thing" to promote the "hands-on office" and "hands-on work" together, cloud computing has brought convenience to both ends of the supply of government services.
At present, Zhejiang has built a unified public data platform for the whole province through government affairs.
As of September 11, this platform has covered more than 57 million permanent residents and more than 15 million legal entities in the province, and has aggregated 19.808 billion pieces of data in 3066.
The average number of data called and shared per month between the Zhejiang provincial government departments has reached 12 million times, and the flow of data on the "cloud" may mean that the masses do less errands.
Be careful to make tea with a plastic tea bag!
According to the "Central News Agency" report, recently, a recent Canadian study found that a package of plastic tea bags may release billions or even tens of billions of plastic particles, which is significantly higher than the number of microplastics that a person's estimated intake throughout the year, but so far there is no evidence that ingesting plastic particles will pose a threat to humans.
According to reports, researchers at the University of Magill in Canada found that immersing a plastic tea bag in a cup of almost boiled hot water (95 degrees Celsius) will release about 11.6 billion plastic particles and 3.1 billion smaller nanoplastic particles into the cup.
This amount is significantly higher than the number of microplastics that a person is expected to ingest throughout the year.
According to research released earlier in 2019, the average person eats at least 50,000 microplastic particles every year while inhaling the same number of microplastics.
It is reported that the study was published in the Journal of Environmental Science and Technology, and the researchers tested four different types of plastic commercial tea bags in Montreal stores and cafes, opened the tea bags, soaked the tea bags into the almost boiling water for 5 minutes, and analyzed them with electron microscopes and spectrometers.
According to this study, they found that more than 11.6 billion plastic particles were released in a single tea bag, which was "substantially higher than the plastic load of other previous foods."
According to the report, most tea bags are made of natural fibers, but many tea bag brands that use natural fibers still use plastic to seal.
Some brands of tea bags are no longer made of paper, instead using plastics, and these plastic tea bags are the subject of the researchers' tests.
Microplastics are tiny fragments of plastic that the researchers define are between 100 nanometers and 5 millimeters in size and are mainly caused by the decomposition of plastic waste.
The researchers found traces of microplastics in air, soils, rivers and deep-seated trenches around the world, and these microplastics can also be found in tap water, bottled water, seafood and beer.
In October 2018, for the first time, the researchers found plastic particles in human stool samples from several countries in different regions around the world.
In order to test the potential toxicity of plastic particles released by tea bags, the Canadian research team put water fleas into contaminated water and found that microplastics affected the behavior of these water fleas and caused them to develop deformities.
According to the World Health Organization (WHO), so far there is no evidence that the ingestion of plastic particles poses a threat to humans.
However, the WHO pointed out that more research is needed to fully understand how these plastics spread into the environment and how they affect humans.
The researchers speculate that the reason why these tea bags release a large number of plastic particles may be that these plastic tea bags come into contact with boiling water, which may decompose or deplete toxic substances even when the "food grade" plastic is heated to more than 40 degrees Celsius.
“The climate emergency is the biggest threat to the survival of small island states.
There, a natural disaster erodes a generation’s development gains.
This has been illustrated by hurricane-ravvigorated Papua, the Dominican Republic and the Bahamas this year.
About a quarter of the people in small island developing States live at an altitude of five metres or less.
Evictions can seriously affect their society and way of life and may even raise issues of sovereignty and national identity.
At this Monday’s Climate Action Summit, small island nations are working together to achieve carbon-neutral 100% renewable energy by 2030, leading the world once again in the right direction.
“Climate crises are piling up new injustices on old ones.
Although small island developing States had contributed very little to global warming, they paid the highest price.
As a result of the middle-income status of these countries, many countries are also mired in an accelerated and unsustainable cycle of disaster and debt.
“The world must act, and it is time to make big decisions and invest heavily in small island developing States.”
Today's high-level meeting adopted a political declaration calling on small island developing States to help small island developing States to manage disaster risks, invest in climate-resilient infrastructure and ways to transition to renewable energy, and urged international institutions to help small island developing States, especially debt-laden middle-income countries, access to finance.
Small island developing States are at the forefront of protecting and conserving the Earth's lifeline, the ocean.
A new special report by the Intergovernmental Panel on Climate Change released this week confirms that the oceans are already suffering from the “vibbling” consequences of the climate crisis.
By the middle of the middle of this century, extreme sea-level rise is likely to occur in many regions every year that would otherwise occur only once in a century.
The report warns that some island nations are likely to become uninhabitable without investing heavily in adaptation.
Contamination, overexploitation and acidification cause significant losses.
Over the past 150 years, the world has lost half of all live corals, while plastic pollution has increased tenfold in the past 40 years.
The demand for industry, shipping, mining and tourism is leading to a reduction in resources, including the maintenance of fisheries in many island communities.
Small island States also face high costs of transport, energy and infrastructure.
They rely heavily on a number of external markets, subjecting them to price fluctuations.
Some countries are also grappling with the security implications of illicit trafficking in human beings, weapons and drugs.
â€œBy solving a problem in the most challenging environment, this problem can be solved anywhere,â€ Guterres said.
The efforts of small island developing States to achieve the 2030 Agenda for Sustainable Development will give us the tools, lessons, and examples that the world can learn from.”
He stressed that small island developing States were a special case for sustainable development.
They require the long-term attention and investment of the international community as a whole.
India’s finance ministry said there was sufficient liquidity in the financial system.
India's Finance Minister Sitharaman said on the 26th that the current liquidity of the financial system, driven by holiday consumer demand, India's economic growth is expected to recover in the second half of the current fiscal year.
Sitharaman made the remarks after holding a meeting with representatives of India’s private banks, non-bank financial institutions, housing banks and other institutions.
Sitharaman didn’t say where the remarks were targeted.
Earlier, some Indian media and overseas media attributed the continued deceleration of India's current economic slowdown to the tight liquidity of non-bank financial institutions.
Sitharaman cited a decline in car sales as an example, denying that tight liquidity is the main reason for the decline in sales.
Sitharaman pointed out that the decline in car sales is mainly caused by cyclical factors.
Sitharaman expects India's economic growth to resume in the second half of the fiscal year, driven by festive consumption.
India’s annual shopping season begins in September and lasts until the end of the year.
The market expects that shopping consumption will greatly promote India's economic growth.
The Jiangxi Provincial Department of Education has recently issued a notice prohibiting primary and secondary schools in the province from illegally making up lessons during the National Day holiday, and organizing personnel to conduct random and unannounced visits.
In the "Notice on Prohibiting Violations of the National Children's Day Holiday" issued, the Jiangxi Provincial Department of Education emphasized that primary and secondary schools in various places should resolutely do during the National Day: students should not organize collective remedial classes or new classes, and should not hold subject training courses, special director classes, Orsay classes, interest classes, etc., and should not rent campuses and school buildings to other educational institutions to hold various training courses.
At the same time, it is strictly forbidden for in-service primary and secondary school teachers to organize, recommend and induce students to participate in illegal remedial classes both inside and outside the school, it is strictly prohibited for in-service primary and secondary school teachers to participate in out-of-university training institutions or by other teachers, parents, parent committees and other organizations of illegal supplementary classes, and it is strictly prohibited for in-service primary and secondary school teachers to introduce students and provide relevant information for out-of-school training institutions and others.
The notice made it clear that for the verified violations of primary and secondary schools, the local education administrative departments will increase the deduction points in the high-quality development education assessment of the county-level government in that year; for teachers who participate in illegal remedial classes, it will be seriously dealt with in accordance with the relevant provisions of teachers and teachers.
Support pig production to ensure the supply of the market
Sui Loyalty requires the implementation of various measures from six aspects.
The province's promotion of pig production to ensure market supply video teleconference was held today to implement the policies and measures of the central and provincial Party committees and provincial governments to support pig production to ensure market supply and re-mobilization.
Sui Loyalty requirements, from six aspects to grasp the implementation of pig production measures.
The "vegetable basket" mayor is responsible for the implementation of the "vegetable basket", and this year the province's clear 45 million pigs have been decomposed to various cities and states to be included in the responsibility system assessment.
Do a good job in the implementation of various policies and measures, and earnestly solve the "last mile" problem of policy implementation.
We should do a good job in the production and implementation of breeding sows, conscientiously implement the subsidy policy of breeding sows, encourage pig breeding enterprises to expand the scale of breeding pigs, and systematically choose excellent sows from the group of commercial pigs.
We should do a good job in the implementation of investment promotion, and take the domestic well-known large-scale aquaculture enterprises that have not yet entered our province as the top priority of investment attraction.
The implementation of the market circulation system will speed up the construction of pig cold chain logistics facilities, and comprehensively promote the transformation from "pig adjustment" to "meat adjustment".
The implementation of the modern anti-epidemic prevention system should be equipped with grass-roots anti-epidemic and quarantine personnel who are compatible with the scale and work tasks of breeding, and build the first line of defense for epidemic prevention and control.
Sui Loyalty requires making every effort to protect the supply of the meat market, ensuring that there will be no large-scale shortages and a large-scale shortage of supplies, and ensure the stable supply of the pork market on major holidays.
The meeting also deployed the prevention and control of the African swine fever epidemic, the prohibition and recapture of important waters in the Yangtze River Basin of our province, and the acquisition of middle and late rice in the province.
