Shinzo Abe celebrates the 70th anniversary of the founding of the People's Republic of China
On the 26th of the local time, Japanese Prime Minister Shinzo Abe congratulated the 70th anniversary of the founding of the People's Republic of China by video.
Japanese Prime Minister Shinzo Abe: Good evening everyone, my name is Shinzo Abe.
On the occasion of the 70th anniversary of the founding of the People's Republic of China, I would like to extend my warm congratulations on behalf of the Government and people of
At the G20 Osaka Summit held in June, Japan and China demonstrated the firm will of the G20 in order to successfully cooperate at the Summit and adopt the G20 Osaka Summit Manifesto.
In addition, at the Japan-China summit talks and dinner before the summit, the two sides agreed that President Xi Jinping will pay a state visit to Japan next spring, and they are determined to open up a new era between Japan and China.
Japan and China jointly shoulder great responsibilities for the peace and prosperity of Asia and the world.
I firmly believe that the joint efforts of the two countries to cope with the problems facing the region and the world and jointly contribute to the international community will be conducive to building a new model of future relations between the two countries.
In the end, I would like to wish Japan-China relations to flourish, and I wish my friends a thriving career.
“Over-age migrant workers on some construction sites are estimated to account for more than half.
Where do we find young workers now?
I don't want to use so many "old people" on the construction site, there is no way."
Recently, there are a lot of over-aged migrant workers (exceeding the retirement age) on the construction site, and Zou Kui, who has been working as an engineering contractor in the construction industry for a long time, lamented.
Recently, the author's colleges and universities to carry out rain and sewage shunt project, there are a lot of migrant workers on the campus, if you pay attention to observation, you will find that there are a lot of over-age migrant workers.
Over-aged migrant migrant workers are not "idle", but "can't be idle", with the helplessness and hardship of â€œhad to do soâ€ â€“ whether it is to save money to solve their own old-age and medical problems, or to help their children â€œidleâ€ , they drive these old people who were supposed to â€œidle downâ€ to continue their hard work.
Over-aged migrant workers are not as relaxed as we think.
Raising children, supporting pensioners, reading for children, helping children to build a building to buy a car, helping children to start a family, raising their grandchildren from generation to generation, when these migrant workers have completed the "mission of life", money bags have been hollowed out and even have a lot of debts, most of them lack of wealth accumulation.
In order not to drag down the children also in order to accumulate more wealth for themselves, many migrant workers insist on "do not work".
Many "post-80s", "post-90s" and even "post-00s" new generation of migrant workers are not willing to engage in difficult conditions, high labor intensity secondary industry or low-end service industry, resulting in a structural "labor shortage", and these unattractive jobs provide opportunities for over-age migrant workers.
Due to the lack of a skill, physical function and labor ability have declined, and many over-age migrant workers are doing jobs with high intensity, low income, high risk and less protection.
The ability of a day is a day, can earn a little more is a little, "can't be idle" behind over-the-age migrant worker's plight, can not be ignored and ignored.
To solve the problem of unpaid wages and wages, improve labor protection, reduce security risks, increase labor income, and improve the living status of over-age migrant workers, in addition to their "self-salvation", it is also inseparable from the institutional protection and humanistic care of the public sector.
Some scholars have pointed out that over-age migrant workers are no longer likely to rely on going home to the field to solve their own pension and medical problems, and they must support their families through other methods.
Reading the helplessness and strength of over-age migrant workers "can't be idle" helps us to better understand the love and pain of over-age migrant workers.
Seeing the backs of over-aged migrant workers, listening to their groaning, and trying to get back to the countryside, they truly achieve "old-age dependence", requiring the public sector, the market and the society to share responsibilities in a benign interaction, and the joint efforts of many parties.
Chemezov said that Russia will not export such a system in the next five years, because "the supply of its own army first, and only after export production."
This approach is in full compliance with international practice.
The major producers of weapons and military equipment will always first secure their own defense needs before processing export orders.
Earlier, the deputy commander-in-chief of Russia's air and space forces, General Yuri Grekhov, said that the development of the system was about to be completed.
The S-500 system was developed by "Diamond-Antai" air and space defense Kontien.
It’s a next-generation air defense system that works to destroy ballistic and aerodynamic targets.
The main function of the S-500 is to intercept intermediate-range ballistic missiles, which can intercept missiles with a range of less than 3,500 kilometers.
In addition, according to some information, the S-500 can also destroy hypersonic cruise missiles as well as aircraft, almost all types of unmanned aircraft, hypersonic missiles more than 5 times the speed of sound, and even near-space targets.
This weapon can also be integrated with other air defense systems into a unified network, especially the S-400 system, which is very important from a national defense point of view.
Sergey Chemezov paid special attention to the S-400.
The system is currently in great demand around the world, he said, but the Russian military also needs it, including in the Arctic region.
The S-400 air defense system entered service with the Arctic air defense regiment.
According to the news on September 15th, the transformation of the S-400 anti-aircraft missile system by the Arctic air defense regiment has been completed.
This is not the militarization of Russia in the Arctic.
Russia’s Defense Ministry said it was entirely a process within the transition plan for more advanced defensive tools in the strategic direction of the north.
"With the transition to the new S-400 air defense system, the controllable airspace in the Arctic has increased significantly," the press service of Russia's Northern Fleet said.
It is very important that the military assesses that the use of the system has been very successful in the far north and the Arctic region.
Anti-aircraft regiments were trained for the new system and were ready to be put on combat duty.
It used to be equipped with the S-300 long-range air defense system, and it still retains a part.
When it comes to air defense systems, they must have weapons capable of destroying a wide range of aerial targets, whether they are targets flying at high speeds at an outer altitude, as well as a “missing fish” close to a protected facility.
According to public sources, the S-400 Triumph system, developed by Golden Diamond-Antai Air Defense Konzern, is designed to attack strategic and tactical aircraft, ballistic missiles, hypersonic targets, and other aerial attack weapons.
This weapon can attack aerodynamic targets within a range of 400 kilometers and shoots down ballistic targets flying at 4.8 kilometers per second at a distance of 60 kilometers.
Russia will never hide that it will deploy additional air defense forces in the far north to ensure the safety of the airspace of the Northern Sea Route.
Not long ago, the first batch of 12 Tor-M2DT anti-aircraft missile systems was delivered to Russia's Arctic region, which is enough to form an anti-aircraft battalion to strengthen air defense systems in the Arctic region.
At that time, the Russian Defense Ministry said that the Arctic "Tor" troops will be expanded to a complete brigade-level establishment in the future.
Coupled with newly deployed S-400 long-range systems deployed on Novashima and the Kola Peninsula, as well as Pantsir-SA short-range systems deployed in the far north, these advanced anti-aircraft weapons robustly defend Russia’s polar skies.
Enemion aircraft, helicopters and drone missiles will be difficult to break through this defense.
According to the ideas of the Russian government, the flagship store will become a platform for Russian manufacturers to place goods and avoid the complicated and lengthy process of opening their own stores.
As an operator of the Russian goods store, the company specializes in the sale of Russian products in China.
China's largest trading platforms, such as Tmall, Jingdong (JD), 1688, Pinduoduo ( Pinduoduo), Hand Q (ShouQ), and Wechat (Wechat), have their own online platform, Epinduo.com and a Russian retail chain of goods stores.
The Russian export center will work together with Russia to formulate store marketing strategies and participation standards, and screen virtual shelf companies.
By the end of this year, the store is scheduled to open its doors with at least 10 Russian-made products.
According to the data of the Russian export center, China's e-commerce platform has a total of 1 billion visits per month.
At the same time, food exports to China have shown steady growth since 2014, surpassing US$1 billion in 2018.
At present, Alibaba Group will also open pilot stores within the framework of the global import strategy to sell goods from New Zealand, Malaysia and Singapore.
According to Alexei Korzhevnikov, the new store will display the products of enterprises with sales of at least 500 million rubles.
To be honest, my expectations are higher, and sales of 500 million rubles are insufficient.
As we all know, the attitude of Chinese consumers towards Russian goods is quite positive, considering China's goods as high-quality and green and environmentally friendly products."
Korzhevnikov said that the competition for Chinese consumers with strong purchasing power is fierce and increasing.
â€œOur goal is to launch 500 businesses through this store within three years,â€ he said.
At the same time, the platform will also list the products of enterprises in the Russian Far East.
Vyacheslav Cheglov, a professor of trade policy basics at Plekhanov Economic University in Russia, said: "This is a political project that represents the image of both sides, because the Russian export center is a state-owned rather than a private institution."
"I don't see a large number of very competitive Russian goods in the market."
He believes that the project is unlikely to actually be implemented, but it will help strengthen relations between the two countries.
Andrey Slepnev, president of the Russian Export Center, said during the Eastern Economic Forum that product information of more than 170 Russian companies has been published on Alibaba.com, the largest international wholesale online platform, and can be purchased in China or in other countries.
In addition, there is a model of cooperation with the Alibaba Group, the training program of experts from Taobao University for Russian enterprises, whose first seminar was held in July this year.
At the 2nd China International Import Expo in Shanghai in November this year, the Russian Export Center will also serve as the organizing party for Russian enterprises to participate in industry exhibitions and commercial projects.
A large-scale exhibition will be held in the 1000-square-meter exhibition hall, which will also be the center of commercial project activities, the signing ceremony of the agreement, the promotion meeting and talks with the representatives of Chinese enterprises.
At present, about 50 applications have been received from Russian agricultural enterprises.
“In addition to agricultural booths, we will definitely hold business meetings to arrange direct contacts between entrepreneurs,” said the press service of the Russian Export Center.
“It’s another direction of our efforts to support businesses and make sure to arrange dozens of ad hoc meetings for them.”
In addition, there will also be master classes, culinary contests and Russian food tastings for famous Russian chefs in the “Exploration of Russian Cuisine Shanghai Station”.
After the post-mortem court of the martyred rescuer Mohd Adi made a non-accurate death on Friday, the police took the next step after waiting for a complete report and waiting for instructions from the Attorney-General's Office.
In a statement on Friday, the National Police Criminal Investigative Service, Datuk Huzier, said in a statement on Friday that, according to the coroner's ruling, the police will wait for the latest instructions from the Attorney-General's Office.
In the statement, he stressed that the police have never terminated the investigation into the Mohamad's murder, which is still in progress.
Selangor Chief Superintendent Noa Zhan said that the police will wait for the full report of the content of the relevant ruling before taking action.
On Friday morning, he was questioned when he was questioned at the Xuezhou police headquarters when he was questioned.
He said that the police investigated the case according to the relevant report.
He added that the police will also ignore the progress of the investigation and decide whether they will again be questioned by those who had previously recorded their confessions.
The reporter learned from the Beijing Municipal Bureau of landscaping that in order to welcome the 70th anniversary of the founding of the People's Republic of China, Beijing has recently taken Chang'an Street and its routes as the main axis to comprehensively enhance the landscape and create a peaceful and festive atmosphere.
At present, the 12 three-dimensional flower beds along Chang'an Street have all been completed, and the city's 20 million pots of flowers dressed up in the capital to welcome the National Day holiday.
In the past few days, there have been 12 colorful and diverse three-dimensional flower beds along Chang'an Street, which have attracted a large number of public tourists to watch and take photos.
From the beginning of the "magnificent 70 years" in the north-western corner of Jianguo Gate to the "Beautiful Tomorrow" in the northeastern corner of Revival Gate, these flowerbeds highlight the glorious achievements made in various fields since the founding of New China in the past 70 years, showing the happy life of the people.
The relevant person in charge of the Beijing Municipal Bureau of landscaping introduced that this year's green environmental arrangement made full use of its own innovations and integrated new varieties and new technologies at home and abroad.
There are more than 230 varieties, including 16 self-cultivated varieties, 18 new green anti-retrograde varieties, and 11 kinds of native plants.
China's self-cultivated "cold dew competitionhui", "fleet autumn candy", "gluten autumn colorful" three chrysanthemum varieties have been applied for the first time.
In order to celebrate the National Day, Beijing has also recently carried out a comprehensive remediation of the city's landscaping landscape environment, replanting more than 12,000 trees, 230,000 flower shrubs, and 2.3 million square meters of grass roots.
At the same time, in important areas such as the city's ring road, Chang'an street extension line, Xiangshan memorial site, new airport and important tourist scenic spots, there have also been 200 theme flowerbeds, the amount of planted flowers has reached 20 million pots (plants), 10,000 flower piles, 5,000 sets of combined containers, and 15,000 hanging flower boxes, so that the green environmental landscape of the capital has been comprehensively upgraded.
"China and the United Nations" and the report on climate change, sustainable development and other issues - Xinhua
On September 26, the Chinese delegation attending the 74th session of the United Nations General Assembly officially released four documents, such as "China and the United Nations - China's position paper of the 74th session of the United Nations Secretary-General of the United Nations", "The United Nations Climate Action Summit: China's positions and actions", "China's progress report on the implementation of the 2030 Agenda for Sustainable Development (2019), "Earth's big data to support the sustainable development sustainable development goals report".
The Chinese position paper of the 74th session of the United Nations General Assembly summarizes the achievements and achievements and development of cooperation between China and the United Nations in various fields in the past 70 years since the founding of the People's Republic of China, especially since the 18th National Congress of the Communist Party of the Communist Party of China
He pointed out that Chinese President Xi Jinping's proposal to promote the construction of a community with a shared future for mankind has become the banner of the diplomacy of major countries with Chinese characteristics.
Under the guidance of Xi Jinping's diplomatic thinking, China will participate in international affairs with a more positive attitude, make greater contributions to the world's peace and development, and assume more responsibilities.
China has always been a builder of world peace, a contributor to global development and a maintainer of the international order.
The document describes China's important contributions to the three pillars of peace, development and human rights of the United Nations from ten aspects.
Reaffirm that China firmly supports the practice of multilateralism and supports the United Nations to play a central role in international affairs; pointed out that China's development resonates with the development of the same frequency with the world's development and promotes each other, and emphasizes that in the face of the great changes that the world has not seen in a hundred years, a developing China will contribute more and more and more positive energy to the world.
The "United Nations Climate Action Summit: China's position and actions" is closely related to the nine major action areas of the United Nations Climate Action Summit, introducing China's policy proposal for international cooperation on climate change and China's achievements in responding to climate change measures.
As the largest developing country in the world, China regards addressing climate change as an inherent requirement for its own sustainable development and the responsibility of building a community with a shared future for mankind, will continue to overcome the many difficult challenges facing its own development, firmly safeguard multilateralism, implement international commitments, and make every effort to promote the full and effective implementation of the Paris Agreement.
China's progress report on the implementation of the 2030 Agenda for Sustainable Development (2019) is China's second progress report, following the release of the implementation progress report in 2017.
China's measures, progress, challenges and next-step plans for the implementation of the 2030 Agenda show China's commitment and achievements to implement the new development concept and achieve high-quality development.
The report contains cases of precision poverty alleviation, innovation-led development, ecological civilization construction, rural revitalization, and joint construction of the “Belt and Road”, which will help other countries to implement the 2030 Agenda.
"Earth big data supports the Sustainable Development Goals report" shows China's exploration and practice of using earth big data technology to support the implementation of the 2030 Agenda and policy decisions, reveals the application value and prospects of relevant technologies and methods for monitoring and evaluating the sustainable development goals, and provides a new perspective and new support for the international community to fill the data and methodology gaps and accelerate the implementation of the 2030 Agenda.
On September 29, 2019, at 6 p.m., the Macao Institute of Technology Alumni Association will be grandly opened at 6 p.m. on September 29, 2019 at the Huaiyuan Building exhibition hall of the Macao Institute of Technology.
People from all walks of life are welcome for guidance.
The well-known designers Liu Huazhi and Liang Ziheng both graduated from the comprehensive design department of the Macao Institute of Technology, and then jointly founded the design company in 2013, after five years of hard work, the company's outstanding achievements, won more than 200 awards in the international, design business all over the world, the business spans more than 10 countries and 25 cities, the success of the team design to the international, well-known.
At the invitation of the Alumni Association of the Macao Institute of Technology, they exhibited their ingenious design works and shared their achievements in entrepreneurship.
On the same day, in addition to sharing entrepreneurship experience, it will also exchange views on Macao's design and development.
From September 29 to October 10, 2019, the exhibition will be open from 9 a.m. to 11 p.m., and the holidays will be open as usual.
For enquiries, you can contact the Alumni Association at 85993119.
Lao collectives and individuals have been awarded the Vietnamese national medals and insignia.
According to the decision issued by Vietnamese President Nguyen Phu Trong on the awarding of the Independence Medal on September 21, Vietnam awarded the Order of Independence to 12 collectives and 13 individuals from the Lao People's National Assembly, various organs of the National People's Congress and the National Assembly's Secretariat, in recognition of their positive contribution to the consolidation and strengthening of the special solidarity relations between the national and parliamentary parliaments of the two countries.
Vietnamese President Nguyen Phu Trong also issued a decision on the awarding of the Order of Friendship and the badge of friendship.
According to this decision, the Vietnamese state decided to award 21 friendship medals and 17 badges of friendship to four collectives and 34 individuals of the Lao National Assembly, the various organs of the National Assembly and 34 individuals, in recognition of their positive contribution to the consolidation and strengthening of the special solidarity relationship between the national and parliamentary parliaments of the two countries.
In her speech at the awarding ceremony, Nguyễn stressed that the inseparable relationship between the two ethnic groups has taken shape from a long-standing historical process, and the good traditional friendship, consistent and selfless relations between the people of Vietnam and Laos have been personally created by President Ho Chi Minh and President Kaishan Fong Weihan and carefully nurtured by the leaders and peoples of the two countries.
Ms. Nguyễn stressed that under the complex and ever-changing situation of the world, the great friendship, special friendship and all-round cooperation are still constantly being consolidated and developed and are becoming more and more in-depth and pragmatic.
Ms. Nguyễn stressed that the award of the Vietnamese party and state medals and insignificances to the various collectives and former senior leading cadres of the Lao People's Congress is a great credit given by the Vietnamese party, the country and the people to the comrades, and hopes that the comrades will continue to work hard to make more contributions to strengthening the great friendship, special solidarity and comprehensive cooperation between Vietnam and Laos.
Ms. Nguyễn stressed that the Vietnamese party and state will continue to maintain close cooperation with the Lao party and state, inherit and give full play to the achievements of cooperation made by the two sides, and actively consolidate and promote the great friendship, special solidarity and comprehensive cooperation between the two countries.
The collectives and individuals of the Lao People’s National Assembly, who have been awarded the Order of Independence, the Order of Friendship and the badge of Friendship, have expressed their gratitude to the Vietnamese state for awarding the honorary awards, and affirmed that this is not only an honor for them, but also an honor for the Lao National Assembly.
E-cigarettes in the U.S. have 12 fatal cases of lung damage to 805 cases.
U.S. health officials said on the 26th local time that there have been 12 deaths from e-cigarette-related diseases in the United States and 805 cases of lung damage related to vaping.
The U.S. Centers for Disease Control and Prevention reported the numbers and said it had not yet identified the specific substances that caused the disease.
However, the vast majority of patients reported using e-cigarette products containing tetrahydrocannabinol, which is the main compound in cannabis that affects the mental state.
It is reported that the surge in lung cases is related to the purchase of contaminated electronic smog vehicles on the black market.
According to the Centers for Disease Control and Prevention, these 12 deaths occurred in the 10 states from California to Florida, while 805 related confirmed and suspected cases were reported by 46 states and the U.S. Virgin Islands.
In the past three weeks, e-cigarette sales have been banned in India and the United States, and New York and Michigan have banned flavored e-cigarettes.
According to the report, the Trump administration intends to ban e-cigarette products from all flavors other than the smell of tobacco in October.
When does the next bus arrive?
The "internet + intelligent station card" makes your heart count.
On the 27th, the Nanjing Intelligent Transportation and Gaode map announced that the country's first batch of "Internet + intelligent station signs" officially landed in Nanjing, when Nanjing will have 54 public transport electronic screens will be lit, which will comprehensively upgrade the level of information services in Nanjing, improve the efficiency of public transport services and the happiness of ordinary people.
In the past, the anxiety scene of waiting for the car was staged at the bus station almost every day.
The running time of the bus is difficult to predict, it is difficult to know the bus road conditions and the position of the vehicle along the way, and the problem of bus travel pain points needs to be solved, especially in some large cities, the long commuting route, and the traffic situation during the morning and evening commute rush hour is complicated, resulting in the bus punctuality has always been difficult to ensure.
To this end, Nanjing intelligent transportation and high-tech map in-depth exploration of the "Internet + traffic" convenient service new direction, the launch of the country's first batch of "Internet + intelligent platform" this intelligent service project.
It is reported that the country's first batch of "Internet + intelligent station signs" landed in Nanjing, the integration of high-tech big data and high-tech vehicles are expected to travel time ETA algorithm, and relying on bus electronic station signs and mobile Internet, traffic big data upgrades, to achieve "bus intelligent station + electronic map" double-ended release of bus routes, bus is expected to stop time and other capabilities.
Through the â€œInternet + smart station signâ€ , Nanjing citizens can not only easily get the estimated station time of the bus, understand the real-time location of the bus and a few stops away from the current station, and can intuitively grasp the bus conditions along the way through the three colors, so that the real-time situation of the bus line through the site can be seen at a glance.
Benefiting from the "Internet + intelligent station card" as a science and technology on-line, the citizens of Nanjing have realized convenient and efficient bus travel methods such as "inquiry the location of the bus before going out, mastering the station time when taking the bus, and understanding the time to reach the destination when taking the bus".
According to the real-time bus information of the "Internet + intelligent station sign", choose the most suitable travel route for yourself, and at the same time, it can also do a good job of psychological expectations and reduce the anxiety of waiting cars, so as to make travel more convenient.
Summer Palace fine cultural relics unveiled more than 30 pieces for the first time - Xinhua
The reporter learned from the Beijing Summer Palace Management Office that a total of 99 sets of cultural relics were exhibited this time, of which more than 30 cultural relics were exhibited to the public for the first time in the Summer Palace, showing the rich collection of palace cultural relics in the Summer Palace and its traditional Fushou cultural connotation.
It is reported that the exhibition is divided into four exhibition areas such as Ruiyu Jijin, Fushi Shouguang, Qiongxiang, and color enhancement, showing the audience jade bronze, ancient books and paintings, miscellaneous, porcelain enamel and many other types of cultural relics, and the organic shape and pattern decoration of the exhibits all reflect the theme of "Fu Shou".
Wu Lijia, deputy director of the cultural relics department of the Summer Palace Management Department, introduced that the number of high-level cultural relics in this cultural relics exhibition is large, there are many types of cultural relics, and the age span of exhibits is large.
Nearly 30% of the participating cultural relics are national-level cultural relics and second-level cultural relics, and the era of cultural relics spans from the Shang Dynasty to the Qingguangxu period.
More than 3,000 years ago, for the exhibition of the "oldest" bronze cultural relics; a huge volume and weight of nearly 80 pounds, is made of a whole piece of green jade engraving, the preservation phase is intact, very rare; the mountain stone people's pavilion wooden clock, "Nanjing collection of calligraphy" and so on is also the first for the public exhibition of fine cultural relics.
Qin Lei, deputy director of the Summer Palace Management Department in Beijing, said that the cultural exhibition upholds the spirit of making cultural relics "live up", relying on the garden idea of "Fushan Shouhai" in the Summer Palace, and using the cultural relics on the theme of "Fu Shou" in the garden as a carrier, so that tourists can understand the profound Fushou culture of the Summer Palace, carry forward and inherit the traditional Chinese culture, and convey the good wishes of the celebration.
It is reported that the cultural relics exhibition will continue until January 30, 2020.
Review: unswervingly follow our own path
The white paper "China and the world in the new era" released on the 27th makes an answer: in the past 70 years, the fundamental reason for China's development success is that under the leadership of the Communist Party of China, the Chinese people have found the correct development path of socialism with Chinese characteristics and followed this path unswervingly.
China's path of development that is suitable for itself is the choice of history and the choice of the people.
Since the beginning of modern times, in an environment of poverty and weakness and internal and external troubles, generations of benevolent volunteers have sought up and down the road to save the country and save the people.
However, "constitutional monarchy, the restoration of the empire, the parliamentary system, the multi-party system, and the presidential system have thought and tried, and the results will not work."
It was not until with the Communist Party of China and New China that the Chinese people gradually opened up a path of socialism with Chinese characteristics in practice.
The road out of China is the road to the happiness of the Chinese people, the road to the rejuvenation of the Chinese nation, and the common road for the common development of China and other countries around the world.
It is precisely because it is on the right path that China can run its own affairs, become the world's second-largest economy and make the largest contribution to global economic growth, and continue to benefit the world with its own development.
As pointed out in the white paper, China's development path is in line with China's national conditions and adapted to the requirements of the times, which will show more and more bright development prospects with the advancement of the times.
Looking back on the past, the Chinese people know how difficult it is to find the right path; looking around the world, the Chinese people cherish the right path even more.
The Chinese people understand the truth of the southern orange maple and understand that what is suitable for others is not necessarily suitable for themselves, and only those who are suitable for themselves are the best.
It is with the confidence and strategic determination of this road that China has created a world-renowned miracle.
In the tortuous process of mankind's progress, the â€œfinal conclusion of historyâ€ was once famous.
Today, the success of the path of socialism with Chinese characteristics has announced the end of the "end-of-the-history conclusion", the collapse of China's collapse theory, and the failure of "socialist failure theory".
China's success has stimulated the confidence of developing countries to achieve national prosperity and strength, expanded the way for developing countries to move towards modernization, and provided experience and reference for those countries and peoples in the world who both want to accelerate their development and maintain their own independence and take a path that suits their own national conditions.
The world is colorful.
China has always respected the right of all countries to choose a development path that suits their own national conditions.
China does not "import" the foreign model or "exports" the Chinese model, but will unswervingly follow its own path, achieve its own continuous development, strengthen national governance exchanges with other countries, and make due contributions to the joint realization of good governance.
At the Fair Work Commission's finding that the owner of a Foodworks Supermarket fired a 66-year-old female worker by text message because he preferred to hire an employee from an Asian-American background was slammed as "disgraceful".
Jianbin Wang, owner of Ms Gail Ayton, who has worked at the Wagga Wagga store for more than 20 years, the commission said, treated its employees “extremely unfairly” and may have violated anti-discrimination laws.
Ms Ayton told the committee that Mr. Wang, who took over the store in 2016, had been “wanting to fire me” because she wasn’t Chinese.
In this case, the vice-chairman Peter Sams carried out a search on the Internet and found "a number of job advertisements that Mr. Wang has posted on various Chinese-Australian employment forums in the past".
Among the job requirements listed in these positions, one of them said â€œPreferred Asian ladiesâ€ and the other said â€œPreferred Asian employeesâ€ .
In the third post, he said, he was “more inclined to overseas people (sic).”
Mr Wang fired Ms Ayton via text message in April this year, which he later said was due to her absenteeism and an alleged lack of cash at the cash register ranging from $5.10 to $30.
However, Mr. Sams said Mr. Wang’s reasons for dismissing Ms Ayton were weak and there was a lack of evidence.
In the past three years, she has only been absent from one shift, and the "missing amount" has totaled a few Australian dollars.
Ms Ayton’s firing “actually had nothing to do with her actions or performances,” he said.
“In my opinion, supported by the evidence of Mr. Wang’s job ads,” he said, “the real incentive for the apologists to fire her was that he preferred to hire an employee with an Asian background,” he said.
Under Section 772(f) of the Fair Work Act, Mr. Wang’s actions ostensibly constitute a violation of the Anti-Discrimination Act and/or an unlawful act of dismissal against the applicant.”
Mr. Sams said it would be inappropriate for Wang to consider resuming her position in the light of his “horrible” treatment of Ms Ayton.
He should consider paying compensation to Ms Ayton, who is a temp at $26 an hour.
In the light of possible violations of anti-discrimination and industrial relations legislation, Sams said he would refer his ruling and documents to the committee’s superintendent to consider whether Mr. Wang’s actions should be transferred to other bodies to investigate possible violations of state or federal law.
He said Mr. Wang did not give Ms Ayton any opportunity to respond allegedly as a reason for dismissing her.
“In my opinion,” he said, “I believe that the apologists have resorted to an incorrigible unfair and biased process to dismiss the applicant, and Mr. Wang ‘waits’ for this opportunity, which he believes will ‘justifies’ the termination of the applicant’s employment,” he said.
“He was wrong . . . in dismissing the applicant with complete disregard for any natural and just treatment given to her, and it is appalling that he acted impertinently and grossly unjustly perfunctorily.”
Mr. Sams said that although Foodworks is a small business, â€œit has to be frank that any decent employer will not fire an employee in a way that is grossly unfair and perfunctory that is admitted in this case.â€
He said, "It's disgraceful, it's grossly unfair."
Canton railway to meet the National Day Golden Week passenger flow daily increase in passenger trains 175 - Sino-Singapore network
GUANGZHOU, Sept. 27 (Guo Jun 徐婧 ) The reporter learned on the 27th that in order to meet the travel needs of the National Day Golden Week passengers, Canton Railway Group will successively increase the number of popular trains in the direction, with an average of 175 passenger trains per day during the holiday period, which comprehensively increases the capacity during the peak of the National Day Golden Week passenger flow.
Guangzhou Railway Group will take a number of measures to do a good job in passenger service during the peak period of passenger flow.
Guangzhou South Railway Station has optimized the transformation of the three-layer security lanes, the addition of 12 security lanes, after the new transformation, the three-story waiting room has a total of 44 security lanes, in addition, in order to unblock the flow of passengers, Guangzhou South Railway Station has added 19 self-service real-name verification equipment, a total of 71 units.
In order to alleviate the detention and congestion of vehicles on the north-south road of the South Railway Station, three new parking lots will be opened in Guangzhou South Railway Station, adding 1,000 new parking spaces to alleviate the pressure of poor traffic around the South Railway Station.
Shenzhen North Railway Station will open a "high-speed rail - subway" inspection-free green channel.
From October 6th to 7th, when the passenger flow reaches the peak time, the A2 exit of Shenzhen North Railway Station will be connected with the subway to set up inspection-free channels to provide convenient travel for passengers arriving during peak hours.
In addition, the east-west plaza will normally set up a U-color love express lane, which will serve passengers and special key passengers who arrive at the station 15 minutes before driving.
On the eve of the National Day Golden Week, the Guangjiu passenger section carried out full-time business training, to ensure that the whole staff who are responsible for crew work learn to master business knowledge, improve the quality of service, and to ensure that train attendants with a good mental outlook and a more professional standard of business quality, to do a good job in every flight to provide better service for passengers.
Six people denied that they were involved in the sale of pseudo-maka newspaper papers before the high court for trial.
Six men suspected of falsifying and selling our passports, birth papers and identity cards, including an assistant director of the National Name Registration Bureau, and a Datuk-level businessman, passed the case on Thursday, and the court judge approved allegations of anti-trafficking and anti-trafficking of immigrants and handed them over to the High Court for trial.
Among them, the defense lawyer who originally represented Datuk Chinese defendant Li Zhenhua, who was also a member of the Sunset Cave District Congress, applied to the judge to withdraw from the trial on behalf of the case, that is, no longer became the defendant's representative lawyer and was approved in court.
He said that he himself had attracted criticism from political opponents on behalf of the accused, and his party of action had also been implicated.
He stressed that he was not afraid of any threats, but did not want to be used by irresponsible units to smear the Pakatan Harapan government or other Pakatan Harapan leaders, so after careful consideration to make this decision.
He also said that there is no conflict of interest on behalf of the defendant and as a member of Congress, and that he has not been legally prohibited from representing any of the defendants, and so far, defendant Li Zhenhua has not yet been convicted.
The six defendants were charged in court on September 12 of this year, facing a number of anti-trafficking and anti-inflicted immigration orders, as well as in Section 466 of the Penal Code (forgery of documents), and were not approved by the court on bail pending trial.
On Thursday, the two court judges, Nosaha, and Mazlan, after the prosecution's statements, approved the prosecution's application to refer the allegations of the anti-trafficking and anti-trafficking immigration laws involved by the six defendants to the Supreme Court; the charges of falsification of the documents will go to court on October 3, waiting for the prosecution to hand over the documents to the defense.
The previous six defendants were arrested under the National Security Offences (Special Measures) Act 2012 (SOSMA), so the judge did not grant bail.
Walking with the motherland - a certain team of the armed police force
Jinqiu, on the military parade training ground, an armed police unit composed of officers and soldiers with an average height of 1.83 meters is busy in training.
The shiny stings, the unique olive green and bright red epaulets together form a beautiful landscape.
A few days ago, the reporter walked into this team and felt the determination of armed police officers and soldiers to always be loyal guardians of the party and the people, as well as the feelings and pursuits of their "honour supremacy".
â€œThe dream illuminates the glorious life and writes the immortal legend of the new eraâ€ . . this is the team song created by the officers and soldiers of the team â€“ â€œwalking with the motherlandâ€.
In the team, this song is the motto of every team member.
With a height of 1.92 meters, Qi Xiaoguang is particularly conspicuous standing in the square team.
As the flag bearer of the original armed police flag guard, he has a deeper understanding of the honor.
A soldier’s honor comes from hard training.
As the flag bearer of Qi Xiaoguang, the training has always been a high standard of strict requirements.
He tied the sandbag to practice the shape, stuck with the stopwatch to practice the pace, blindfolded to practice the stride, against the wind to practice stability.
There is a picture that will never be forgotten in his "master-flag career".
During a flag-raising ceremony, heavy rain poured down, and none of the tourists who came to watch the flag-raising ceremony left.
The moment the flag was raised, Qi Xiaoguang deeply felt the glory represented by the five-star red flag on his shoulders.
In 2019, Qi Xiaoguang was selected as the benchmark.
Standards are different for benchmark soldiers and flag-bearers .
Qi Xiaoguang introduced that although the progress of the standard bearer and the benchmark soldier is only more than 20 steps, more efforts must be made in the training.
The benchmark soldier is the first in the first row, which directly determines the neatness of the team.
After the military parade focused on training, he repeatedly kicked his legs every day and practiced the hard work.
In the demonstration and demonstration, his precise stride and speed won the applause of officers and soldiers.
In the team, almost every soldier has the same experience.
The father of the soldier Zhu Xu Dongfang participated in the 50th National Day military parade 20 years ago.
In order to follow in the footsteps of his father and become a member of the team, he suffered setbacks again and again, but he was never discouraged.
He said, â€œBeing able to walk through Tiananmen Square like my father and accept the review of the party and the people is the glory of my whole life, and I am willing to eat and suffer.â€
Entering the honor room of the party team, "the capital's elite teacher to maintain the stability of the elite" eight big words into view.
Wang Qian, a political commissar of the party, introduced that the team members are all from the Beijing headquarters of the People's Armed Police - this is a force with a glorious tradition, which has shouldered the major tasks such as the founding ceremony, the National Day celebrations, the security of the previous party's national congresses, and counter-terrorism and the maintenance of stability in the capital.
Celebrating the 70th anniversary of the founding of the People's Republic of China Foreign Expert Reception Han Zheng attended and delivered a speech
Celebrating the 70th anniversary of the founding of the People's Republic of China, the reception of foreign experts was held in the Great Hall of the People on the evening of the 27th, attended by the Standing Committee of the Politburo of the CPC Central Committee and the Vice Premier of the State Council.
On behalf of the Chinese government, on behalf of President Xi Jinping, he expressed his sincere gratitude and extended his sincere greetings to all foreign experts and international friends who care about, supported and participated in China's reform and opening-up and modernization.
Han Zheng said that since the founding of the People's Republic of New China, especially over the past 40 years of reform and opening up, the Communist Party of China has united and led the people of all ethnic groups in the country to overcome the thorns and strive for strength, successfully walked out of a path of socialism with Chinese characteristics, and ushered in a great leap from standing up and getting rich to getting stronger.
Since the 18th National Congress of the Communist Party of China, the Party Central Committee, with Comrade Xi Jinping as the core, has comprehensively promoted the overall layout of the "five-in-one", coordinated the promotion of the "four comprehensive" strategic layout, promoted the historic achievements and historic changes in the cause of the party and the state, and socialism with Chinese characteristics has entered a new era.
The 70-year development achievements of New China are the result of the unremitting struggle of the Chinese people of all ethnic groups, and they are also condensed by the hard work of foreign experts.
In the past 70 years, a large number of foreign experts have come to China to jointly participate in the cause of modernization with the Chinese people and make indelible contributions that the Chinese people will never forget.
Han Zheng pointed out that China's development has stood at a new historical starting point, and the Chinese people are making unremitting efforts to build a well-off society in an all-round way, seize the great victory of socialism with Chinese characteristics in the new era, and realize the great rejuvenation of the Chinese nation.
"Development is the first priority, talents are the first resource, innovation is the first driving force", vigorously implement the innovation-driven development strategy, and promote high-quality economic development.
China will accelerate the cultivation of a large number of strategic scientific and technological talents, scientific and technological leading talents, young scientific and technological talents and high-level innovation teams.
Han Zheng said that China's cause is a cause supported by the people of the world, a cause of open learning to the whole world, and a cause of cooperation with other countries around the world.
With a more open and inclusive attitude, China will humbly learn from the peoples of the world and earnestly implement a more active, more open and more effective talent introduction policy.
We earnestly welcome more and more foreign experts come to China for innovation and entrepreneurship, welcome the participation of talented and talented people from all over the world in China's modernization, and make greater contributions to promoting the construction of a community with a shared future for mankind and the development of world peace and the cause of human progress.
Liu He, Yang Jiechi, Chen Xi, Zhang Chunxian, Xiao Jie and Wan Gang attended the reception.
The reception was hosted by the Minister of Science and Technology Wang Zhigang.
The reception was attended by elderly foreign experts working in China for a long period of time, representatives of foreign experts and their spouses working in China, responsible comrades of the relevant departments of the central and state organs, Beijing, with a total of about 1,800 people.
China's most advanced railway drilled to the end.
Xinhua News Agency, Kunming, September 27 (Reporter Ding Yiquan) According to the news of the China Railway Tunnel Bureau Group Co., Ltd., China's first long-term tunnel of the railway - Da (li) Rui (Li) Railway Gaoligongshan Tunnel No. 1 shaft was successfully excavated to the end on the 27th, with a well depth of 762.59 meters to break the deepest record of the domestic railway shaft.
In tunnel construction, shafts can play a role in improving tunnel ventilation, improving efficiency, and ensuring construction safety.
Song Tao, chief engineer of the Darui project department of the China Railway Tunnel Bureau, said: "After the successful excavation of the main bificle of Gaoligongshan Tunnel No. 1, it will help to promote the construction of the bottom of the well yard, open a number of work surfaces for the post-construction building, and accelerate the construction progress of the entire Gaoligong Mountain Tunnel."
Songtao introduced, Gaoligong Mountain Tunnel No. 1 shaft construction using chirping method, equipped with scuttling, scuttling crane, overall mobile metal template, FJD-6A Umbrella Drill, the central rotary rock machine and other large-scale specialized machinery, the formation of mechanized excavation system, excavation system, suspension system, embroidery improvement system and other "four systems".
It is understood that the Dazhong railway from Dali, west to Ruili, with a total length of about 331 kilometers and a design speed of 140 kilometers per hour, it is an important part of the China-Myanmar international railway channel.
With a total length of 34.538 kilometers, it is the first long tunnel of China's railway.
The TV series "fox-hunting" in the field to reproduce the first-line detective police style
The cross-border escape detective drama "fox hunting" was recently filmed on the ground at Tianjin Airport, and Wang Kai, Wang Guo and other actors were filmed on the spot and escorting important scenes such as the return of fugitive economic suspects, and the filming process was supported by China Southern Airlines.
At the airport, the fox-hunting crew filmed the key drama that can best show the law enforcement results of the "fox hunting operation" - the fox-hunting action team members to pursue the fugitive's return to China, take off the plane and sign the arrest warrant.
The crew captured the apron, customs border inspection, aircraft cabins, doors and many other sets of shots, reproducing China's front-line detective and fox-hunting heroes to fly more than a variety of countries, to catch fugitive criminals' hardships and professional style.
In order to successfully complete the filming, the original team of Fox Hunting carried out a large number of preliminary preparations and repeatedly confirmed every execution detail to ensure that it showed the most realistic and direct visual effects.
It is reported that the show will also be filmed in many foreign countries.
Việt Nam must seize the opportunity for the development of artificial intelligence.
The four criteria used to evaluate and rank each city in the preparation level of the AI wave include prospects, realization capabilities, asset base and development direction.
The city of Singapore ranked first, followed by cities in the United Kingdom, the United States, France, Sweden, the Netherlands, Germany and Australia.
Oliver Wyman, an expert at Oliver Wyman, said in an interview with reporters: â€œI think it makes a lot of sense to look back and evaluate cities such as Hanoi and Ho Chi Minh City in Vietnam.
In general, I think Vietnam's future is very bright in the context of a high growth rate, a strong economic development path and a rapidly developing talent base.
“I think Vietnam is on the right path and is doing a good job.
It’s important for Vietnam to know how to take advantage of the opportunities offered by the Fourth Industrial Revolution to drive greater economic growth.”
Artificial intelligence is completely changing people’s work, communication and lifestyle.
It leads to greater efficiency, but it also poses the threat of exacerbating social, economic, and technological inequalities.
However, according to a global study organized by Oliver Wyman, only any city in the world in the world is ready for a breakthrough in the era of artificial intelligence.
