Wang Yi Meets with Malawi's Foreign Minister Kasera
On the 26th local time, State Councilor and Foreign Minister Wang Yi met with Foreign Minister Casella of Malawi on the sidelines of the United Nations General Assembly attending the United Nations General Assembly in New York.
Wang Yi said that in the past 12 years since the establishment of diplomatic relations between China and Malaysia, bilateral relations have developed in a healthy and stable manner, and exchanges and cooperation in various fields have progressed steadily.
Last year, President Xi Jinping invited President Mutarika to China to attend the Beijing Summit of the Forum on China-Africa Cooperation, and the two heads of state held a fruitful meeting, leading China-Marine relations to a new level.
The Chinese side is willing to work with the Malaysian side to continue to implement the important consensus of the two heads of state and the outcomes of the Beijing Summit of the Forum on China-Africa Cooperation, so as to promote the further development of practical cooperation between the two countries.
The Chinese side is willing to strengthen communication and coordination with the Malaysian side in international affairs and safeguard the common interests of the two sides and the overall situation of China-Africa relations.
Casella said that China is a true friend of Malawi and African countries, and China's development has benefited the people of Malawi.
The Malaysian side adheres to the one-China policy and is grateful for China's support and assistance to Malawi.
The Malaysian side looks forward to the further development of Malaysia-China relations and welcomes more Chinese enterprises to invest and start businesses in Malaysia.
More than 800 million National Day trips reflect China's tourism supply and demand
About 800 million people will travel in the upcoming "Eleven" Golden Week!
A number of tourism platform big data show that China's tourism consumer market supply and demand two prosperity.
The Ctrip National Day tourism report predicts that according to the National Day tourism statistics in previous years, it is expected that the number of domestic tourists will be close to 800 million during the National Day holiday this year; there will also be more than 7.5 million out-of-country tourism.
At present, tourists from more than 500 cities use the platform to book group tours, free travel, customized tourism, local play and other products, involving more than 100 countries and regions.
According to estimates by the China Tourism Research Institute, last year's National Day holiday received a total of 726 million domestic tourists, an increase of 9.43 percent year-on-year.
This year's National Day holiday will not only reach a new high in the number of tourists, consumption upgrades will also become the "main theme" of National Day holiday travel.
According to the Ctrip report, more than 3,000 yuan was spent on domestic inter-provincial tourism on the National Day holiday, an increase from the same period last year, which is due to the fact that tourists generally chose to experience better products, such as high-scoring brand hotels, non-shopping tour groups, exquisite small groups, and special car guides.
According to the booking data of donkey mother travel network, the use of comfortable models in the domestic long-term, less than ten "private groups" are more popular than in previous years.
Spring and autumn tourism data show that its consumers are more interested in heavy experience, heavy service, heavy differentiation of the "scrutable".
The flying pig data show that China's fourth-tier and lower-tier urban tourist bookings grew the fastest, with a year-on-year growth rate of 30%, refracting the upgrading of household consumption in more parts of the country.
Personalization is a major feature of this year's "Eleven" Golden Week tourism.
Ctrip data show that the National Day holiday self-guided travel orders are expected to increase by nearly 60% year-on-year, short-distance self-guided trips to explore the surrounding niche routes continue to be popular; the number of private group applicants increased by as much as 155% year-on-year.
Shared joy has become the main purpose of people's tourism and leisure.
Ctrip data show that 28% of National Day holiday tourists are parent-child groups, 25% are couples traveling, and 23% are colleagues and friends traveling together.
From the perspective of the age of tourists, "post-80s" and "post-90s" account for more than 50% of the total number of tourists.
It is worth noting that, unlike the rapid growth of out-of-country travel in the Golden Week in the past, the performance of the domestic tourism market this year is more "eye-catching".
Flying pig data show that this year's National Day holiday to book the number of domestic cultural and tourism routes increased by 42% year-on-year, the growth rate of out-of-country travel.
According to the industry's analysis, at the same time as the strong demand, all parts of the country to promote tourism supply-side reform, for tourists to provide a more abundant "travel feast".
For example, the State General Administration of Sports and the Ministry of Culture and Tourism recently jointly released the â€œ2019 11th Golden Week Sports Tourism Boutique Lineâ€; the 2019 Shanghai Tourism Festival, which is being held, has launched 100 cultural and tourism activities in seven sectors to attract Chinese and foreign tourists to participate; near the Golden Week, Henan, Zhejiang, Hunan, Shandong and many other provinces have introduced ticket price reduction or free measures in scenic spots.
Ctrip booking data show that the country with unique natural scenery or cultural characteristics of the destination the most "fire", Chongqing, Wuhan, Hangzhou, Xi'an, Chengdu, Guangzhou, Beijing, Shanghai, Nanjing and Tianjin will be the most popular domestic tourist destination cities.
Our country's first live-streamed cinema film "At This Moment - Celebrating the 70th Birthday of New China" will be broadcast simultaneously in 70 theaters in more than 10 provinces across the country on October 1.
The China Central Radio and Television Station will use 4K ultra-high-definition signals to broadcast the 70th anniversary of the founding of the People's Republic of China on the big screen.
The person in charge of the central radio and television station introduced in Beijing on the 27th that on the National Day, the main station will build more than 100 seats, and more than 200 pickup devices will be installed along Chang'an Street and the commanding heights of the festivities, using lens language and contemporaneous sound to realize the whole process, all-factor 4K ultra-high-definition and 5.1 surround sound broadcast for the first time.
China is expected to become Australia's largest beef export market.
A Rabobank animal protein analyst said China faced a severe pork shortage after the outbreak of African swine fever, which is expected to become Australia's largest beef export market.
After the outbreak, Chinese consumers are switching from eating pork to other animal proteins, which has caused the authorities to destroy many herds, and in the past year, the number of live pigs in China has been halved, and the price of pork has almost doubled.
China consumes and consumes two-thirds of the world’s pork.
Chenjun Pan, a senior animal protein analyst at Rabobank China, said that demand for other meats, including beef, has increased, and China, the world's largest importer of animal protein, currently accounts for 27% of the world's pork imports and 24% of the world's beef imports.
In the first half of this year, China's beef imports from Australia increased by 65%, and China overtook the United States and Japan to become Australia's largest beef export market.
Yesterday, the Chinese government said it would release more pork from its emergency reserves before celebrating the 70th anniversary of the Chinese Communist Party.
White paper: China has always put its own development in the coordinate system of human development
The white paper said that China has always placed its own development in the coordinate system of human development, and has always closely linked its own destiny with the fate of the peoples of the world.
The white paper said that China promotes world peace and development with its own development.
As the largest developing country in the world, China has unswervingly followed its own path and focused its efforts on running its own affairs, making the country richer and stronger and the people happier, and injecting stability and certainty into a complex and ever-changing world, which in itself is the greatest contribution to world peace and development.
Under the guidance of Xi Jinping's socialist ideas with Chinese characteristics in the new era, China will continue to unswervingly take the path of socialism with Chinese characteristics.
China has always taken economic construction as the focus of the country, unswervingly taken the road of high-quality development, implemented the new development concept of innovation, coordination, green, openness and sharing, accelerated the construction of a modern economic system, and better met the growing needs of the people for a better life.
Allowing ordinary people to have a good life has always been the biggest goal of China's development.
China's army has always been a staunch defender of world peace.
The white paper pointed out that China adheres to win-win cooperation and common development.
"The Chinese people not only want to have a good life for themselves, they also hope that the people of other countries will live a good life."
China adheres to the integration of development and innovation, growth linkage and interests, promotes the high-quality development of the “Belt and Road”, and promotes the cause of global poverty reduction and development.
The white paper said that China has firmly safeguarded and promoted economic globalization.
China is an active participant in economic globalization and a staunch supporter.
China is willing to work with the international community to take the initiative to strengthen guidance and make the process of economic globalization more dynamic, more inclusive and more sustainable.
China will implement a more proactive opening-up strategy, create a more comprehensive, in-depth and more diversified pattern of opening-up, achieve broader mutual benefit and win-win results, and maintain and promote economic globalization with practical actions.
China firmly opposes unilateralism and protectionism, and the door to opening up to the outside world will open wider and wider, accelerate regional economic integration, and continue to promote the internationalization of the RMB.
The white paper pointed out that China firmly supports multilateralism and upholds international fairness and justice.
As always, China will firmly uphold the international system with the United Nations as the core, the international order with the purposes and principles of the Charter of the United Nations at its core, work with other countries to adhere to multilateralism and oppose unilateralism.
Safeguarding fairness and justice is China's basic criterion for dealing with international issues.
China respects the development path and social system independently chosen by the people of all countries, respects the sovereignty and territorial integrity of various countries, and opposes interference by external forces in the internal affairs of other countries.
China will never impose its will on others, nor will it allow anyone to impose their will on the Chinese people.
The white paper said that China actively participates in leading the reform and construction of the global governance system.
As a responsible big country, China has always adhered to the balance of rights and obligations, not only seeing the requirements of China's development for the world, but also seeing the expectations of the international community towards China and actively participating in the reform and construction of the global governance system.
China actively supports the reform of the United Nations, promoting the United Nations to better adapt to the new requirements of global governance in terms of ideas, institutional settings and operating models, better fulfills its responsibilities under the Charter of the United Nations, and plays a greater role in maintaining world peace and promoting common development.
China has actively promoted the innovative development of the concept of global governance, summed up the successful practice and experience of national governance in a timely manner, actively explored the positive way of handling the world in Chinese culture, the resonance of the concept of governance with the current era, and strived to contribute China's wisdom, Chinese solutions and Chinese strength to the improvement of global governance.
Wang Yi: To help Africa achieve peace and security, China has never been absent.
On September 26, local time, State Councilor and Foreign Minister Wang Yi attended the Security Council's public meeting on "Peace and Security in Africa" at United Nations Headquarters in New York.
In his speech, Wang Yi said that China and Africa are good friends, good brothers and good partners.
To help Africa maintain peace and security, China has never been absent.
At this very moment, more than 2,000 Chinese peacekeepers are guarding peace in the five United Nations mission areas in Africa.
For more than 10 years, the Chinese navy has been escorting more than 1,200 batches of more than 6,700 ships.
We support Africa's efforts to strengthen peace and security capabilities.
The "China-United Nations Peace and Development Fund" announced by President Xi Jinping in September 2015 will focus on supporting Africa's peacekeeping, counter-terrorism and achieving sustainable development. So far, it has carried out 34 Africa-related projects, becoming a new platform for trilateral trilateral cooperation between China, Africa and the United Nations.
On the road to achieving Africa's peaceful development, China will continue to stand firmly with Africa and walk side by side.
The world's oldest hairdresser has died at the age of 108 with a 96-year-old haircut.
Anthony Mancinelli, the world's oldest barber certified by the Guinness Book of World Records in the United States in New York, is a 108-year-old who has never retired every day for a guest's haircut, but on the 19th Mancinelli passed away due to complications of jaw cancer, saying goodbye to his 96-year-long haircut.
According to "CNN" reported that Manxinelli immigrated to the United States at the age of 8, did not take a long time in a barbershop to help clean the floor, at the age of 12 began to pick up scissors to serve the guests, so as to reduce the family's economic pressure.
Mancinelli attended elementary school at the time, but did not graduate.
Mancinelli’s son, Robert, revealed that his father loves to work, and people from all over the world also love him, but although he has always been healthy, he was diagnosed with cancer in February of this year and was finally unable to work six weeks before his death, but this is not retirement, because he plans to come back and cut his hair.
The 82-year-old Robert said he now had to find a new hairdresser after his father’s death because he asked him to cut his hair all his life.
The repurchase scale of listed companies reached a record high of more than 100 billion yuan - Xinhua
In order to stabilize the company's stock price and maintain the company's image, the listed companies began to frequently repurchase shares in the past two years, hoping to pass the company's undervalued information to the market through directional repurchase and collective bidding transactions, so as to stabilize the share price and enhance investor confidence.
Oriental Fortune Choice data show that in 2017, the funds used by listed companies to repurchase shares were 7.9 billion yuan, which soared to 51 billion yuan in 2018, and since 2019, A-share listed companies have repurchased a total amount of more than 100 billion yuan, setting a new high in A-share historical repurchasing funds, far higher than in previous years.
Judging from the purpose of repurchase, the company's repurchasing shares seems to be the same as that of major shareholders, but there is a big difference in terms of implementation subjects, sources of funds, repurchase purposes, and the rights and interests of the shares themselves.
In an interview with the "Securities Daily" reporter, Xu Yang, chairman of Shanghai Mei Kerong Information Consulting Co., Ltd., said in an interview with the "Opinions on Supporting Listed Companies Repurchasing Shares" issued in November 2018, it was repaired for the problems of the current system such as a relatively narrow range of share repurchasions, complex decision-making procedures and inadequate inventory systems.
In January of this year, the Shanghai Stock Exchange and the Shenzhen Stock Exchange officially released the "Implementation Rules for Repurchasing Shares of Listed Companies", and the introduction of these policies has broadened listed companies' repurchasing sources of funds, appropriately simplified implementation procedures, guided and improved governance arrangements, and encouraged all kinds of listed companies to implement equity incentives or employee shareholding plans.
After the introduction of opinions, listed companies carry out the operation of share repurchase, with more applicable circumstances, the repurchase process is simpler, and the enthusiasm for share repurchase is also greater.
Repurchasing shares in a relatively low position is also conducive to listed companies to improve the efficiency of the use of funds, thereby increasing the level of earnings per share, improving the return on net assets, and reducing the pressure on the company's profit indicators.
Compared with the increase in the holdings of major shareholders, the repurchasing of shares by listed companies is of greater significance, which also reflects the willingness of listed companies to actively manage market capitalization and abundant cash flow.
Xu Yang believes that the undervalued stock price is the main reason for the repurchase of listed companies, the company's share price can no longer reflect the company's future development prospects, so this kind of company is worthy of the attention of investors, but can not blindly invest, need to pay attention to the financial reports of such listed companies and the specific business situation.
Listed companies with large-scale repurchase behavior have at least demonstrated the company's development confidence and financial strength.
The repurchase enthusiasm of A-share listed companies has gradually warmed up, which has normalized repurchase behavior, and the data shows that nearly a thousand listed companies have implemented share repurchases this year, and leading companies in various industries have become the main force in the repurchase market.
China Ping An recently disclosed repurchasing progress said that the company has repurchased 57.59 million A-share shares through centralized bidding transactions, accounting for 0.315% of the company's total share capital, the total amount of funds paid 5 billion yuan (excluding transaction costs), repurchasing shares will all be used for employee shareholding plans, including but not limited to the long-term service plan that has been considered at the company's shareholders meeting.
Yili shares have paid 5.792 billion yuan for share repurchase, and in the recent adjustment of the use of repurchasing shares, from the original plan "repurchase shares will be all used as a source of shares for the later implementation of equity incentives" to "cumulative repurchase of 183 million shares, of which 152 million shares are used for the implementation of equity incentives of the stock source, the remaining 30.49 million shares will be used to cancel to reduce the registered capital".
Yili said that the cancellation of some of the repurchased shares is conducive to further improving the level of earnings per share and effectively improving the return on investment of the company's shareholders.
TCL Group issued a repurchase progress announcement on September 25, showing that TCL Group repurchased 3.59% of the company's shares, with a total cost of 1.65 billion yuan.
TCL Group's board office told the "Securities Daily" reporter that repurchasing shares will be used for employee shareholding plans, equity incentives, or corporate bonds that can be converted into stocks issued by listed companies.
TCL Group adheres to the established business strategy to continuously improve its competitiveness and sustainable and healthy development.
Based on confidence in the company's future development and the protection of investors' interests, combined with the performance of the company's shares in the secondary market for nearly a year, and taking into account the company's operating conditions and financial situation, the company plans to use its own funds, self-funding and other financing methods to repurchase the company's shares.
Yang Delong, chief economist of Qianhai Open Source Fund, said that the operation of repurchasing shares of listed companies, on the one hand, it can reduce the number of shares circulating in the market and increase the per-share earnings of listed companies, which is an important benefit for the share price of the secondary market; in addition, listed companies are willing to take out real gold and silver and repurchase shares from the stock market, which has greatly boosted market confidence.
Repurchasing of domestic listed companies has gradually increased in recent years, especially high-performing stocks, and it is a very good way to boost investor confidence through share repurchase, and it is also a practice worthy of recognition and encouragement.
The Standing Committee of Hunan Provincial Party Committee, Changsha Municipal Party Secretary Hu Henghua and the four leaders of the construction machinery manufacturing Xiangjun - Zhan Chunxin, Liang Zhengen, He Tsinghua and Liu Feixiang, set up a "small goal" around "Changsha from construction machinery to intelligent manufacturing" - to build the world's leading construction machinery industry cluster after three or five years.
To build the world's leading construction machinery industry cluster in Changsha, in the current fashionable terms, is to create the "strongest on the surface".
As an inland provincial capital city, Changsha shouts out this heroic speech, where is the bottom line?
It’s based on the power of leakage.
Participating in the dialogue of the four construction machinery enterprises, each handy, covering the whole fields of heaven, underground, sea and land: Shanhe intelligent light aircraft, Zoomlion's concrete transport pump, Sanyi Heavy Industry's all-ground crane, iron construction heavy industry tunnel shield machine, its "hard strength" can be described as a stand-by world.
At one time, China basically did not have a right to speak in the field of construction machinery manufacturing.
With the passage of the world, Chinese enterprises "introduction" and "going out" two-wheel drive, taking advantage of the east wind of the "Belt and Road" initiative, acquisitions, mergers, factories and many other measures, has become a leader in the global construction machinery industry.
Among them, the construction machinery leading enterprises such as Sany Heavy Industry, Zhongzhong Heavy Industry, Iron Construction Heavy Industry, and Shanhe Intelligent have significantly led similar enterprises in terms of their output value, market share, and sales.
It’s the time when the camera moves.
Construction machinery Xiangjun "Big Four King Kong", is Changsha construction machinery industry cluster leader, but also the world's leading construction machinery industry enterprises.
In the rivers and lakes of the global industry, those who live down, and live well, is the hard breath to speak.
In the early years, the global construction machinery industry suffered a cold winter, a lot of internationally renowned construction machinery manufacturing enterprises have fallen down, but Changsha's construction machinery manufacturing enterprises will "cat winter" as a "winter swimming", self-pressure, self-breakthrough, through the transformation of the industrial structure, from manufacturing to intelligent transformation, not only through the past, and the bones are stronger.
It’s up to the stars of the moon’s government to give strength.
The development of advantageous industries also requires enterprises to be aggressive, but also the active actions of the government.
The reason why Changsha has the reputation of "construction machinery capital" is that it brings together the entire industrial chain from upstream to downstream, creates a number of related industrial clusters, and has greatly reduced the cost of R&D, manufacturing and sales by optimizing the business environment, improving supporting services, and simplifying the approval process.
Good business ecology, so that the construction machinery manufacturing enterprises come.
History has pushed Changsha to the forefront of building the leading level of global construction machinery.
Whether it is the government, or the enterprise, and even related to the production, university and research and other links, we should seize the opportunity, follow the trend, bite the target, continue to make efforts, and contribute to the construction and manufacture of a strong country in Hunan.
Wang Yi presided over the foreign ministers' meeting of China and the African members of the Security Council.
Wang Yi said that China and African countries are good fraternities and good partners.
Whether in the past, the present or the future, China stands firmly with its African brothers.
We advocate the holding of such a Foreign Ministers' Meeting as a concrete measure to implement the important consensus reached by President Xi Jinping and the leaders of African countries at the Beijing Summit of the Forum on China-Africa Cooperation in September last year, in order to strengthen solidarity and cooperation between China and African countries in the Security Council, and in order to push the international community to better support Africa in achieving peace and development.
Wang Yi said that Africa is China's most important and trusted partner.
As a permanent member, China's vote in the Security Council always belongs to the vast number of developing countries, including African countries.
In the face of the new situation, China is willing to work with African countries in the Security Council to strengthen solidarity and cooperation and safeguard common interests.
The two sides should rely on unity and strength, rely on consultation to resolve disputes, rely on self-reliance, rely on self-improvement, and rely on development and governance.
The foreign ministers of the participating African member states thanked China for its initiative to hold this meeting and congratulated New China on its 70th anniversary.
The foreign ministers said that Africa-China relations are based on equality and mutual respect, and Africa and China have always been the most reliable and trustworthy partners for each other.
The African side appreciates China's playing an important and positive role as a permanent member of the UN Security Council in African affairs, has effectively promoted a just and reasonable settlement of the African issue, and made great efforts and contributions to safeguarding Africa's interests and promoting African peace and security.
At present, Africa is facing the threat of terrorism and extremism, and only by addressing security issues can Africa truly achieve long-term peaceful development.
We look forward to further co-ordinating positions with China in the Security Council and strengthening solidarity and cooperation.
Wang Yi said that today's meeting has reached an important consensus.
We all support safeguarding multilateralism, strengthening the authority and role of the United Nations, upholding the purposes and principles of the Charter of the United Nations, opposing unilateralism and bullying; we all agree to strengthen China-Africa mutual support and cooperation in the affairs of the United Nations and the Security Council to safeguard the common interests of China and Africa and the vast number of developing countries; we all support African countries to solve Africa's problems in an African way and ask the United Nations to provide financial support for Africa's self-peace; we all support the concept of "cooperation for development, development for peace" to help African countries to achieve independent sustainable development.
Gansu qingyang: the lake bales to "get out of poverty".
The autumn of September renders the Loess Plateau.
In the professional co-operative of Yimin breeding in Yima Town, 58-year-old villager Chaveli filled the trough in the goat fold with the last spade, guarding the trough on the edge of the groove, and watched the white lake sheep chew.
â€œEat well, wait for the autumn and winter to be full, and you can sell it at a good price.â€
Shawilli said that he fed the sheep a "specially nutritious meal" every day, regularly cleaned, sterilized and sterilized, and did not dare to shudder.
Chaveli raised sheep for more than 20 years, until he came to work in a cooperative to find out how extensive the sheep was in the past.
Xavili is a resident of Xia Taochi Village, Yima Town, Qingcheng County, Qingyang City, Gansu Province.
His left and right neighbors are sheep farmers, but they adhere to the traditional free-ranging method, the quality of the sheep is poor, and the output is small.
In June of this year, under the guidance of the government, 140 poor people in the village joined the cooperative, and everything began to change.
Chaveli buried his head all day to engage in farming, because his heart is always full of strength.
Those who invest in the shares are all poor households, and they all trust the sheep to the cooperative, and whether they can pay dividends and sell the price at the end of the year depends on him.
Fortunately, with the guidance of technical personnel, he slowly learned to engage in anti-epidemic, mastered scientific feeding, and became one of the village's few breeding "good style".
Yimin breeding professional cooperative is a standardized cooperative, with a total of 16 Aries sheds and nearly 1,400 lake sheep.
Zou Tao, the person in charge of the cooperative, said that there are many doorways inside and outside the standardized sheep shed.
"The wool is thick, it is easy to breed bacterium, the lake sheep can't stay in a sweltering and humid place, the sheep shed must be built on the three sides of the ditch, but also have to replace the fan to ventilate and dissipate."
Zou Tao said that in order to prevent the epidemic, it is also necessary to disinfect the sheep shed spray on a regular basis and give the sheep three to four anti-epidemic injections in the first quarter.
In addition to living well, "little fat sheep" also have to eat silage mixed with silage corn, wheatgrass, alfalfa and so on, and has a wide enough "playground" to stretch the bones.
The cooperative adopts the method of trusteeship and breeding, guiding local farmers to put a good breeding lake sheep here, unified breeding, management and sales, and realized good breeding, scientificization, standardization, and intensive breeding.
At present, there are more than 6000 yuan in dividends of 140 poor households with sheep per year, and there are 4 poverty alleviation objects working in cooperatives.
From â€œgrazingâ€ to â€œaccurate feedingâ€ to â€œlocal matingâ€ to â€œartificial inseminationâ€, from â€œlooking at the body, touching the bellyâ€ to â€œone-by-oneâ€... In Qingyang, Gansu, mutton farming is not only the change of feeding methods, â€œleading enterprises + cooperatives + farmersâ€ .
Zou Tao said that if the market price is weak, the local leading enterprise Gansu Zhongsheng Agricultural and Animal Husbandry Development Co., Ltd. will be purchased with a market protection price of 27 yuan per kilogram to help farmers disperse market risks.
Xu Jianfeng, general manager of Gansu Zhongsheng Agriculture and Animal Husbandry Development Co., Ltd., said that enterprises have driven more and more poor households to read "sheep scriptures" by providing loan guarantees, sheep supply, order breeding, quotation acquisition, unified processing and sales and other services for poor households.
In Qingyang, at least 8,200 poor families have achieved a steady increase in income by "joining" the forage breeding, good seed breeding, large-scale breeding, slaughter division, and market sales.
The city of Qingyang is located in the staggered agricultural and animal husbandry zone in the north and is rich in forage resources.
At present, there are 913 large-scale lamb farms and cooperative cooperatives in the city, with more than 5 million mutton raising, and two processing production lines of 1.3 million mutton slaughter scale have also been built.
The French finance minister said that he will cut taxes by more than 10 billion euros next year and called on Germany to follow suit.
PARIS, Sept 26 (Reuters) - French Finance Minister Bruno Le Maire said on Thursday that France would cut taxes by more than 10 billion euros ($10.9 billion) next year, and that Germany should keep pace with France’s fiscal stimulus to reinvigorate its sluggish economy.
Introducing France’s 2020 budget, Le Maire said that the ECB’s latest monetary easing initiative has created an opportunity to increase investment for member governments that can afford them.
The European Central Bank cut interest rates to a record low on September 12, and plans to restart bond purchases in a bid to lower borrowing costs, hoping to incentivize economic recovery and boost inflation.
â€œLow interest rates will not allow Europe to prosper again, and monetary policy measures are necessary but not sufficient,â€ Le Maire told reporters.
â€œGermany needs to make an investment, it needs it now, the sooner the better. Don't wait for the situation to get worse before you act,â€ he added.
He has made this appeal to Germany on several occasions.
This year, France has implemented more than 10 billion euros in tax cuts, which has given a big boost to France's economic growth.
While the global economy has lost momentum, the export-dependent German economy will bear the brunt.
Le Maire pointed out that the tax burden of French families will be reduced by 9.3 billion euros next year, including 5 billion euros in income tax relief.
In addition, the corporate tax burden will be reduced by nearly 1 billion euros by nearly 1 billion euros as the corporate tax rate will be gradually reduced from 33.3% to 25% over a five-year period.
General Secretary Xi Jinping recently made important instructions for the protection of martyr memorial facilities and stressed that it is necessary to strengthen the planning, construction, renovation and management and maintenance of martyrs' cemeteries.
In order to thoroughly implement the spirit of General Secretary Xi Jinping's important instructions and focus on promoting the protection and management of Martyrs' Commemorative Facilities, the General Office of the Central Committee of the Communist Party of China, the General Office of the State Council and the General Office of the Central People's Procuratorate have recently issued the overall work plan for the construction and repair and maintenance of Martyrs' Commemorative Facilities.
The "work plan" is a programmatic document for the protection and management of martyr's commemorative facilities, clarifies the goals and tasks for the protection and management of martyr memorial facilities, proposes to plan and build good martyrs memorial facilities, and improve the red education base system to carry forward the spirit; repair and protect the martyrs' memorial facilities, and create a strong social atmosphere that respects and remembers the achievements; manages and maintains martyr memorial facilities to form a standardized and complete organizational guarantee management system.
It is necessary to strengthen the repair and protection of martyr memorial facilities, in accordance with the principle of overall planning and long-term perspective, effectively strengthen the repair and protection of martyr memorial facilities, focus on improving the leadership system mechanism, improve the policies and laws and regulations; organize and implement quality improvement and renovation projects, improve facilities and equipment, and strengthen service capabilities; optimize the content, innovate the exhibition methods, and improve the overall efficiency.
It is necessary to improve the institutional system and organizational security, strengthen organizational leadership, establish a working mechanism led by the Ministry of Veterans Affairs, the active cooperation of relevant units, and the extensive participation of the society; improve the system of laws and regulations, continue to promote the institutionalization, standardization, and professionalization of the planning and construction of martyr memorial facilities; strengthen team building, introduce volunteer services, and encourage retired soldiers, martyr families, experts and scholars and young students to actively participate in martyr memorial facilities.
Study: U.S. national healthy eating index grows slightly, but still challenging
Recently, a new study in the United States shows that in the past 16 years, the U.S. government's healthy eating index has increased moderately, from 56 to 58.
But with a score of 100, it’s not worth celebrating.
U.S. citizens still face “significant challenges” in their diets.
One of the study’s authors, Dr. Fangfang Zhang, a nutritional researcher at Tufts University in Massachusetts, said that Americans still consume too much food that may cause diseases such as heart disease, diabetes and obesity, which are the most common diseases in the United States.
The research was published in the Journal of the American Medical Association on the 24th.
The study is based on the findings of a U.S. government health survey of 44,000 adults from 1999 to 2016.
The authors write that "remarkable dietary challenges persist despite considerable improvements."
These challenges include allowing U.S. citizens to reduce their intake of snacks, hot dogs, fatty cattle, butter and other foods that contain saturated fat.
The study found that people's intake of these unhealthy fats in their daily diet increased from 11.5% to 12%, exceeding the recommended intake limit of 10%.
The biggest improvement in the U.S. national diet is the reduction of sugar intake from 16% to about 14%, but the intake is still too high.
It's officially considered that the intake of added sugar in the daily diet should be less than 10%.
As for the reasons for the reduction in sugar intake, the researchers believe that it is related to the reduction of people's consumption of sweet soda, but Zhang Fangfang stressed that sugars are often added to foods that aren't even sweet, such as yoghurt and ketchup.
U.S. adults had a small increase in their intake of fruits, nuts, oats, and other whole-grain categories.
However, according to the data of 2016, these foods still account for less than 5% of the daily diet.
Although people's intake of salt is slightly reduced, and the reduction in drinking fruit juice has led to low-quality carbohydrate intake, Zhang said that they still account for up to 42% of their daily calories, many of which come from refined white-faced bread and other refined grains.
The study is based on biennial personal health surveys that allow adults to reminisce about the food they’ve eaten in the past 24 hours.
Since 2003, these health surveys have inquired about this question every few days.
U.S. residents' dietary guidelines issued by the government advise people to adopt a â€œhealthy dietâ€ to reduce the risk of chronic diseases.
According to the guidelines, people should eat more nutrient-dense foods, such as vegetables, fruits, whole grains, low-fat dairy products, as well as seafood that can provide protein, lean meats, poultry meat, eggs and seeds.
The U.S. population nearly doubled, more than 7%, and obesity rates have increased in many of the years of the study, when about 70 percent of U.S. adults are overweight or obese.
In addition, heart disease is still the leading cause of death in the United States.
The European Union promotes strategic partnership with Asia
Members of the Politburo of the Central Committee of the Communist Party of Viet Nam, the Secretary of the Central Committee and the Minister of Economic Affairs of the Central Committee of the Communist Party of Viet Nam led a delegation to attend the forum.
Based on the close cooperation between the EU and individual partners in the Asia-Pacific region, the theme of the forum will be "The European Union and Asia: building a bridge for a sustainable future".
The forum will be held one year after the implementation of the docking strategy between the two continents of the European Union.
European Commission President Jean-Claude Juncker has said it is part of the above-mentioned proposal because it brings benefits to the peoples and economies concerned.
The above-mentioned relations have helped to bring stability and prosperity to the parties concerned.
At the same time, he believes that the European Union wants to send a message about increasing participation and strengthening the mutually beneficial relationship between Europe and Asia.
Japanese Prime Minister Shinzo Prime Minister Shinzo Abe will deliver an important speech at the plenary session.
The country's first joint-stock bank wealth management subsidiary was established using science and technology to enable asset management business
On the 26th, Everbright Bank's wholly-owned subsidiary Everbright Wealth Management Co., Ltd. was officially established in Qingdao, which is the first joint-stock bank wealth management subsidiary established in China.
Experts pointed out that asset management is an important area for the development of financial technology, and the bank's establishment of wealth management subsidiaries is conducive to the use of scientific and technological means to enhance asset management business.
In April of this year, Everbright Bank and China Merchants Bank respectively announced that it had been approved by the China Banking and Insurance Regulatory Commission to build a wealth management subsidiary.
On September 24th, Everbright Bank announced that Everbright Finance had been officially allowed to open.
Just two days later, Everbright led a number of joint-stock banks and took the lead in establishing Everbright Financial Management in Qingdao.
Li Xiaopeng, chairman of Everbright Group, said that Everbright Group will accelerate the pace of innovation, use modern scientific and technological thinking and means, relying on big data, Internet of Things and cloud computing to improve the coverage, utilization rate and penetration rate of financial capital, and improve customers' sense of gain, happiness, and security.
By 2021, we will establish and improve the â€œfour beams and eight pillarsâ€ of China's financial technology development, further enhance the scientific and technological application capabilities of the financial industry, realize the deep integration and coordinated development of finance and science and technology, and significantly enhance the people's satisfaction with digital, networked and intelligent financial products and services.
Zhang Xuyang, chairman of Everbright Financial Management, introduced that the asset management platform of Everbright Financial will use intelligent investment, intelligent investment research, big data and other technologies to help Everbright Financial to better judge the macroeconomic situation.
In the future, new technologies such as blockchain will also be applied to grasp the directions and trends from traditional assets to alternative assets to digital alternative assets.
Dong Ximiao, a special researcher of the National Finance and Development Laboratory, said that in the face of a new competitive situation in the asset management industry, financial technology companies and asset management institutions will jointly explore a new growth path with asset management science and technology.
Fintech can empower the asset management industry, which is not only the need for the transformation and development of financial technology itself, and will inject new vitality and vitality into asset management business development.
At the beginning of this year, Jingdong Digital Technology launched a new asset management science and technology system, with the use of technology and digital means to improve asset management product development and risk control capabilities.
The new system starts from the four major capabilities of product design, sales transactions, asset management and risk assessment to improve the overall intelligent operation level of the asset management industry.
Experts believe that while improving customer service capabilities and innovating rich products, asset management technology can also enhance risk prevention capabilities and improve asset management efficiency.
Zhang Xuyang said that in the past, it was easy to deviate the risk appetite of customers through questionnaires, and now the use of artificial intelligence for user portraits helps to better position customers and launch corresponding products according to customers' investment preferences, which helps to resolve risks.
"E-commerce, space-temporal data and other alternative big data can help us to better caricature a region, the activity of an industry, prosperity."
Zhang Xuyang said that while defusing risks, big data technology will also help improve risk control capabilities.
China's deepest railway tunnel silo record has been refreshed
After more than 1200 days of day and night construction, in the construction of the (Li) Rui (Li) Railway Gaoligong Mountain Tunnel No. 1 shaft completed on the 27th, and the depth reached 762.59 meters below the ground, breaking the deepest record of China's railway tunnel, and this record was created in the case of a large number of gushing water.
With a total length of 34.5 kilometers, the Gaoligong Mountain Tunnel is located in Yunnan, and the tunnel crosses the Gaoligongshan Mountains from the west bank of the angry river, and it is the longest tunnel on a two-line single hole in Asia.
The tunnel passes through 19 ruptured belts, with a maximum depth of 1,155 meters, because it covers almost all the bad geology and major risks that may be encountered in the construction of the tunnel, known as the "geological museum" of tunnel construction.
It is the most important auxiliary tunnel of the Gaoligong Mountain Tunnel, and shoulders the important task of increasing the working surface to achieve "long tunnel short play" and the ventilation of railway operations in the later period.
Silo No. 1 has been successfully excavated to the bottom of the well, which indicates that the Gaoligongshan Tunnel has officially entered the horizontal tunnel construction, and after the excavation and equipment replacement at the bottom of the well yard, four working surfaces can be added underground to accelerate the excavation speed of the tunnel.
"The shaft is all in the granite formation, because the granite stratification gap is more, can't stop the water, from the top to the bottom, basically how deep the well how much."
Shi Jingzhao, chief engineer of the Dairui railway project department of the China Railway Tunnel Bureau, told reporters that in the construction of the shaft, there have been many dangers such as sudden surging water and collapse, and the construction party has invited experts to put the pulse on the spot, and more than 20 times to discuss and deal with the treatment plan.
â€œAt the height of gushing water in the shaft, more than 300 cubic meters per hour, more than 700 meters deep at the bottom of the well, the water pressure is equivalent to 700 meters deep on the seafloor.â€
“If you don’t pump and drain in a timely manner, it will flood the well 10 meters in an hour, and we spend almost 85% of our time on water treatment, and 15% of the time is used for tunneling.”
In order to overcome the geological problems such as longitudinal economic development, verdant water, water-rich granite and other geological problems, tunnel construction adopts systematic water management measures combined with "exploration, injection and excavation" to reduce the risk of construction.
After a number of improvements, No. 1 silo construction has formed mechanized assembly lines such as excavating systems, ruting systems, suspension systems, and winch lifting systems, which have realized full-process mechanized operations such as eye-catching, blasting, out-of-the-line, template installation, and concrete pouring, which has accelerated the progress of construction.
Finally, after more than 1,200 days of day and night construction, the shaft successfully completed the excavation with a depth of 762.59 meters.
With a total length of 330 square kilometers, it is an important part of the China-Myanmar international corridor and an important transportation infrastructure for the implementation of the “Belt and Road”.
After the completion of the opening, the driving time from Dali to Ruili will be reduced from the current highway to 2 hours, which will greatly improve the transportation pattern in the western region, and play a role in promoting economic and trade cooperation and people-to-people exchanges between China and Southeast Asian and Southeast Asian countries.
Lin Zhengyue: As the Chinese are proud of the country's achievements
The Hong Kong press celebrates the 70th anniversary of the National People's Day.
The "Hong Kong Press Celebrates the 70th anniversary of the founding of the People's Republic of China" was held in Hong Kong on the 27th.
The Chief Executive of the Hong Kong Special Hong Kong Special Administrative Region, Carrie Lam, said in her speech that the country's achievements in the past 70 years are obvious to the whole world, and we as the Chinese are proud.
Carrie Lam, Deputy Director-General of the Liaison Office of the Central Government in Hong Kong Lu Xining, Deputy Commissioner of the Hong Kong Liaison Office of the Ministry of Foreign Affairs Song Ruan, Deputy Political Commissar of the People's Liberation Army Forces in Hong Kong Chen Yading, Chairman of the Executive Committee of the Preparatory Committee of the Hong Kong Press to Celebrating the National People's Republic of China attended the reception and served as host guests.
Carrie Lam pointed out in his speech that in the past 70 years, although China has faced many difficulties and challenges in the past 70 years, it has been overcome one by one by one, and its achievements are obvious to the whole world, and we as Chinese people are proud of it.
After Hong Kong's return to the motherland, it has been closely associated with the mainland, working together to make progress and share fruitful results.
It is believed that under the premise of "one country, two systems", Hong Kong can continue to give full play to its advantages in the future, grasp the opportunities of the "Belt and Road" and the Guangdong-Hong Kong-Macao Greater Bay Area, and seek a better future for Hong Kong.
In the past few months, social controversies in Hong Kong have continued, affecting everyone in Hong Kong, and journalists face different challenges.
At this critical moment, it is hoped that the friends of the press will continue to meet the difficulties, uphold the professional spirit, make fair and balanced news reports for the society, and make a contribution to Hong Kong's future return to rational communication and dialogue.
Jiang pointed out in his speech that the glorious history of the new China is also the history of Hong Kong and the motherland's development, common progress, blood connection, honor and humiliation.
In particular, since Hong Kong's return to the motherland, the central government has unswervingly implemented the principles of "one country, two systems", "Hong Kong people rule Hong Kong" and a high degree of self-governance.
To this end, the Hong Kong press gathered together to celebrate the 70th anniversary of the founding of the People's Republic of China.
In the past three months, there have been a series of violent activities in Hong Kong that have openly violated the law and undermined social stability, and some media have published distorted and false reports, which have played a significant role in promoting the violent activities.
He called on the media to energize clarity and create a good atmosphere for the whole people to resist violence and uphold the rule of law.
Professional media people should abide by the professional norms of journalism, use true reports and responsible speech to guide the citizens to self-consciousness and violence, and safeguard the fairness and majesty of the law.
About 500 people from all walks of life, such as the Hong Kong press, attended the reception and raised a toast with the guests to send blessings for the 70th anniversary of the founding of the People's Republic of China.
The Propaganda Department of the Xining Municipal Party Committee learned that Xining City will implement the Regulations on the Promotion of Civilized Behavior in Xining City from October 1, focusing on 15 kinds of uncivilized behaviors such as pedestrians who do not follow the traffic lights, throwing objects from buildings, and other 15 uncivilized behaviors, listing key governance lists, and setting corresponding penalties.
Wang Shengbin, vice minister of Propaganda of the Xining Municipal Party Committee and the director of the Municipal Civilization Office, said that since Xining was awarded the title of national civilized city in 2017, the civilized literacy and moral level of citizens have been significantly improved.
However, pedestrians cross the road, run red lights, non-motorized vehicles do not follow the traffic lights; high-altitude parabola, car window throwing; smoking in public places, walking the dog in public places, and allowed to defecate and other uncivilized behavior is still very prominent, and it is easy to rebound and needs to be solved as soon as possible.
In combination with Xining's reality, from public places, public order, public facilities, public environmental sanitation, civilized travel, civilized tourism, civilized Internet access, the construction of a civilized campus, the promotion of the construction of civilized families, the implementation of official duties, the commemoration of heroes and martyrs, medical services and other aspects, put forward a more comprehensive and higher standard requirements for individuals and units of civilized code of conduct, so that the whole society can understand "what can be done", "advocacy" and "prohibited".
â€œThe formulation of regulations to eliminate blind spots and misunderstandings in the field of civilized behavioral cognition, and to provide a strong guarantee of the rule of law for the normalization of citizens' behavior, home ownership, dining, travel, education, tourism, Internet access, green life, and wedding and bereavement sweep, which will provide a strong rule of law guarantee for the normalization of the creation of mass spiritual civilization in Xining."
Xining Municipal People's National People's Congress Standing Committee Secretary-General Qiu Huaijun said.
Beijing subway lines 1, 2 and 7 will be delayed tonight
Beijing News News (Reporter Pei Jianfei) today (September 27th) afternoon, the Beijing subway company issued a notice that from September 27th to October 7th, lines 1, line 2 and 7 to extend the operation date of the last bus will be adjusted.
During the delayed operation period, the operation time of the subway line 1 and 2 will continue until the early morning of the next day, with an average of 10 minutes.
Line No. 1 west-to-east extended operation time of 61 minutes, east-to-south extended operation time of 64 minutes, the last train departure time of each station along the line is after 00:30 the next day; Line 2, the inner ring extends the operation of 81 minutes, the outer ring extends the operation of 95 minutes, the last train departure time of each station along the next day is after 0:20 the next day.
Metro Line 7, Beijing West Railway Station (in the direction of coking factory station), the last train departure time was extended from 23:15 to 00:15 the next day, and the departure time of coking factory station (in the direction of Beijing West Railway Station) was extended from 22:25 to 23:25.
British tourist's car key fell into the lake, the whole family was trapped in France for five days
In recent days, a couple in Wales, England, took their two children to France for a holiday and accidentally dropped the car keys into the lake, and the whole family was forced to wait five days to get a new key formulated by an automobile manufacturer.
The couple then left France with their children.
According to reports, on September 16 local time, when the British family visited a lake in France, her daughter accidentally overturned a leather bag and dropped the car keys inside into the lake.
It took them a few hours and couldn’t find the keys.
All their belongings and cash were locked in the car.
Although British tourists bought insurance prior to their departure, insurers refused to help on the grounds that there was no risk that the vehicle would be stolen.
They had to hire a trailer to pull the car to a repair factory and re-order the keys from the automaker.
A few days later, the British tourists finally got the key to the preparation, and the couple left France with their children.
Their planned trip was cancelled due to the loss of the car keys.
Saudi Arabia officially liberalizes tourist visas for 49 countries, including China
From now on, Saudi Arabia has officially liberalized tourist visas to 49 countries, including China, with a total visa fee of 440 Saudi riyals (about 836 yuan).
Tourists are required to prepare a medical insurance covering Saudi territory and provide an address in Saudi Arabia to apply.
Tourists can apply for a landing visa at the airport after the plane has landed, or apply for an electronic visa through visa.visitsaudi.com.
Among them, the electronic signature is multiple entries for one year, and tourists can be allowed to stay for up to 90 days.
Saudi Arabia is the most enigmatic country for ordinary tourists, because the country never issues tourist visas.
In recent years, Saudi Arabia’s “Vision 2030” plan, led by Deputy Crown Prince Mohammed bin Salman, aims to reduce the country’s long-term economic dependence on oil, and opening up and developing tourism is an important part.
Belarusian Deputy Prime Minister Igor Liashenko paid a working visit to the Vietnamese province of Xing'an.
At the time of the meeting, the Secretary of the Xing'an Provincial Party Committee, Du Jinshi, highlighted the outstanding achievements of Belarus in industrial production and the investment of Belarusian enterprises in Xing'an Province.
MAZ ASIA's automobile production and installation plant is an important step in the cooperation between the enterprises of the two countries, which will help to promote the cooperative relations between Xing'an Province and even Vietnam and Belarus.
Secretary of the Xing'an Provincial Party Committee said that Xing'an province has always created convenient conditions for Belarusian enterprises to invest in the province, and he hopes that Belarus will take more powerful measures in the future to encourage Belarusian enterprises to invest in Xing'an Province and Vietnam, and assist in the training and transfer of industrial production technologies for workers in the province.
Deputy Prime Minister Igor Liashenko expressed his gratitude to Xing'an Province for the recent facilitation of the production and operation activities of Belarusian enterprises.
It is hoped that Xing'an Province will continue to provide convenient conditions for Belarusian enterprises.
At the end of the meeting, Deputy Prime Minister Igor Liashenko and his party attended the completion ceremony of the MAZ ASIA automobile production and installation plant.
In the field of low-risk varieties of food production license and other pilot notification commitment system, the foreign enterprise representative office to delegate authority to the free trade zone
On the 27th, the Shanghai Municipal Bureau of Market Supervision signed a working memorandum with the Pudong New Area government to launch 20 market supervision and reform measures, some of which are the first pilots in the country.
According to reports, the notification commitment means that the administrative organ, when dealing with the relevant license registration matters, will notify the applicant in writing of the conditions and requirements stipulated by laws and regulations.
After the applicant has signed the promise, the administrative organ can handle it directly.
According to the memorandum of understanding, the Shanghai market supervision department will support the Pudong New Area and the Shanghai Pilot Free Trade Zone to register the names of the enterprises, apply for a simple process, low-risk variety of food production license, part of the type approval of measuring instruments and other three areas to inform the commitment system, so that enterprise access is more convenient.
On the 27th, Shanghai Shao Wansheng Food Co., Ltd. obtained the "food production license" on the spot by informing the commitment, and became the first enterprise to enjoy the pilot dividend.
The person in charge of the enterprise said that the food license can also be certified on the spot, but also adopted the "lack of acceptance" approach, which allows enterprises to submit part of the materials in accordance with the deadline stipulated in the letter of notification, "really feel the convenience of the reform."
The Shanghai market supervision department said that the notification commitment system for the implementation of the food production license is the first pilot in the country.
After the reform, the examination and approval link was compressed from the previous six links of "registration, acceptance, on-site verification, sample inspection, material examination and approval certification" to "registration, acceptance, and examination and approval of the certificate", and the completion time was shortened from 20 working days before the reform.
Taking into account the characteristics of Pudong's high economic extroversion, the Shanghai market supervision department decentralized the registration authority of the permanent representative office of foreign (regional) enterprises to the Shanghai free trade zone, which is convenient for enterprises to deal with.
According to statistics, a total of 1,592 permanent representative offices in the Shanghai free trade zone have been decentralized, of which 99 have been handled in accordance with the new regulations.
"Eleven" long holiday consumption small survey: the choice of more diversified tourism to occupy the first place.
The National Day holiday is approaching, and people's holiday plans are gradually being finalized.
The "Securities Daily" reporter recently launched a small survey in the circle of friends for the "eleven" holiday arrangement, and nearly 20 feedback received shows that although everyone's plans are different, but "tourism + consumption" has become the key word of the "Eleven" holiday.
Specifically, in the "Securities Daily" reporter's feedback, more than half chose tourism.
Mr. Liu, who lives in Tianjin, said that during the â€œElevenâ€ period he plans to take his family to Shanghai to play, Disney is the first stop, and then go to the neighboring cities for a turn; Ms. Li in Beijing has chosen to travel to our country in Taiwan, â€œA family of â€œa family of â€œthree people set off on September 28, planning a ten-day tour around the islandâ€; Miss Ma in Chongqing has planned to travel to the seaside for a few days.
The "2019 National Day Golden Week residents travel and travel trend report" recently jointly released by Yilong and the same tour shows that this year's National Day Golden Week's travel and travel in the three subdivisions of consumption upgrade trend is obvious.
The penetration rate of aircraft and high-speed rail travel has been steadily improved, and the proportion of star hotels and personalized non-standard accommodation needs has increased.
On September 23, Meituan's "2019 National Day Tourism Consumption Trend Report" showed that tourism consumption continued to be strong, and showed a diversified and upgraded trend of "eating and playing".
More young people's travel favors high-quality and distinctive experiences, and the heat of cultural tourism and night tourism continues to rise.
In addition to tourism, various types of consumer demand have also been centrally released during the "eleven" period.
Mr. Wang, who lives in Chengdu, told the "Securities Daily" reporter, "The main plan of this year 'Eleven' is to buy a car."
The staff of a car brand 4S store in Beijing told the "Securities Daily" reporter that in general, September and October of each year are known as the golden period of automobile sales.
During the "eleven" period, the store will launch a lot of activities, such as sweepstakes, to the store reduction and so on.
In addition, many brands have recently launched new models, and it is expected that the effect of new products on sales will be more obvious.
Under the trend of consumption upgrading, people pay more attention to meeting the needs at the spiritual level, and the proportion of services such as culture and education is constantly increasing.
"Since the birth of a child, cultural and educational consumption has become the majority of household consumer spending.
This year's â€œElevenâ€ is full of rows, going to the â€œhit card' planetarium, children's theater, about a number of families went to the Elk Museum on the weekend to set up a tent camp, but also arranged some audition experience classes."
According to industry insiders, in theory, the evolution path of residents' consumption upgrading is the evolution from survival-oriented consumption to development-oriented consumption and enjoyment-oriented consumption, of which a considerable part of the content of enjoyment-type consumption is the category of service consumption.
With the continuous development of China's economy and society and the rising income level of residents, people are paying more and more attention to consumer demand at the spiritual level, tourism and travel are a very good way.
Especially in order to catch up with the "eleven" National Day holiday, the time is more abundant, people are more willing to travel and consumption, which can not only meet the consumer demand at the spiritual level, but also the embodiment of the upgrading of residents' consumption.
