The 2020 Dubai World’s Fair has unveiled its mascot.
The launch ceremony of the mascot of Expo 2020 Dubai was held in Dubai, United Arab Emirates on the 26th.
The mascot is made up of six cartoon images, including two Emirati children, three flying robots, and an Emirati national bean.
The press conference presented the audience with six mascot's messages by playing a short video.
Nine-year-old Rahid and eight-year-old Latifa are siblings who represent the people of the United Arab Emirates.
The three robots correspond to the three sub-themes of this Expo, the blue robot represents "mobility", the green robot represents "sustainability", and the yellow robot represents the "opportunity".
An ancient bean tree is named "Salama" and is the "old grandmother" of the five "little guys", symbolizing the ancestor who guarded the land.
Ahmed, chairman of the Dubai Expo High Commission, said the mascot can strengthen the emotional connection between large-scale events and the participants. â€œIt is believed that the mascot will convey the traditional spirit of storytelling, showcase the creativity of local talents and express our ambition and expectations.â€
Vice-President and Prime Minister of the United Arab Emirates, Sheikh Mohammed of Dubai, Crown Prince Hamdan of Dubai, Minister of State for International Cooperation of the United Arab Emirates and Director-General of the Dubai World’s Fair, Liam Hashemi, attended the launch ceremony.
The Dubai Expo will be held in Dubai from October 20, 2020 to April 10, with the theme â€œConnecting ideas, creating the future.â€
It will be the world’s first exhibition in the Middle East.
Starting next year, Chinese students will be able to apply for an undergraduate degree in Germany based on college entrance examination results.
Recently, the Anabin database responsible for the evaluation and certification of foreign academic qualifications in Germany announced on its official website that since 2020, China's high school graduates can apply directly to German universities based on college entrance examination results, and they do not need to be registered in domestic universities.
Prior to this, Chinese high school graduates who want to apply to a German university need to study for one semester (211,985 universities) or a three-semester (ordinary undergraduate), and pass the APS audit or TestAS exam.
The release of the new regulations may save at least half a year for Chinese students who are willing to study in Germany.
It is reported that the new regulations will come into force in the second half of 2019.
Applicant needs to meet: complete 12 years of formal compulsory education, get a high school diploma; participate in the entrance examination, the college entrance examination, and the college entrance examination score up to 70% or more of the total score (if the total score is 750 points, it needs to reach more than 525 points), and includes two language scores and a mathematical or natural science score and other requirements.
In addition, the specific professional requirements for college entrance examination results are not the same.
For example, to apply for medical science, oral medicine, veterinary science, pharmacy and other majors, the college entrance examination score must reach a full score of 80%, and the college entrance examination subjects must include at least two in mathematics, physics, chemistry and biology, or to participate in the integration; to apply for legal majors, the college entrance examination score must reach a full score of 80%, and college entrance examination subjects must include at least two foreign languages, history and geography, or to participate in the synthesis.
According to incomplete statistics, many countries, including Germany, the United Kingdom, the United Kingdom, Canada, and Australia, have recognized China's college entrance examination results.
In the United Kingdom, for example, universities such as the University of Cambridge, the University of Birmingham, and the University of Leicester have all accepted applications from Chinese students with college entrance examination results.
The military "robot dog" took the performance class first Cirque du Soleil troupe: considered included in the performance line-up.
The U.S. military funded the development of "robot dogs" used in the battlefield, and now may be on the circus stage!
Cirque du Soleil recently said it is in contact with Boston Dynamics, which is developing robots, to discuss the feasibility of robots being used in circus performances.
On the 24th, Boston Power Technology Corporation announced a promotional video of "four-legged robot Spot" on the 24th, which shows that Spot is an agile mobile robot that can withstand 14 kilograms and has the maneuverability, 360-degree obstacle avoidance function, navigation, remote control, and autonomy.
In particular, Spot has a proprietary software platform developed specifically for Spot, which allows users to self-configure Spot robot functions through a variety of applications.
Boston Power Technology first announced the concept of a robot dog in 1992, causing a sensation, but it is still not really put into commercial use.
However, the Boston Dynamics technology company pointed out that at present, Spot has entered the mass production stage, and the subscribers are mainly construction and energy companies.
In addition, Cirque du Soleil is currently in contact with the Boston Dynamics technology company, and Cirque du Soleil said that the project is still in the concept stage and it is in the process of evaluating Spot's potential to be used in the performance scene.
The Information Office of the State Council Publishes the White Paper on China and the World in the New Era
On the occasion of the 70th anniversary of the founding of the People's Republic of China, the Information Office of the State Council issued a white paper on China and the world in the
Xu Lin, vice minister and director of the Information Office of the State Council, said that the white paper systematically introduced China's development achievements, development path and development direction, and explained China's relations with the rest of the world in an in-depth manner about China's relations with the rest of the world, so as to enhance the international community's understanding and understanding of China's development.
The white paper pointed out that in the past 70 years, under the leadership of the Communist Party of China, China has undergone tremendous changes and created an unprecedented development miracle in the history of human history, especially since the 18th National Congress of the Communist Party of China.
Through a large amount of data and facts, the white paper introduces the great achievements, great significance and contribution of China's development in the past 70 years.
The white paper pointed out that in the past few decades, China has gone through the development of developed countries for hundreds of thousands of years, its total economic output ranks second in the world, with nearly 1.4 billion people getting rid of material shortages, generally reaching a well-off level and enjoying unprecedented dignity and rights.
The white paper emphasizes that in the past 70 years, the Chinese people have created a new world of self-reliance, self-reliance and hard work; in the past 70 years, China has developed in the connection and interaction with the world, embracing the world, learning the world, and contributing to the world; over the past 70 years, while achieving self-development, China has made contributions to world peace and injected impetus into the common development of all countries.
The white paper pointed out that in the past 70 years, the fundamental reason for the success of China's development is that under the leadership of the Communist Party of China, the Chinese people have found the correct development path of socialism with Chinese characteristics and followed this path unswervingly.
The white paper emphasizes that the path of socialism with Chinese characteristics is a road established from the perspective of our national conditions, a road that puts the interests of the people in the first place, a road of reform and innovation, a path of seeking common development in opening up, and a road to the rule of law in an all-round way.
China's development path is in line with China's national conditions and adapts to the requirements of the times, which will show more and more bright development prospects with the advancement of the times.
In response to the international community's concern about China's development, the white paper emphasizes that the realization of the country's prosperity, national rejuvenation and people's happiness is both the dream of the Chinese people and the common dream of the people of all countries.
The white paper pointed out that China is the world's main stabilizer and power source of economic growth, all-round opening-up has created more opportunities for the development of various countries, China has provided more public goods for the international community, China's development has provided experience and reference for other developing countries.
In the face of "what's wrong with the world and what to do with the human race", the white paper points out that today's world is in the midst of great changes that have not occurred in a hundred years, and human society is both full of hope and full of challenges.
China proposes to build a community with a shared future for mankind, opening up a new development path of win-win cooperation and joint construction and sharing, and providing new choices for human development.
The white paper calls on all countries to unite to build a new type of international relations, promote a new type of economic globalization, safeguard the international system with the United Nations as the core, promote exchanges and mutual learning among civilizations, and jointly promote the construction of a community with a shared future for mankind and build a better world.
With the increasing development of China, the international community is generally concerned about the development of China's relationship with the rest of the world.
The white paper pointed out that China's development cannot be separated from the world, and the world's peaceful development, prosperity and stability are inseparable from China.
China has always put its own development into the coordinate system of human development, adhered to win-win cooperation and common development, adhered to maintaining and promoting economic globalization, actively developed global partnerships, firmly supported multilateralism, safeguarded international fairness and justice, promoted the high-quality development of the "Belt and Road Initiative", actively participated in leading the reform and construction of the global governance system, and has always been a builder of world peace, a contributor to global development and a defender of the international order.
At present, China's development has ushered in a new era.
The white paper pointed out that in China in the new era, the determination to take the path of socialism with Chinese characteristics will not change, the determination to learn from each other and win-win cooperation with other countries will not change, and the determination to walk hand in hand with the world will not change.
At the end of the white paper, it is pointed out that in today's world, the future and destiny of all countries have never been so closely linked.
"China and the world in the new era" white paper, consists of the foreword, the main text and the concluding remarks, with a full text of more than 29,000 words.
The white paper was published in eight languages, such as Chinese, English, French, Russian, German, Western, Arab and Japanese, published separately by the People's Publishing House and the Foreign Language Publishing House, and distributed in Xinhua bookstores across the country.
Is shawl in a by-reside vote in the parliament of Tanjung Peai in Johor?
Datuk Seri Wei Jiaxiang, President of the MCA: â€œDiscussion of the Supreme Council of the BN!â€
The by-election of the Danjong Piai national table is imminent, and whether the MCA, a member of the Barisan Nasional Party, has attracted the attention of this traditional national table.
However, after the meeting of the Central Committee of the CMAC, it was announced that it would be handed over to the BN Supreme Council to decide on whether the traditional seat of the MIC will continue to be handed over to the CMA CCP or replaced by other member parties.
Wei Jiaxiang, after chairing the meeting of the MCA Central Committee on Thursday afternoon, told the media that any by-elections will be carried out in accordance with standard operating procedures (SOPs), i.e. it will need to go through the meeting of the BN Supreme Council before it can be finalized.
He said that because the Election Commission will meet next Monday (1 January) to finalize the by-election of the Tanjung Biai, the meeting of the BN Supreme Council is expected to be held in early October.
â€œI also met with BN President Datuk Seri Ahmad Zahid yesterday morning, and we all agreed that this seat must be regained from Pakatan Harapan.â€
â€œWe have finalized a special Barisan Nasional leadership meeting in early October, and the leaders of the Barisan Nasional three-party party will determine which party will be in action.â€
Asked about whether MCA would stick to the BN Supreme Council's participation in this traditional seat, Wei Jiaxiang reiterated that he, as the MCA's president, must act in accordance with standard operating procedures, so any decision must reach the Barisan Nasional's consensus.
"In any by-election, there are people who are willing to go out, there are political parties, there is a certain way to think that they should come out, this is a common thing."
“The most important thing is what kind of organization and political alliance do we come from?”
"This is a big test of our political alliance for so many years, and we believe that the Barisan Nasional has come all the way and holds some valuable values."
“In the process, someone might say something, and that’s no wonder.”
"However, as soon as the BN Supreme Council makes a decision, everyone must make every effort to prepare for the war, which is the most valuable."
In any case, Wei Jiaxiang said that the MW will make all-out efforts at three levels, that is, the district council, the state joint committee and the central government, to prepare for the upcoming Tanjong Biai by-election.
â€œThe district committee will be led by Datuk Seri Huang Ri, chairman of the (Tanjong Piai) District Council; the state joint committee will be led by Datuk Lin Peixing, the deputy chairman of the joint committee of the state; while the central government will be personally deployed by Datuk Ma Hanshun, the general secretary of the central government."
On Saturday (21st), Datuk Mohamad, a member of parliament for the Indigenous Unity Party, died of a heart attack at Chongzhen Government Hospital at the age of 42.
A villager hunted wild animals in Baokang County, Hubei Province was ordered to "compulsory to patrol the mountain"
A villager in Baokang County, Hubei Province, was sentenced for hunting wild animals, and was ordered to pay 15,420 yuan (RMB, the same below) for the restoration of environmental damage to ecological resources.
Due to the poverty of the defendant's family, the procuratorial organ activated alternative labor to compensate for ecological restoration costs, and realized the organic unification of legal effects and social effects.
Wang Zhongliang, deputy attorney general of the Baokang County Procuratorate, introduced on the 27th that through three months of alternative labor such as "obligatory mountain patrol", the defendant Zhou has established a deep relationship with wild macaque monkeys, and is deeply responsible for the previous hunting of animals.
On June 21 of this year, a criminal incidental civil public interest litigation in the field of ecological resources filed by the Bokang County Procuratorate was publicly heard in the county court and sentenced in court.
Defendant Zhou was sentenced to 3 years in prison, suspended for 4 years, and fined 3,000 yuan, and ordered to compensate ecological resources for environmental damage repair costs of 15,420 yuan.
According to the investigation, from the end of January 2014, Zhou began to set up a power grid on the cliffs, hunting more than 20 kinds of wild animals, including porphyry, porcupuncture, crowned deer and so on.
It belongs to the country's second-class endangered wild protected animals, and small and crown deer are listed in the "National Terrestrial Wildlife Conservation List".
In the course of the trial, Zhou confessed to his illegal facts and behavior, and was willing to bear incidental civil liability.
However, taking into account the poor economic situation in Zhou's family, under the coordination of the Baokang County Procuratorate, the local village committee, the forest station and the three parties reached an agreement on alternative labor compensation for ecological restoration costs: that is, Zhou provided public welfare services to offset the cost of ecological restoration by carrying out macaque macaque forest protection in the village's macaque protected area.
Regarding the prosecutor's recommendation, the court agreed to Zhou's suspension while actively fulfilling the obligation of "alternative labor compensation for ecological restoration costs".
At present, Zhou has been engaged in voluntary labor in the macaque protection area for three months, patrolling the mountains actively and performing well.
In the past few years, the Baokang County Procuratorate has organically integrated procuratorial functions and social governance behaviors in practice, scientifically used supervision methods such as procuratorial suggestions, investigation supervision, and litigation supervision, and used judicial means to minimize the damage caused to the ecological environment caused by criminal acts.
The United Nations awards the Champions of the Earth Award for the ant forest.
With warm applause and magnificent music, Xu Di, the leader of the Ant Forest project, and Shen Junliang, the user's representative, took the trophy of the 2019 United Nations Champions of the Earth Award from the moderator.
On the 26th, the 2019 "Defender of the Earth Award" ceremony was held in New York in the United States, using the mobile phone small program to drive hundreds of millions of people to participate in the environmental protection action of the "ant forest" project won one of the "incentives and action award" awards.
A few weeks ago, the United Nations Environment Programme (UNEP) announced the winners at its headquarters in the Kenyan capital of Nairobi, but those who participated in the award ceremony on the same day were still very excited.
In an interview with Xinhua News Agency, the Executive Director of the United Nations Environment Programme (UNEP), Ying Er Anonson, said that Ant Forest is an exciting innovation that allows hundreds of millions of people to take action to understand the environmental challenges facing humans and what they can do for the environment.
It uses science and technology to connect people and the environment so that every individual can participate in actions to protect the earth, which will have a huge impact.
The "ant forest" was launched by China Ant Financial Services Group (referred to as Ant Financial Services) in Alipay platform in August 2016, and users accumulated "green energy" in their mobile phones through low-carbon actions such as green travel in their daily lives, online payment of utility bills, and "plant trees" in their mobile phones.
Every time the user cultivates a virtual tree, the "ant forest" and public welfare partners will plant a real tree in the desertification area.
As of August of this year, the cumulative carbon emission reduction of 500 million "ant forest" users was 7.92 million tons, and 122 million trees were planted in desertification areas.
In the "Defender of the Earth Award" on the same day, Costa Rica was awarded for the national environmental protection efforts, and Costa Rican President Carlos Alvarado, who received the award, praised the contribution of the "ant forest" at the scene, which "inspires so many people to participate in the green action, which is very impressive."
Yi Xiandong, chairman and chief executive officer of Ant Financial, said that the "Defender of the Earth Award" is an affirmation of the "ant forest" project.
It’s possible that technology and open platforms make it possible for everyone to participate in a low-carbon life, and this accolade belongs to all the participants.
In the past three years, "ant forest" has affected 500 million people, and in the next three years, Ant Forest aims to drive 1 billion people around the world to participate in low-carbon actions.
At the same time as combating desertification and protecting the environment, they are also exploring how to make farmers' income come from green mountains and waters.
In addition to providing employment opportunities by planting trees, we also hope to help farmers increase their income through agricultural product development projects and e-commerce platforms.
The public welfare and environmental protection model based on digital technology created by "ant forest" has also successfully gone to sea, which has been used by other countries.
In June of this year, the Philippines' largest "e-wallet" GCASH launched the Philippine version of the "ant forest" to encourage Filipino users to better protect the environment through low-carbon life.
According to reports, GCASH will work with the Philippine Department of Environment and Natural Resources and environmental public welfare organizations to plant 335,000 trees in the Philippines within one year of the start of the project.
The Champions of the Earth Award is the UN’s highest award in the field of environmental protection and is awarded annually.
The "ant forest" award is the third consecutive year after China's Saihan ba forest farm builder and China's "Thousand Village Demonstration and Wancun Remediation" project in Zhejiang Province of China, the green innovation project from China has won the "incentive and action award" award for the third consecutive year.
The economic and trade frictions affect the "report card" of the US economy.
The U.S. economic "report card" in the second quarter of this year shows that U.S. gross domestic product (GDP) growth has slowed significantly compared with the previous quarter due to a sharp decline in private-sector investment and exports.
Analysts pointed out that the economic and trade frictions and the resulting uncertainty are the main reasons for the decline in private sector investment and exports in the second quarter.
According to the final revised data released by the US Department of Commerce on the 26th, the U.S. GDP in the second quarter increased by 2% year-on-year, the same as the previously released revised data, but significantly lower than 3.1% in the first quarter.
According to the data, the growth of consumption has become the main factor supporting US economic growth in the second quarter.
Personal consumption expenditure, which accounts for about 70% of the U.S. U.S. economy, increased by 4.6% month-on-quarter, boosting economic growth by 3.03 percentage points.
In addition, government consumer spending and investment stimulated economic growth by 0.82 percentage points.
However, in the second quarter, private-sector investment fell by 6.3% compared with the previous quarter, dragging down 1.16 percentage points of economic growth in the current quarter; exports fell by 5.7% from the previous quarter, and net exports dragged down economic growth by 0.68 percentage points in the quarter.
Barry Knapp, a managing partner at Einessed Macroeconomics Consulting in the United States, said private-sector investment not only failed to maintain last year's growth momentum, but fell sharply, due to rising economic and trade frictions and rising uncertainty hitting business confidence.
Knapp believes that under the influence of policy uncertainty, U.S. corporate capital expenditure is still expected to decline next year.
Analysts believe that although consumption growth has formed a strong support for the US economy in the second quarter, there are more and more signs that economic and trade frictions and the resulting uncertainty have affected consumer confidence and adversely affected the US consumption prospects.
Richard Curtin, a professor of economics at the University of Michigan, said that in the most recent survey, 38% of consumers spontaneously mentioned the negative impact of tariffs on the U.S. economy, which is the highest in a year and a half.
For the future trend of the U.S. U.S. economy, analysts generally believe the U.S.
However, some experts pointed out that if the economic and trade frictions are alleviated, the performance of the U.S. industrial and financial markets will be improved.
Karin Birch, a global economist at the Economist Intelligence Unit in the United Kingdom, expects that in the future, the U.S. economy will continue its gradual downward trend since the beginning of this year, and the growth rate will drop to a lower level than in the second quarter.
Mark Zandi, chief economist of Moody's Analytics, predicted that the U.S. economy's growth rate will be 2.3% this year and 1.6% next year, assuming that economic and trade frictions will continue to escalate without further escalating.
Ellen Hatzen, investment manager of Putnam Investment Company, pointed out that the biggest concern of the current enterprises is the economic and trade disputes and the uncertainty they bring, if the economic and trade disputes can be resolved, the uncertainty will be greatly reduced, and the performance of the industrial sector will be much better than now.
Matt Meley, a stock strategist at Miller- Tabak Asset Management, said that economic and trade frictions are still the "first issue" and the main reason for the sharp fluctuations in the US capital market this year, and whether economic and trade frictions can be properly resolved will be the key to affecting the direction of the US capital market for the rest of this year.
Ningxia's first-in-command joint parental leave for parents of 0 to 3-year-old children can take up to 10 days a year
Protecting the legitimate rights and interests of women is the embodiment of respecting and protecting human rights, and it is also an important symbol of the progress of social civilization.
On September 27, at the 15th meeting of the Standing Committee of the 12th National People's Congress of the Ningxia Hui Autonomous Region, the "Regulations on the Protection of Women's Rights and Interests in the Ningxia Hui Autonomous Region" was passed.
This is Ningxia's first provincial-level comprehensive system to safeguard the legitimate rights and interests of women's local regulations, which will be formally implemented on November 1, 2019.
It is understood that the "Regulations" passed this time are revised on the basis of Ningxia implementing the "Measures for the Protection of Women's Rights and Interests in the People's Republic of China" in 2007, which are divided into 9 chapters and 65 articles, including general rules, political rights, cultural and educational rights and interests, labor and social security rights and interests, property rights, personal rights, marriage and family rights, legal responsibilities and by-laws.
In the "Regulations", Ningxia encouraged exploring the implementation of joint parental leave for couples, which is still the first in the country.
In April of this year, the Guiding Opinions issued by the General Office of the State Council on promoting the development of care services for infants and young children under the age of 3 have a relevant description of the common parenting of husband and wife.
In the process of revising the Regulations, Ningxia innovatively proposed to "Encourage Employers to give joint parental leave to couples who have children in accordance with the provisions of the laws and regulations, during the period between the child's age of zero to the three-year anniversary and the three-year-old."
At the same time, the Ordinance highlights anti-sexual harassment and the protection of female minors.
Article 43 of the Regulations incorporates the latest legislative achievements in China's current civil code of personality rights, and refines the constituent elements of sexual harassment, the main body and mechanism of anti-sexual harassment.
Article 44 of the Ordinance explicitly prohibits the frequent sexual abuse of girls, and requires educational institutions to carry out relevant education, protection and prevention work, which has become a new benchmark for the protection of girls in local legislation.
With regard to a woman's right to know and deal with the common property of the marriage and the family, Article 35 of the Ordinance clearly stipulates that a woman's right to information about the common property and the obligations of property registration agencies and related subjects provide solid institutional support for women's rights protection.
In addition, article 26 of the Regulations not only prohibits direct discrimination, but also prohibits indirect discrimination, absorbs the latest joint interviews with practical experience, strengthens the punishment of gender discrimination violations, and more effectively safeguards the legitimate rights and interests of women.
In recent years, the Ningxia Women's Federation, together with the Public Inspection and Law Department and the Civil Affairs Department, have promoted and introduced social and professional forces to participate in the mediation of marital and family conflict disputes and anti-domestic violence, with remarkable results.
In a number of laws, social forces are encouraged to mobilize social forces, accumulate social resources to jointly safeguard women's rights and interests, and people's governments at or above the county level are required to provide stable and institutional guarantees and support through the purchase of services.
Inner Mongolia Xing UNITA Yuan Longping academician workstation saline-tolerant rice per acre of rice to break thousands of pounds
On the 27th, the reporter learned from the administrative office of Xing UNITA in the Inner Mongolia Autonomous Region that the "Hing UNITA Academician Yuan Longping Academician's workstation on-site salinity-relievable rice inspection and acceptance council" uploaded good news, and the average yield of salt-tolerant rice per acre exceeded 1,000 pounds.
Heilongjiang Provincial Academy of Agricultural Sciences, Yangzhou University, Hunan Provincial Department of agriculture and six experts of the production and production expert group, on-site sampling and harvesting of "salt series" rice.
After expert evaluation, in the PH value of 8.8 to 9.6, the salinity content of 5 ‰ to 6 ‰ of the land, the average salinity-tolerant rice yield per mu reached 508.8 kg.
Xing UNITA academician Yuan Longping academician workstation executive director Wang Shigang said: "Our next step intends on the basis of this year's experiment, but also innovation, but also to reform, salt-tolerant rice varieties re-cultivated and optimized, so that the quality is better and the yield is higher."
The leader of the measurement and production expert group, Heilongjiang Provincial Academy of Agricultural Sciences vice president and researcher to Yongcai said: "Under the premise that the factors of production remain the same, I hope to continue to strengthen scientific and technological research, saline-tolerant rice will continue to produce miracles in the saline land."
Xing UNITA belongs to Daxing'an Lingnan District, which is concentrated in a series of special hardship areas.
In October 2018, academician Yuan Longping's work station was unveiled at Xing UNITA.
Academician Yuan Longping led a team of experts to accelerate the introduction and promotion of the newly cultivated "salt and alkali hybrid rice" varieties and advanced technology, and built a 960-acre saline-tolerant rice base in the right-wing banner of Korqin, using side-experimental demonstrations and promoting technical routes to help the local poor to increase production and increase income and get rid of poverty and get rich.
The on-site production of saline-tolerant rice not only provides a scientific basis for Xing UNITA's low-yield fields to be promoted to medium and high-yield fields, but also provides a scientific basis for the cultivation of saline and alkali rice under the same conditions in our country.
According to the Australian network, after marathon debates and several weeks of protests, on September 26, local time, Australia's new state passed an abortion legalization bill.
It is reported that the bill has triggered political debate in the past eight weeks, and there have been serious differences within the Australian Liberal Party since independent MP Greenwich announced the introduction of the bill.
After nearly 40 hours of discussion, the Australian New Zealand Senate passed the abortion legalization bill on the evening of the 25th by a vote of 26 to 14, making it the third-longest bill to be considered in the NSW Senate.
On the morning of the 26th, after a final vote was held in the NSW House of Representatives, it legalized abortion in NSW.
The bill allows a woman to terminate the pregnancy at 22 weeks of pregnancy and, with the consent of the two doctors, also allows a woman to have an abortion later in the pregnancy.
On the evening of the 25th, the Senate passed an amendment on the evening of the 25th, doctors can seek advice from the multidisciplinary team of the hospital's advisory committee before performing an aborted surgery for a woman after 22 weeks of pregnancy.
In addition, the amendment passed by the Senate also said that doctors must provide appropriate care for babies who survive after terminating a pregnancy.
NSW Premier Berejikilian has faced public criticism from conservatives on the bill, and Berejikilian has intervened several times in order to gain more debate time for the bill, but she did not attend the final vote.
“I need to take the time to manage the entire new state,” she defended her absence vote.
It is reported that Australian Liberal MP Davis, who was the strongest opponent of the abortion bill, has threatened to withdraw from the NSW government because of the bill, saying that the bill has triggered a "government crisis".
After that, Davis made a concession.
â€œThe contents of an amendment to the abortion legalization bill submitted to the House on the morning of the 26th actually provide more guarantees for women and doctors,â€ Davis said.
At the same time, New South Australia’s New South American National Party leader Bariraro said that he was proud to be part of the government that legalized abortion.
â€œWhat we have achieved last night is historic for the new state to legitimize abort, that abortion is no longer a crime, and that women who abort abortions will not be treated as criminals.â€
The major projects of the Trinity Group are located in Zhuzhou.
With a total investment of 15 billion yuan, it focuses on the development of petroleum intelligent equipment and smart steel industries.
Today, the Zhuzhou Municipal People's Government held a project signing ceremony.
Trinity Group invested 15 billion yuan to develop industrial projects such as smart steel industry, petroleum intelligent equipment and regional research and development center (headquarters base) and construction machinery used car market in Zhuzhou, with an expected annual comprehensive output value of more than 200 billion yuan.
With a total investment of 10 billion yuan, the Sanyi intelligent steel industry project is located in Hetang District, which will focus on becoming the largest steel and product trading center in the whole province and even in the middle, and is also an intelligent manufacturing and processing center for metal structural parts of the Trinity Group; with a total investment of 5 billion yuan, the oil intelligent equipment and regional research and development center (headquarters base), will focus on the construction of an oil intelligent equipment production base to build a regional research and development center and headquarters base.
At the same time, the Sanyi Group will also carry out pragmatic cooperation in intelligent manufacturing and other fields of second-hand car market for construction machinery in the automobile Boyuan Park of Zhuzhou High-tech Zone.
Zhuzhou City attaches great importance to cooperation with the Trinity Group.
The city's cooperation projects as this year's "No. 1 project" for investment promotion in the city, the Municipal Party Secretary Mao Tengfei, Mayor Yang Weiguo took the lead, the establishment of a special coordination group, efficient docking and high-level promotion, the whole process for the Sanyi Group settled in Zhuzhou development to provide high-quality and efficient services, from the intention to formally sign the cooperation agreement, less than 100 days.
Finance Minister Liu Kun: 67 central enterprises and financial institutions have transferred 86.1 billion yuan of state-owned funds to strengthen the social security fund.
Finance Minister Liu Kun said on the 27th that as of now, 67 central enterprises and central financial institutions have completed the transfer of some state-owned capital to enrich the social security fund, with a total of about 86.1 billion yuan of state-owned capital.
On the same day jointly organized by the Ministry of Finance, the Ministry of Human Resources and Social Security, and the SASAC, Liu Kun made the above statement at the deployment meeting on the task of transferring some state-owned capital to enrich the social security fund.
The transfer of some state-owned capital is an important measure to reform and improve the basic old-age insurance system, and it is a comprehensive reflection of the generational fairness of the development achievements of state-owned enterprises and the intergenerational fairness of the basic old-age insurance system, and a policy and measure based on the current and long-term.
In 2017, the State Council issued the implementation plan to transfer some state-owned capital to enrich the social security fund, requiring the selection of some central enterprises and some provinces to carry out pilots.
According to Liu Kun, the transfer of the preliminary work has achieved positive results.
At the central level, a total of 67 central enterprises and central financial institutions have been transferred in three batches, with a total transfer of about 86.1 billion yuan of state-to-owned capital.
Among them, the transfer work of the central financial institutions carried out by the Ministry of Finance to fulfill the responsibilities of investors has been basically completed.
The transfer of central enterprises already has a certain scale.
At the local level, the preliminary work of enterprise transfer has been carried out successively.
By the end of 2018, the pilot work in the two provinces of Zhejiang and Yunnan had been basically completed, transferring 15.8 billion yuan and 18.5 billion yuan of state-owned capital respectively.
In addition to the pilot provinces, other provinces have also successively carried out preliminary preparations for the transfer, laying the foundation for the next step.
According to the joint notice of the Ministry of Finance, the Ministry of human resources and social security, the SASAC, the General Administration of Taxation, and the Securities Regulatory Commission a few days ago, the work of the central and local governments transferred some state-owned capital to enrich the social security fund will be fully launched in 2019, and will be basically completed by the end of 2020.
The meeting held on the same day made specific arrangements for the comprehensive promotion and transfer of work.
The meeting stressed the need to complete the transfer work in a practical and efficient manner.
According to the schedule, the transfer work should be basically completed by the end of 2020.
Tight transfer working hours, the task is heavy."
Liu Kun said that all regions and departments should be carefully organized and carefully arranged to ensure that the transfer work should be completed according to the requirements; solidly promote the work, accurately grasp the content of the transfer policy; strengthen communication and coordination, and solve difficult problems in a timely manner.
From the starting point of â€œenriching the social security fund â€œenrichment of the social security fund â€“ the destination is to provide strong support for old-age security.
However, the author believes that this is not a simple equity "physical displacement", but the opening of "mathematical addition".
On September 20, the Ministry of Finance, the Ministry of Human Resources and Social Security, the SASAC, the General Administration of Taxation, and the Securities Regulatory Commission jointly issued the "Notice on Comprehensively Promoting the Transfer of Some State-Owned Capital to Enrich the Work of the Social Security Fund" to clarify the timetable for the transfer of state-owned assets to the Social Security Fund, that is, the work of the central and local transfers of some state-owned capital to enrich the Social Security Fund was fully rolled out in 2019.
After the release of the document, the Ministry of Finance and other departments were also implemented very quickly.
On September 25th, the Ministry of Finance transferred 10% of the shares held by the Industrial and Commercial Bank and the Agricultural Bank to the Social Security Fund, with a total value of more than 115 billion yuan.
According to the regulations, the Social Security Foundation and other undertaking entities, as financial investors, have the right to income, disposal and the right to information assigned to state-owned equity.
ICBC and Agricultural Bank said in the announcement that this change in interests will not lead to a change in the controlling shareholders and actual controllers of the Bank.
In this regard, the author believes that similar state-owned enterprise equity transfer is not a simple change of equity ownership, but can stimulate a series of "addition operations".
Some state-owned capital transfer of social security as the "results of addition", of course, it is possible to reflect that state-owned enterprises are owned by the whole people, and the development results are shared by the whole people.
After many years of reform and development, state-owned enterprises, especially state-owned enterprises, are mostly in important industries and fields in China's economy, and their overall profitability is strong and relatively stable.
Among them, the leading enterprises continue to achieve better and become bigger and stronger.
On July 10, the executive meeting of the State Council decided to fully promote the transfer of some state-owned capital this year to enrich the work of the Social Security Fund.
The Ministry of Finance immediately said that with relevant departments, according to the deployment of the executive meeting of the State Council, it will do a good job in comprehensively promoting the transfer of some state-owned capital to enrich the social security fund, and fully reflect the intergenerational fairness of the basic old-age insurance system and the development results of state-owned enterprises.
The second step of "addition results" is to enhance the sustainability of China's social security fund and further consolidate the foundation of the pension social security system.
With the aging of the population, China's social security funds are under pressure, and the state-owned capital, which has been transferred as the main body, mostly has the ability to make sustained profits and dividends, which can not only effectively supplement the social security fund, but also provide a source of living water for the social security fund.
It is estimated that for every 3.8-percentage-point state-owned capital transferred, the contribution ratio of basic old-age old-age insurance can be reduced by 1 percentage point.
The transfer of the third step "adhesion result" is to add a stabilizer to the capital market.
The transfer of the main body to obtain the proceeds of the way is "dividend-oriented, complementary to the operation".
The Social Security Fund, as a financial investor of state-owned capital, does obtain equity dividends.
However, the Social Security Fund, as a value investor in the capital market, has a strong capital operation ability.
For the listed assets in the state-owned capital, the social security fund will further optimize the corporate governance structure of listed companies, which is conducive to improving the operating level of enterprises and have a positive impact on listed companies and the capital market.
At the same time, as an investment wind vane, the improvement of shareholding weight is conducive to further enhancing its influence in the market and playing the role of "stabilizer" in the market.
In addition, it is also beneficial to give full play to the "value discovery" function of institutional investors and guide investors to rational investment and value investment.
Karl Hartmann was admitted to the Leipzig Conservatory of Music at the age of 18 and studied under Webmann.
After the Nazis came to power, Hartmann resisted first in the form of works that were not published in Germany, and later even stopped writing.
In 1933, he created Miserae and dedicates it to "my sleeping friends".
The symphony was premiered in Prague in 1935 but was harassed by the Nazi bureaucracy.
Hartman was determined not to play any of his works under Nazi rule.
Hartman’s Funeral Concerto is a violin and string concerto, when the manuscript was taken out of Germany and premiered in Switzerland.
Listen to the Funeral Concerto performed by the Bern Chamber Orchestra at Beethoven’s Music Festival in 2018.
U.S. Senate approves Scalia as labor secretary
WASHINGTON, Sept. 26 (Xinhua) -- The U.S. Senate on Sept. 26 passed President Donald Trump's nomination of Eugene Scalia as Secretary of Labor.
With 53 votes in favor and 44 against, none of the Democrats voted for Scalia.
Republicans believe Scalia’s résumé makes him well-positioned as secretary of labor.
But in the view of Democrats, Scalia has long been the antithesis between workers and unions in his career as a lawyer.
Scalia will replace Aleksandr Acosta.
U.S. billionaire Jeffrey Epstein was accused of leniency over alleged sexual abuse and abduction of teenage girls, and then-Secretary of Labor Acosta announced his resignation in July under intense public pressure.
Scalia is a 56-year-old partner at a well-known U.S.-based law firm whose father is the late U.S. Supreme Court Justice Antonin Scalia.
The Department of Labor is the cabinet-level department of the U.S. federal government and is responsible for labor-related matters.
On the same day, the White House also issued a statement saying that Trump had nominated the Federal Emergency Management Agency's Acting Administrator Peter Geiner to officially lead the agency.
In accordance with the procedure, Guyana's nomination must also be approved by the Senate.
The U.S. Department of Homeland Security coordinates the federal government’s resources to deal with emergencies such as natural disasters and terrorist attacks in the United States.
Since the 35th anniversary of the National People's Day military parade has debuted, every time a large military parade is organized, there will be a "Big Mac" phalanx of strategic missile forces.
â€œThe National Day military parade was changed from â€œmilitary' to â€œthe armyâ€ , and the rocket army debuted on Chang'an Street.â€
Wang Bo, the head of the command group of the rocket army's equipment team, said.
The guided missile forces fully carry forward the spirit that is particularly able to suffer, especially able to fight, and especially capable of dedication, strict detailed training and scientific group training, reflecting the three major characteristics throughout the parade training, showing a good image of the strategic military service, and paying more attention to the strict style.
In this military parade and training, both generals and soldiers are strictly required by strict standards, forging a strong style that is strictly popular and prohibited.
They also pay attention to carrying forward the spirit of artisans, grasping every detail to practice technology, practice perseverance, practice style, and form the characteristics such as "military posture, fast movement, and bright answers", and constantly use a strict style to create a powerful missile phalanx and pay more attention to scientific and technological innovation.
As a high-tech strategic military service, the Rocket Army says that science and technology and heavy innovation are excellent traditions and advantages.
On the basis of learning from the experience of the past, they break the mentality, break through the traditional method, use advanced means such as satellite positioning, laser ranging, high-definition imaging, and real-time speed measurement to improve the level of training and quality efficiency, and ensure that the combination of people and cars is not bad, the team's actions are not bad, and the actual combat standard is more docked.
The Rocket Army's receiving troops adhere to the same standards and higher requirements of the parade ground and the launch site, hold every gate and pay close attention to every detail, so that the reviewing troops can be tempered, and truly let the National Day parade ground become a training and examination ground to enhance the combat effectiveness of the troops.
Iran has been confirmed to develop advanced centrifuges to further suspend the implementation of the Iranian nuclear agreement
According to the "Central News Agency", the United Nations International Atomic Energy Agency (IAEA) said on the 26th that Iran's use of advanced centrifuges to produce enriched uranium has once again violated the Iranian nuclear agreement.
According to reports, Iran is gradually violating the restrictions of the Iranian nuclear agreement in response to US President Trump's withdrawal from the Iranian nuclear agreement in May 2018 and the resumption and strengthening of sanctions against Iran.
Iran suspended two other commitments in July to keep the stockpile of enriched uranium less than 300 kilograms, and the purity of enriched uranium does not exceed 3.67 per cent.
According to the nuclear agreement, Iran can only set up about 5,000 first-generation IR-1 centrifuges in Natanz to accumulate enriched uranium, and it only allows Iran to use a small number of more advanced models for research, but does not produce enriched uranium.
If Iran successfully develops more advanced centrifuges, it will be able to produce enriched uranium several times faster, possibly to build a nuclear bomb.
According to the report, the International Atomic Energy Agency pointed out: "On September 25th, the agency has confirmed that Iran's advanced centrifuges of type 2, model 3 ... are accumulating or are ready to accumulate enriched uranium."
The U.N.’s International Atomic Energy Agency (IAEA) presented the report to Member States on the 26th, and a diplomatic official responded: “They’re busy at [Natanz’s uranium-enriching] facility.”
The Vietnam-South Korea Association of Investors and Entrepreneurs was officially unveiled.
Chen Hailing, president of the Vietnam-ROK Investors and Entrepreneurs Association, said that VKBIA will work together to serve as a bridge to strengthen bilateral relations.
The two countries aim to increase their two-way trade to $100 billion by 2020.
Chen Hailing believes that the birth of the association has become an important step to achieve these goals.
He expressed the hope that the Vietnamese party, the government and the relevant functional agencies of the Republic of Korea will provide assistance for the future operation of the association.
Vietnam's deputy ambassador to the Republic of South Korea Chen Changshui said that VKBIA will create a good platform for the exchange and sharing of experiences and ideas between Vietnamese and South Korean entrepreneurs, aiming to expand the space for investment cooperation and mutual assistance to make a more effective contribution to Vietnam's economic development and integration into the cause of international economic integration, and promote the vigorous development of Vietnam-ROK trade relations.
At the opening ceremony, VKBIA representatives signed a cooperation agreement with the representatives of the Vietnam Association of farms and agricultural enterprises.
VKBIA coincides with the 10th anniversary of the establishment of the strategic cooperative partnership between Vietnam and South Korea, and the two countries are strengthening practical cooperation in the fields of diplomacy, national defense and security, promoting trade and investment cooperation, and aiming to achieve the goal of 100 billion US dollars of two-way trade in 2020.
Italy’s education minister has proposed a sugar tax to protect people’s health.
Lorenzo Fioramonti, Italy’s minister of education and a member of the 5-Star Movement, has introduced a motion to parliament recommending that the Italian government implement a new tax policy on drinks, snacks and airline tickets with high sugar content.
According to reports, in accordance with the bill put forward by Education Minister Fioramonti, the Italian government will impose a snack tax on healthy dietary products such as sugary drinks and snacks; at the same time, an environmental tax will be imposed on airline tickets, 1 euro for domestic flights, and 1.5 euros for international classes.
Fiora Monti said that through this seemingly small series of tax measures, the Italian government is expected to receive 3 billion euros in tax revenue.
The proceeds will be available in the areas of education, health and environmental protection.
In this regard, Italian Prime Minister Conte said that he believes that this is a feasible solution; Italian parliamentarians, European parliamentarians and Union Party leader Salvini tweeted sarcastically that everyone should quickly hide desserts, biscuits, bread and candy, because the new government will begin to impose a snack tax.
The report pointed out that the snack tax generally refers to the imposition of a special tax on sugar-sweetened beverages and high-calorie foods.
Collecting this tax will help bring benefits to public health.
On the evening of September 25 local time, the Chinese Embassy in Canada held a reception in Ottawa to celebrate the 70th anniversary of the founding of the People's Republic of China.
OTTAWA, Sept. 26 (Reporter Yu Ruidong) The new Chinese ambassador to Canada Cong Peiwu held a reception to celebrate the 70th anniversary of the founding of the People's Republic of China in Ottawa on the evening of September 25, local time.
In his speech, he said that in the 70 years since the founding of New China, under the strong leadership of the Communist Party of China and with the joint efforts of the people throughout the country, the cause of socialism with Chinese characteristics has made remarkable achievements, which has not only profoundly changed the face of China and benefited its own people, but also produced far-reaching world significance.
Based on China's own national conditions, China has opened up a path of socialism with Chinese characteristics, broadened the way for developing countries to move toward modernization, and contributed China's wisdom and China's solutions to solve human problems.
The participants stop to watch the theme photo exhibition of the 70th anniversary of New China held at the same time in the venue.
Cong Peiwu said that China has created a rare miracle in the history of human development in the world and has made important contributions to promoting world peace and development.
China adheres to an independent foreign policy of peace, has always advocated the basic norms of international relations with the Five Principles of Peaceful Coexistence as its core, and is a builder of world peace, a contributor to global development and a defender of the international order.
China's development has provided new opportunities for the development of all countries in the world, including Canada, benefiting the people of all countries.
Cong Peiwu stressed that the nearly 50-year development of China-Canada relations has shown that bilateral relations can only move forward on the right track if they uphold the principles of equality and mutual respect.
On the contrary, the relations between the two countries will be frustrated, and the interests of the two countries will be damaged.
At present, China-Canada relations are encountering serious difficulties, and the responsibility lies not with the Chinese side.
â€œUnleashing the bell must also tie the bell man.â€
It is hoped that the Canadian side will come up with ways to properly resolve the outstanding problems in bilateral relations as soon as possible, so as to create conditions for bilateral relations to return to the right track
Canadian government officials, U.S. senators, friendly people from all walks of life, diplomatic envoys in Canada and more than 700 representatives of overseas Chinese, Chinese-funded institutions and international students attended the reception.
Diplomats of the Chinese Embassies in the Republic of Canada, Chen Mingjian and other embassy diplomats participated in the reception.
At the reception, a themed photo exhibition for the 70th anniversary of the founding of the People's Republic of China was held, and promotional videos such as "China 2019" and "Beautiful China" were broadcast.
Chinese and Canadian artists and embassy diplomats performed distinctive literary and artistic programs.
This is also the 16th Chinese Ambassador to Canada Cong Peiwu debuted at a public event.
Cong Peiwu arrived in Canada on September 22 and submitted a copy of the country's letter to Haehrer, Chief Protocol Officer of the Ministry of Foreign Affairs in Ottawa the next day.
Cong Peiwu, who was born in May 1967, graduated from the Diplomatic Academy.
At the beginning of this century, he was stationed at the Chinese Embassy in Canada.
Prior to his appointment to Canada, he served as the director of the North American Oceania Department of the Ministry of Foreign Affairs of the People's Republic of China, and had previously served as Minister Counsellor and Minister of the Chinese Embassy in the United Kingdom.
The Vietnamese city of Hanoi strives to expand cooperation with various places in Laos
Mr. Nguyen De Jong recalled the practical delegation visits of the two sides and affirmed that these activities have contributed to fostering the special and friendly relations between the two countries expected by President Ho Chi Minh and President Keshan Fong Weihan.
He expressed the hope that Ambassador Tonshawan will continue to serve as a good bridge and link for friendly relations between Hanoi and the rest of Laos, including Vientiane.
Ambassador Ton Shawan said that Laos has learned from many of Vietnam's successful experiences and was impressed by the breakthrough development achieved in Hanoi and even Vietnam in recent years.
He thanked the Hanoi Municipal Government for its strong support and assistance for the activities of the Lao People's Embassy in Việt Nam and expressed his belief that despite the fluctuating global situation, Vietnam-Vietnam-Vietnam relations will continue to develop well.
At the beginning of 2020, it is expected that at the beginning of 2020, he will lead a working delegation from Hanoi to Vientiane, the capital of Laos.
Starting from 2020, Hanoi will provide a number of scholarships to Lao university students studying in various institutions of higher learning in Hanoi.
The Chinese Embassy in Indonesia and the mission to ASEAN held a reception for the 70th anniversary of the National Day.
On the evening of the 26th, the Chinese Embassy in Indonesia and the Chinese mission to ASEAN held a reception in Jakarta to celebrate the 70th anniversary of the founding of the People's Republic of China.
Indonesia's Minister of Trade Lukita, Minister of Lands and Spatial Planning Sofian and ASEAN Under-Secretary-General Kang Fu and other guests attended the reception.
People from all walks of life in Indonesia, representatives of various countries stationed in Indonesia, missions to ASEAN and international organizations in Indonesia, representatives of overseas Chinese, Chinese-funded institutions and international students, and more than 1,000 young contestants such as "I am with China"-themed children's paintings participated in the reception.
China's Ambassador to Indonesia Xiao Qian and Ambassador to ASEAN Huang Xilian warmly welcomed their guests.
On behalf of the Chinese Embassy in Indonesia and the mission to ASEAN, he said that the birth of New China in 1949 ushered in a new era in Chinese history.
China has moved from closure and backwardness to openness and progress, from the lack of food and clothing to a well-off society in an all-round way, from poverty and weakness to prosperity and strength, and the Chinese nation has ushered in a historic leap from standing up and getting rich to getting stronger.
Xiao Qian said that in recent years, China-Indonesia relations have made great progress, political mutual trust between the two countries has been continuously enhanced, practical cooperation has been continuously promoted, exchanges in various fields have been comprehensively expanded, and the China-Indonesia comprehensive strategic partnership has been stable.
China-ASEAN relations continue to improve and upgrade, always adhere to mutual respect, understanding, trust and support, and effectively promote regional peace, stability, prosperity and development.
Xiao Qian pointed out that the fundamental reason for the development and change of New China in the past 70 years is that the Chinese people, under the leadership of the Communist Party of China, have pioneered and developed the path of socialism with Chinese characteristics.
This road conforms to the trend of the times, conforms to China's national conditions, has profoundly changed the fate of the Chinese people and the Chinese nation, and has also made a major contribution to the peaceful development of the world and the region.
"Celebrating the 70th anniversary of the founding of the People's Republic of China theme tour" attracted guests to stop and watch.
Xiao Qian said that China and Indonesia and ASEAN will always work together to jointly build a new type of international relations, promote the construction of a community with a shared future for mankind, and make new and greater contributions bilaterally, to the region and the rest of the world.
All the guests watched a wonderful video reviewing the glorious achievements of New China in the past 70 years and reflecting China-Indonesia and China-ASEAN relations.
Divided into the "brilliant achievements of China's development achievements", "China-Indonesia relations steady and far-reaching", "China-ASEAN relations to improve the quality and upgrading of China-ASEAN relations" in the three parts of the video won a warm applause.
The reception site was also arranged to "celebrate the 70th anniversary of the founding of the People's Republic of China theme tour" to attract guests to stop and watch.
Baidu's first self-driving taxi team to start trial operation
Yesterday, Baidu announced in Changsha that the self-driving taxi fleet Robotaxi trial operation was officially opened.
The first batch of Apollo and FAW Hongqi jointly developed the "red flag EV" Robotaxi team has been opened in the Changsha part of the test section to start trial operations.
From now on, ordinary Changsha citizens will be able to log in to the Apollo official website to apply to become seed users, and have the opportunity to test the experience.
An experiential passenger said that he was sitting in the back row of the vehicle, clicking on the front screen of the passenger's seat, and opened the vehicle's self-driving itinerary with one click.
In the car, for the safety of passengers and the requirements of the current policies and regulations, the trial operation of the vehicle is equipped with a safety officer in the driver's seat to maximize the safety of the passengers.
In the process of driving, the vehicle can intelligently change lanes according to the road conditions, and can also judge the driving conditions of the surrounding vehicles, and make automatic avoidance of close overtaking and other situations.
During the whole experience, the passenger area screen shows pedestrians, cars, and even the road conditions of some traditional blind areas on the road in real-time.
Even if the vehicle occult, you can also see the changes in the traffic lights in front and the waiting time and other information in advance, and all the road conditions are clear at a glance.
Driverless has been heard on TV before, thinking that it is far away from us, but it feels amazing to find that it is in our lives today.
We look forward to making it truly into people’s lives in the future.
In June 2019, Apollo received 45 manned test licenses issued by the Changsha municipal government.
At present, Changsha's self-driving test open roads, passing through Changsha Artificial Intelligence Science and Technology City, Meixi Lake, Ocean Lake, Da Wangshan, High-tech Zone and other areas, with a total length of 135 kilometers and a demonstration area of 70 square kilometers, which is currently the longest road mileage in China, the largest area, covering the most complex scene and the most advanced intelligent driving demonstration area.
By the end of 2019, Apollo Robotaxi’s pilot road in Changsha is expected to cover about 50 kilometers, and in the first half of 2020, it is planned to cover the 135-kilometer road currently open in Changsha.
The women's volleyball team is still dissatisfied: it will be very difficult to make so many mistakes in the strong team.
On the afternoon of the 27th of Beijing time, the Chinese women's volleyball team ushered in the ninth game of the 2019 Women's Volleyball World Cup, and the opponent was a strong Dutch women's volleyball team, and the Chinese women's volleyball team finally defeated the Dutch women's volleyball team 3:1, ushering in the women's Volleyball World Cup of nine consecutive
However, the women's volleyball coach Lang Ping still expressed his dissatisfaction with the team's performance in the third game.
â€œIn the third game, the other side strengthened the service attack, and we couldn't take the ball (a pass) and we didn't make a lot of mistakes."
â€œIt’s hard to make so many of your own mistakes.
Lang Ping said in an interview after the game.
"We told the players to be focused, an attack is not in place, we have to adjust the attack to play well, in addition we have to fight with each other to defend."
Lang Ping also commented on Zhang Chang Ning's performance, saying that she had encountered some difficulties in the attack, more anxious, too eager to kill the ball, the action will be deformed.
I want her to be a little patient, "all of us to protect her."
China's development is an opportunity, not a threat and a challenge to the world.
White paper: China's development is an opportunity, not a threat and a challenge to the world.
The white paper pointed out that China's development is an opportunity, not a threat and a challenge to the world.
As China's comprehensive national strength and international influence rapidly increase, some in the international community are worried that China will take the path of â€œnational hegemonyâ€ , and some have put forward the so-called â€œChina threat theoryâ€ .
There are cognitive misinterpretations, deep-seated prejudices, psychological imbalances brought about by the growth of forces, and deliberate misrepresentation for the preservation of their own vested interests.
Achieving national prosperity, national rejuvenation and people's well-being is both the dream of the Chinese people and the common dream of the people of all countries.
"China's development is an opportunity for the world, not a threat and a challenge."
The white paper pointed out that China is the main stabilizer and power source of world economic growth, China is the largest contributor to world economic growth, China's scientific and technological innovation has injected new momentum into world economic growth, and the role of China's economic stabilizer and power source in the future has become more prominent.
At present, China's economic growth momentum is insufficient, and a stable China's economy is becoming more and more important to the world.
China's economy is shifting from high-speed growth to high-quality development, new industrialization, informatization, urbanization, and agricultural modernization have been accelerated, the economic structure has been deeply restructured, industrial optimization has been continuously upgraded, and new economic growth points have continued to emerge.
According to the McKinsey global research report, by 2040, the integration of China and the other economies of the rest of the world is expected to create 22 trillion to 37 trillion US dollars of economic value, equivalent to 15% to 26% of the total global economy, the world's other economies and China to strengthen cooperation, will create huge economic value."
The white paper emphasizes that China's economy and the world economy have undergone structural changes and are deeply integrated.
China, with a more stable economic operation, higher quality of growth and promising growth prospects, is a long-term positive for world economic development.
Looking at China's economic development as a "threat" and a "challenge", trying to squeeze China out of the global industrial chain, supply chain and value chain, and "decoupling" China from the world economy is neither feasible nor harmful.
The white paper pointed out that all-round opening up creates more opportunities for all countries to share the "China dividend".
China unswervingly pursues a mutually beneficial and win-win opening-up strategy to achieve greater and higher levels of opening-up, China has the world's most promising consumer market, China is the most attractive investment destination, a larger-scale "going out" to benefit more countries.
"Openness should be two-way and mutually beneficial, and should not benefit from a one-way and one-sided approach.
The two-way mutual benefit can be sustainable in the long run.”
The white paper said that China is committed to continuously expand imports, relax market access, improve the business environment and strengthen intellectual property protection, and other countries should also expand opening up and take corresponding measures and strive to improve their business environment.
Only when all parties meet each other can we create an open, inclusive, inclusive, balanced and win-win development environment, and jointly make the "cake" of development bigger and bigger, and form a mutually beneficial and win-win community of interests.
The white paper pointed out that China has provided more public goods for the international community.
These include promoting high-quality co-construction of the “Belt and Road”, building a platform for multilateral dialogue and cooperation, actively participating in international and regional affairs, and actively carrying out foreign assistance.
"China's development has benefited from the international community, and it has never forgotten to give back to the international community to provide more and better public goods for the international community."
In a written interview with Xinhua News Agency (Xinhua News Agency), the general manager of the Russian Export Center Andrey Slepunyov recently said that Russia is willing to strengthen cooperation with China in the field of economic and trade, further optimize the export structure, and promote the diversification of Russia's exports to China.
At the same time, the export of agricultural products is also very important in Russia's exports to China, as well as grain, meat products and dairy products, as well as cereals, fish and seafood.
In recent years, Russia's exports of non-raw materials and non-energy products to China have also shown a good and stable development trend.
Referring to Russia's efforts to optimize its export structure to China, Slipniov said that the Russian side has set up the task of expanding the export of high-tech products to meet the import demand of high-tech products from all countries and regions, including China.
The Russian side will next improve financial and non-financial support measures to promote the further growth of the number of high-tech enterprises.
Srepniov said that Russia is willing to export construction technology and high-tech building materials to China and develop cooperation with China in the fields of medicine and aviation manufacturing.
The two sides also have great potential for cooperation in the field of urban environmental development.
He pointed out that Russia's products in many fields, compared with similar products in the West, "the quality has an advantage, the price is also competitive."
Referring to the goal of the two countries to achieve 200 billion US dollars in bilateral trade volume by 2024, Srepniov said that fields such as agriculture, machinery manufacturing, chemical industry and forestry will play an important role in achieving this goal.
The Russian side intends to promote the diversification of supply in these areas and promote the export of deep-processed products.
He stressed that the Russian side intends to promote its exporters into the global value-added chain, of which China is one of the development directions.
Russian manufacturers in the fields of agriculture, metallurgization, oil and natural gas and chemical industry are fully capable of participating in this process.
At present, the two countries need to continue to deepen the cooperation between enterprises and "set up more Russian-Chinese joint ventures to jointly develop exports to third countries."
The Russian export center is taking a variety of measures and services to support the export of Russian products to China through the Russian Export Credit and Investment Insurance Agency and the Russian Export-Import Bank.
At the same time, the Russian export center will continue to deepen cooperation with the relevant Chinese departments to promote more convenient access of Russian goods to the Chinese market and the development of new types of exports to China.
The growth of financial institutions that use RMB payments around the world has increased significantly.
From July 2017 to July 2019, the latest RMB tracking special issue released in London shows that from July 2017 to July 2019, there has been a significant increase in the number of financial institutions that use RMB payments around the world.
At SWIFT's 2019 London annual meeting, the agency's "Centranium Tracking Special Issue of Insights into the Renminbi from a London Perspective" showed that the number of financial institutions using RMB payments increased by 11.31% worldwide from July 2017, from 1989 to 2,214.
Among them, the number of financial institutions using RMB payments in Africa and the Middle East increased the most, from 143 in July 2017 to 173 in July 2019, an increase of 20.98%.
According to the report, as of August 2019, the yuan's share in global payment currencies was 2.22 percent.
At the same time, London has played a leading role in RMB offshore foreign exchange transactions.
According to the report data, in July 2019, London's share of global RMB offshore foreign exchange transactions was 33.79%, ranking the highest in the world.
According to the report, London ranks first in global foreign exchange transactions.
In July 2019, London's share of global foreign exchange transactions was 40.14%, the United States 12.93 per cent and France 7.67 per cent.
The Ministry of Foreign Affairs Responds to Taiwan's "Diplomical Breakthrough": Sneaking and Self-Defeated Personality
In response to Taiwan's personnel entering the United Nations Headquarters to participate in relevant meetings on religious issues a few days ago, Chinese Foreign Ministry spokesman Geng Shuang said at a regular press conference on the 27th that this small action is very dishonorable and generous.
According to Taiwanese media reports, the personnel of Taipei's office in New York recently entered the United Nations headquarters to participate in the relevant meetings on religious issues held in the United States, calling it a "diplomatic breakthrough."
The meeting you mentioned is a side meeting held by the United States on the basis of the United Nations, and it is not a meeting of the United Nations at all.
Geng Shuang said that Taiwan personnel in a sneaky way into the United Nations, self-damaging personality, but also said that this is the so-called "diplomatic breakthrough", this kind of small action is very dishonorable, smiling and generous.
He pointed out that the United Nations side has repeatedly reiterated that it adheres to the handling of the Taiwan issue in accordance with General Assembly resolution 2758, and the majority of United Nations Member States also adhere to the one-China principle.
Hohhot accelerates the upgrading of the dairy industry's industrial structure - Xinhua
Xinhua News Agency, Hohhot, September 27 (Reporter Ann Lumeng) The reporter learned from the municipal government of Hohhot of Inner Mongolia Autonomous Region that Hohhot City accelerated the upgrading of the dairy industrial structure, Yili and Mengniu among the top ten dairy enterprises in the world, accelerating the implementation of a number of projects such as Yili Health Food Industrial Park and Mengniu China Dairy Industrial Park, and making every effort to create an upgraded version of Chinese milk.
Dairy is the traditional dominant industry in Hohhot, relying on unique resource endowments, industrial base and policy support, Hohhot's dairy industry has expanded rapidly, and the large-scale breeding rate has been continuously improved.
In 2018, the large-scale breeding rate of cows in the city reached more than 98%, nearly 85% of farmers entered the industrialization chain, and the total sales revenue of Yili and Mengniu enterprises was close to 150 billion yuan.
In order to further expand and strengthen the dairy industry, Hohhot City has issued a number of opinions on "building an upgraded version of Chinese dairy products" and a three-year action plan to promote the upgrading of the dairy industry (2018-2020), focusing on the goal of taking the lead in achieving dairy manufacturing 4.0, implementing the "five major upgrades" plan for the construction of high-quality milk source bases, the convergence of interests of agricultural enterprises, the cultivation of hundreds of billions of leading enterprises, the cultivation of characteristic small and medium-sized enterprise clusters, and the international innovation of the dairy industry.
Feng Yuzhen, mayor of Hohhot City, said that the local government will accelerate the implementation of the two major projects with an investment of hundreds of billions of yuan in Yili Health Food Industrial Park and Mengniu China Dairy Industrial Park, synchronously build projects such as the National Dairy Technology Innovation Center, and continuously enhance the core competitiveness of the national dairy industry.
On September 27, the middle price of the exchange rate against the U.S. dollar was raised by 5 dong.
