"China's good story" database on-line to show the world a true three-dimensional and all-in-one China
With the purpose of "telling China's story and propagating China's voice well", an innovative and basic platform for foreign propaganda work, the "China Good Story" database was officially launched today to show the real, three-dimensional and all-round China to the world.
The "China Good Story" database (www.chinastory.cn) is hosted by Xinhua News Agency and hosted by Xinhua News Agency China Search.
This is the scene of the on-line press conference of "The United States and the United States - 'China's good story' database" filmed on September 27.
On the same day, an innovative and basic platform for foreign propaganda work with the purpose of "telling China's story and propagating China's voice well" was officially launched to show the real, three-dimensional and all-round China to the world.
