Jiangxi: "line chief" to protect the safety of the passenger line operation.
The reporter learned from the Jiangxi Provincial Highway and Transport Administration that as of now, there are 1,334 passenger train lines in 11 districts and cities in Jiangxi and 6 provinces and counties.
The person in charge of the Jiangxi Provincial Highway and Transport Administration introduced that due to the safety management of some passenger transport enterprises in the form, the main responsibility of enterprise safety cannot be put into practice, illegal activities such as overcrowdance of passenger vehicles and driver fatigue driving occur from time to time, and the road passenger safety situation is more severe.
In order to further compact the main responsibility of road passenger transport enterprises for safe production and to ensure the safety of passenger travel by car, Jiangxi began to pilot the â€œline long systemâ€ in 2017, and began to gradually promote it throughout the province in 2018.
At present, there have been 92 road passenger transport enterprises in Jiangxi to implement the â€œline chief systemâ€ and selected 1,334 â€œline captainsâ€ to manage 1,334 lines, covering 4,824 operating buses.
According to reports, the â€œline leaderâ€ is generally appointed by the road transport passenger transport enterprises to appoint special personnel, specifically responsible for the management of the relevant shift line of people, cars, lines and other work, to ensure that the head of the line on the lines, vehicles, drivers, operating environment and other comprehensive control, to ensure the operational safety of the shift line.
In order to celebrate the 70th anniversary of the founding of the People's Republic of China and the 20th anniversary of the establishment of the Macao Special Administrative Region, from October to December, the Municipal Council will conduct a special food safety public guided tour, led by food safety education personnel to visit the "Twenty-Year Photo Exhibition of Mainland Food and Agricultural Products for Australia" and "Food Information Station" to deepen the public's understanding of the safety supervision and stable supply of food in the Mainland, as well as measures to ensure food safety in Macao.
Co-sponsored by the State General Administration of Customs and the Macao Special Administrative Region Municipal Government, the "Watch to help each other and work together to ensure the safety of food and agricultural products in the Mainland for the security of food and agricultural products in Australia for 20 years" is now being held on the food information station on the first floor of the Youhan hawker building, attracting a large number of local and Australian citizens to visit.
In order to celebrate the 70th anniversary of the founding of the People's Republic of China and the 20th anniversary of the establishment of the Macao Special Administrative Region, from October to December, at 2:30 p.m. (except on public holidays), the special food safety public guided tour will be carried out at the food information station on the first floor of the Youhan hawker building, and the food safety education staff will visit the photo exhibition and food information station.
The duration of each food safety guided tour activity is about 30 minutes, and interested members of the public who are interested in participating can register 15 minutes before the beginning of the day's activities to the food information station of the municipal government on the first floor of the Youhan hawker building, the cost is free of charge, the quota is limited on a first-come-first-served basis.
If you have any questions, you can call the food safety line 2833 8181 during office hours.
Fujian Provincial Tax Repository Comprehensive Tax Payment Platform Officially Launched - Sino-New Network
The Fujian Provincial Tax Repository Bank Convenient People's comprehensive tax payment platform was officially launched.
Zhongxin Net Fuzhou, September 27 (Ye Qiuyun) Fujian Provincial Tax Repository Silver Convenient People's comprehensive tax payment platform was officially launched in Fuzhou City, Fujian Province on September 27.
The reporter learned that on October 26, 2018, the Fujian Provincial Taxation Bureau of the Fujian Provincial Taxation Bureau of the People's Bank of the People's Bank of China Fuzhou Central Branch jointly signed a three-way memorandum of cooperation to create a comprehensive tax payment platform of Fujian Provincial Tax Reservoir.
After nearly a year of construction, at present, the platform has been successfully launched.
Wang Dehui, director of the treasury department of the Fuzhou central branch of the People's Bank of China, introduced that the platform upholds the construction concepts of security, versatility, convenience, compliance and leadership, the front-end is connected to tax, government, banks, non-bank payment institutions and social service providers, providing mobile phone apps, WeChat public accounts, tax halls, bank outlets, inclusive financial service points and other online and offline tax payment channels.
It is reported that the platform brings together a number of convenience projects, of which urban and rural residents' medical insurance fee collection projects have been officially launched.
The project has opened up 14 online and offline channels, providing services for more than 30 million urban and rural residents in Fujian Province, covering 76% of the resident population in Fujian Province.
On-line can pay medical insurance premiums by means of â€œMing tax passâ€, â€œcloud flash paymentâ€, as well as the APP and WeChat public number of various banks; offline, you can pay medical insurance premiums in various tax halls and rural inclusive financial service points in Fujian Province in a variety of ways.
Shi Dong, vice president of the Fuzhou central branch of the People's Bank of China, said that the successful launch of the platform, while ensuring the direct payment of government revenue and the real-time interaction of data and information, it can provide a safe and efficient, multi-channel and multi-modal convenience tax payment service for the public.
At present, there are more than more than 16,000 inclusive financial service points in the province, more than 9,000 have opened the medical insurance fee collection function, so that rural residents "do not leave the village" can safely check the medical insurance fees, so that the public has more and more and more "sense", "happiness".
According to statistics, since the early trial operation of the platform's urban and rural residents' medical insurance fees, the number of service users has reached 840,000, of which there have been 750,000 online payment users and nearly 20,000 payment users for inclusive financial service points.
In addition, the deputy director of the Fujian Provincial Taxation Bureau of the State Administration of Taxation revealed at the event that the platform was the first in the country to apply the blockchain electronic payment certificate technology.
Starting from the next month, after the payer completes the payment, he can also download the electronic payment certificate stamped directly through the mobile phone.
The Fujian tax information network based on blockchain technology is being built, and the "high-speed road" to facilitate private tax payments will be further broadened.
The United States will increase the deployment of air defense systems and forces in Saudi Arabia.
The US Department of Defense announced on the 26th that due to the previous attacks on Saudi oil facilities, the United States will deploy an additional Patriot air defense system in Saudi Arabia, four sets of Sentinel radar systems and about 200 U.S. troops.
The Pentagon said in a statement on the same day that the deployment will enhance the air defense and missile defense capabilities of important military targets and civilian infrastructure in Saudi Arabia, as well as enhance the US military presence in the region.
U.S. Defense Secretary Esper also approved two Patriot air defense systems and a THAAD anti-missile system to be included in the reserve deployment sequence.
Some U.S. defense media have questioned the effectiveness of the deployment, saying that the main targets of the Patriot and THAAD systems are not low-altitude targets such as U.S. drones and cruise missiles claimed to attack Saudi Arabia.
Iranian President Hassan Rouhani, speaking at the general debate of the United Nations General Assembly on the 25th, said Iran can help maintain the "security of the Persian Gulf" and ensure the smooth and safe passage of oil transport vessels through the Strait of Hormuz when all countries can enjoy their fair rights.
At the same time, he also stressed that regional security can only be achieved with the withdrawal of U.S. troops from the region.
On the 14th of this month, a number of unmanned aerial vehicles attacked the two oil facilities of the Saudi national oil company and caused a fire.
The United States accused Iran of carrying out the attack and imposed new sanctions on Iran.
Serisi's chairman's plan was completed last year's call for employees to increase their holdings by up to 43%.
On the evening of September 25th, Cyrus (603716.SH) announced that the company's actual controller and chairman Wen Wei has increased the company's shares by a total of 1.0542 million shares, accounting for 0.5139% of the company's total share capital through the Shanghai Stock Exchange's collective bidding transaction method, with a total holding amount of 2009.26 million yuan (including stamp duty, commission, interest and other transaction fees), to complete the expansion plan.
It is reported that before the implementation of this increase plan, Wen Wei directly held 8.58 million shares of Sellis, accounting for 4.18% of the company's total share capital, the controlling shareholder Tianjin Ruimei Scientific Instrument Co., Ltd. (hereinafter referred to as "Tianjin Ruimei") holds 82.1835 million shares, accounting for 40.06 percent of the company's total share capital.
It’s important to note that this isn’t the first time Cyclis has taken a favorable approach.
Since September of last year, in just one year, Sellis has successively launched measures such as executive holdings, chairman's back-to-back initiatives, repurchasing shares, equity incentives and other measures.
On September 18 of last year, Cyrus announced that the company's Liu Wenhao and other seven plans to increase the number of senior executives have accumulatively increased the company's shares by 394,300 shares (accounting for 0.12% of the company's total share capital), a total of 70.2.29 million yuan, the increase plan has been completed.
Shortly thereafter, Wen Wei, the chairman and actual controller of Cyrus, proposed to increase the company's stock ownership plan for employees, and promised to be compensated by Wenwei if there was a loss.
From October 19 to October 31, 2018, the upper limit of the company's shares does not exceed 150 million yuan, and it is necessary to hold the company's shares for more than 12 consecutive months after the increase, it must not be reduced, and the employee will be employed at the time of compensation.
The reporter combed and found that the stock price of the above-mentioned employees increased their holdings during the time period was as low as 14.02 yuan, up to 16.44 yuan, according to the closing price of 22.02 yuan on September 25th, the maximum float of the employee's increase can reach 42.80%, and the minimum is 21.78%.
On January 21 of this year, Siles once again repurchased the company's joint-stock plan and announced that the total amount of funds to be used to repurchase shares was not less than 160 million yuan and did not exceed 280 million yuan.
On August 8 of this year, the company issued an announcement of Ceres' 2019 Restrictive Stock Incentive Plan (Draft), and set high performance unlocking conditions.
According to the announcement, the equity incentive is based on the operating income in 2018, and the growth rate of the four fiscal years from 2019 to 2022 is not less than 30%, 70%, 120 % and 185% respectively.
Judging from Siles' performance in the first half of the first half of the year, the company maintained high growth and exceeded this year's 30% performance growth to unlock conditions.
In the first half of the year, the operating income was 842 million yuan, an increase of 46.50% year-on-year; the net profit attributable to the shareholders of listed companies was 56.2324 million yuan, an increase of 16.46% year-on-year.
Since the mid-term report of 2018, the revenue growth rate has exceeded 38% year-on-year and the highest growth rate has reached 59% for five consecutive reporting periods.
In 2018, the company established a dual-core-driven collaborative development strategy based on medical inspection intensive operation service (IVD business), medical consumable intensive operation service (SPD business) and regional inspection center as a breakthrough, and iteratively upgraded on the basis of consolidating the advantages of the original IVD business and promoting the SPD business.
Selis related people told reporters that at present, in order to comply with the general trend of medical reform and achieve rapid expansion, the three major businesses of Cyrus are steadily advancing.
In the SPD business area, in January of this year, Silis announced with Lingwu Municipal People's Hospital and Lingwu Chinese Hospital to sign the "medical consumable intensive operation platform construction and daily operation and management service cooperation agreement", the contract period of three years.
â€œIn fact â€œSiles is vigorously expanding SPD's business to provide medical institutions with refined operational services such as centralized procurement, warehousing management, distribution and settlement of medical consumables hospitals to obtain long-term revenue.â€
The above-mentioned persons stated.
On September 17th, according to the Zhejiang government procurement network Zhejiang government procurement service information platform announcement, Siles won the Zhejiang University School of Medicine affiliated Shaw Hospital a "medical consumables (including reagents) in-hospital logistics extension service project".
Pharmaceutical industry analysts pointed out that this winning bid is a very gold content, Shaw Hospital is the first public hospital in mainland China to pass the international hospital review (JCI), and the successful implementation of the project in the future is also an important development opportunity for the hospital.
According to its analysis, the business map has basically completed the business area of the national provinces through regional expansion, national strategic cooperation and channel mergers and acquisitions.
At present, Shao Yifu Hospital, which is the next city in Zhejiang, should continue to replicate the model in different hospitals and enhance the company's competitiveness in the East China market.
In addition, this year Selis is also deployed in emerging fields such as industrial hemp and blockchain technology.
78,000 volunteers in Beijing served the National Day transportation.
In order to ensure the smooth progress of activities to celebrate the 70th anniversary of the founding of the People's Republic of China, more than 78,000 transportation civilization volunteers in Beijing will be officially launched from No. 28 to provide volunteer services at various points in Beijing, and the service period will last until October 8.
Previously, the leading group celebrating the 70th anniversary of the founding of the People's Republic of China in Beijing set up a special volunteer headquarters, and in the early stage, more than 160,000 high-quality volunteers were recruited and trained for colleges and universities, communities, enterprises and all sectors of the society, and the field of volunteer service involved in the celebration of congresses, festivals, large-scale achievement exhibitions, National Day parks, and urban operation and security.
Among them, there are more than 78,000 traffic civilized volunteers.
From September 28th to October 8th, 78,266 capital transportation and civilization volunteers in Beijing 1,700 traffic intersections and 308 subway stations, including more than 300 major transportation hubs.
After being detained by Iran for two months, the British oil tanker Steiner Empire was finally released and set off from the Iranian port of Bandar Abbas on the morning of the 27th for international waters.
Just in the middle of last month, authorities in the British overseas territory of Gibraltar released an Iranian oil tanker that had been detained for more than a month.
According to the news agency of the Islamic Republic of Iran, at 9 a.m. local time on the 27th local time, the British "Stanner Empire" tanker departed from Bandar Abbas for international waters of the Persian Gulf.
Iran’s Hormozgan provincial port and shipping organization confirmed that the ship’s commander and crew had made a formal and written commitment and that, although the vessel had been impounded, they did not have any claims.
Stena Bulk, the Swedish owner of the Steiner Empire, also said that the ship was sailing from Bandar Abbas.
Refinitiv’s vessel tracking data also found that the tanker began to move on the 27th and left Bandar Abbas.
The British-flagged Stena Impero was seized by Iran in July this year.
A company spokesman said that the tanker was preparing to leave Bandar Abbas.
Two weeks after Britain seized an Iranian oil tanker in waters off Gibraltar, Iran’s Revolutionary Guards detained the Stena Impero in the Strait of Hormuz.
The ship was released in August.
Earlier this week, an Iranian government spokesman said that all the legal procedures required to release the Steiner Empire had been completed.
However, the Iranian side said that the investigation is still ongoing.
A number of Iranian media have also released a video of the departure of oil tankers.
On July 19, Iran's Islamic Revolutionary Guards Navy detained a British oil tanker "Stanner Empire" in Iranian waters in the Strait of Hormuz and escorted it to Bandar Abbas.
Iran's seized oil tanker "Grace 1" sailed out of the waters of Gibraltar.
In addition, on July 4, the British overseas territory of Gibraltar seized the Grace 1 tanker loaded with Iranian crude oil in the Strait of Gibraltar on suspicion of transporting oil to Syria in violation of European Union sanctions.
More than a month later, on 15 August, the Gibraltarian authorities announced the release of "Grace I".
