The "one hand has always been" two major UHV projects put into operation
On the 26th, quasi-to-east ±1100 kV high-voltage high-voltage direct current transmission project, Sutong 1000 kV AC ultra-high-voltage GIL comprehensive pipe corridor project was put into operation.
These two projects occupy the commanding heights of their respective fields in the world's current transmission technology, which will greatly enhance China's large-scale energy optimization.
Guo Zhi, chief economist of the National Energy Board, said that the quasi-east-Avenan project is the world's largest power transmission capacity and the farthest transmission distance.
Its operation is of great significance to promoting the development of Xinjiang's energy base and ensuring the power supply in eastern China.
GIL is a gas-sinsulated metal-enclosed transmission line.
The Sutong pipe corridor project has created a record of the highest global voltage level and the strongest conveying capacity of the GIL project, and has realized the "communicative dual-ring network" with the highest voltage level of the backbone power grid in East China.
According to the State Power Grid Corporation, the transmission distance from quasi-east to Wannan project is as long as 3,324 kilometers.
According to conventional technology, more than 15% of the electrical energy will be lost on the way, and the project has been researched and developed, greatly increasing the economic transmission distance to more than 3,000 kilometers.
After it is put into operation, it can deliver 100 million degrees of electricity every 8 hours and 20 minutes, which can help solve the problem of consumption of existing new energy sources in Xinjiang.
According to the full load estimate, the annual power transmission of this single line will reach 60 to 85 billion kWh, which can meet more than half of Shanghai's annual electricity consumption.
Sutong GIL comprehensive pipe corridor project is a UHV AC ring network across the Yangtze River control project.
If you use a conventional overhead line across the river, it is necessary to set up more than 450 meters of giant towers on the surface of the Yangtze River, and to build an artificial island the size of more than four football fields for each tower.
In this regard, the national power grid bold innovation, the development of compact UHV AC GIL transmission technology, through the tunnel across the river, to avoid the impact on the golden channel.
The two projects have promoted China's electrical equipment manufacturing capacity to achieve a new leap forward.
At present, the national power grid has been accumulatively built a "10 to 11 straight" UHV project, as well as "4 to 3 straight" is under construction.
Foreign exchange bureau: China's external debt structure continues to optimize the stability of external debt
"In general, China's external debt structure continues to optimize, the stability of external debt enhanced."
Wang Chunying, spokesman and chief economist of the State Administration of foreign exchange, said on the 27th that the main indicators of China's foreign debt are within the internationally recognized security line, and the external debt risk is generally controllable.
Wang Chunying released the foreign debt data at the end of June 2019 at the foreign exchange bureau on the same day and made the above statement in response to a reporter's question.
According to the data, as of the end of June 2019, China's full-caliber (including this foreign currency) external debt balance was 19.08 billion US dollars, an increase of 26.3 billion US dollars from the end of March 2019, an increase of 1.3%, mainly due to an increase in the balance of debt securities.
In the second quarter of 2019, more than 70% of China's full-caliber external debt increase was driven by the purchase of domestic RMB bonds by non-residents, and non-residents were mainly middle- and long-term investors such as the central bank.
At the end of June 2019, the proportion of medium- and long-term external debt increased by 3 percentage points compared with the end of March 2019, and the proportion of local currency external debt increased by 1 percentage point at the end of March 2019.
Wang Chunying said that as China's domestic RMB bonds were included in the Bloomberg Barclays Global Comprehensive Index in April 2019, international investors' recognition of China's bond market has been further enhanced, and they have continued to increase their holdings of domestic RMB bonds.
"China's balance of payments to maintain the overall balance, foreign debt risk is controllable."
The reporter learned from the Yunnan Provincial Academy of Agricultural Sciences on the 27th that at present, the nocturnal moth of Yunnan grasslands has received effective prevention and control, which did not cause a large-scale outbreak of disasters, and the prevention and control work has achieved phased results.
In January of this year, Jiangcheng County, Pu'er City, Yunnan, for the first time found a grass-grazing nocturnal moth that moved in from abroad, and then it was confirmed to occur in 129 counties in Yunnan, and the grass-grazing nocturnal moth gradually spread from Yunnan to mainland China, posing a direct threat to China's food production.
It is an important multi-eating and long-distance migratory agricultural pest originating in the tropical and subtropical regions of the United States, and is a major migratory pest warned by the Food and Agriculture Organization of the United Nations, which has the characteristics of "international, migratory, explosive and destructive".
The pest endangers more than 80 kinds of crops such as corn, sugarcane and sorghum, and has a large amount of food, which can cause up to 70% production loss.
It is very difficult to prevent and control, and there is currently no registered pesticide for the prevention and control of the insect in China.
Since the meadow nocturnal moth moved to invade Yunnan, the Yunnan Provincial Academy of Agricultural Sciences has chosen to send researchers from Aidong to lead the Yunnan Provincial Academy of Agricultural Sciences to cooperate with the innovation team of the Ministry of Agricultural Pests of Agriculture in collaboration with the green prevention and control province to go to the front line, conduct on-the-spot investigation, collect samples, and carry out technical guidance and experimental demonstrations.
The team has preliminarily grasped the population characteristics, natural enemy insect resources, the characteristics of overseas insect sources, the flight trajectory of the population, the virulence of pharmaceuticals and the effect of field prevention and control.
Through the implementation of new green prevention and control technologies such as population monitoring, adult edification, scientific drugs and agronomic measures, the prevention and control effect has reached more than 90% in the demonstration area, while reducing the use of chemical pesticides, protecting natural enemy resources and the ecological environment, and providing technical support for the outbreak and sustainable management of grassland nocturnal moth in Yunnan.
At present, nocturnal moth has been effectively prevention and control, which has not caused a large-scale outbreak, and the prevention and control work has achieved phased results.
In the next step, the Yunnan Provincial Academy of Agricultural Sciences will focus on carrying out the ecological mechanism of population relocation and intrusion, and break through the construction of biological control and green prevention and control technology system.
At the same time, actively promote cross-border international cooperation, and strive to establish joint key laboratories and joint monitoring outlets and demonstration zones overseas, so as to enhance the all-round monitoring and early warning capabilities of Yunnan grassland nocturnal moth.
According to the People's Bank of China's website, the People's Bank of China is scheduled to issue on September 30, 2019, a set of panda plus gold and silver commemorative coins at the China International Import Expo.
There are a total of 2 gold and silver commemorative coins, including 1 gold commemorative coins and 1 silver commemorative coins, all of which are the legal currency of the People's Republic of China.
According to reports, this set of gold and silver commemorative coins on the observatories of the Beijing Temple of the Temple of the Year, and publishes the country's name, annual number and "China's International Import Expo" Chinese words.
The 8-gram round gold commemorative coin on the back of the pattern is a mother and child panda map, and the words "8g Au.999" and "China International Import Exposition" are English words and denominations.
30 grams of round silver commemorative coins on the back of the pattern for the mother and child panda, and published "30g Ag.999", "China International Import Expo" in English words and denominations.
According to reports, 8 grams of circular gold commemorative coins for the common currency, including pure gold 8 grams, diameter of 22 mm, the denomination of 100 yuan, color 99.9%, the maximum circulation of 10000 pieces.
The 30-gram circular silver commemorative coin is a universal coin, containing 30 grams of pure silver, a diameter of 40 millimeters, a denomination of 10 yuan, a color of 99.9%, with a maximum circulation of 20000 pieces.
The gold and silver commemorative coins were minted by Shenyang Minting Co., Ltd., and the general distributor of China Gold Coin Corporation.
White paper: China has embarked on a development path in line with national conditions
BEIJING, Sept. 27 (Xinhua) -- The Information Office of the State Council of the People's Republic of China released a white paper on "China and the world in the new era."
The white paper pointed out that in the past 70 years, the Chinese people have painstakingly explored and moved forward, successfully opened up the path of socialism with Chinese characteristics, and made remarkable development achievements.
The white paper said that China's development depends on self-reliance and hard work.
China's development, relying on the "800 million shirts for a Boeing" practical spirit, several generations continue to struggle, continue to struggle, pay others unimaginative hard work and sweat; rely on "their own burden to carry their own" spirit, no matter the prosperity or adversity, do not export the problem, do not pass on the contradiction, do not buy and sell and plunder other countries to develop their own; rely on "touching the stone across the river" exploration spirit, do not follow the old path of imperialism and colonialism.
The white paper said that China's development in the interaction with the rest of the world has injected positive energy into the world's peace and development, and China's path is in line with China's national conditions and meets the requirements of the times.
China has taken concrete actions to safeguard world peace.
In the past 70 years, China has not provoked any kind of war or conflict, and it has not occupied an inch of land in other countries.
The white paper pointed out that in the past 70 years, the fundamental reason for China's great development success is to find the correct development path of socialism with Chinese characteristics and unswervingly follow this path.
This is a way to establish the interests of the people in the first place from the perspective of our own national conditions, reform and innovation, pursue common development in opening up, and comprehensively rule the country in accordance with the rule of law.
China has a huge volume, a complex national situation, the difficulty of governance is rare in the world, there has been no centralized, unified and strong leadership forces, China will move towards division and disintegration, bringing disaster to the world.
In the past 70 years, China has overcome all kinds of risks and challenges and created a remarkable Chinese miracle.
Especially since the 18th National Congress of the Communist Party of China, China's development has made historic achievements and undergone historic changes, and the Chinese nation has ushered in a great leap from standing up and getting rich to becoming stronger, which is closer to the great goal of national rejuvenation than at any time in history.
China's development path will show more and more bright development prospects with the advancement of the times.
Textile representatives of 45 countries and regions have jointly issued the "Declaration of the World Textile Manufacturers".
On the 27th, at the 2019 2nd World cloth business conference held in Keqiao District of Shaoxing City, Zhejiang Province, representatives of the textile industry of 45 countries and regions jointly issued the "Declaration of the World cloth merchants".
The declaration pointed out that facing the future, the relevant countries adhere to open synergy, science and technology-driven, and fashion, and will work together to promote the high-quality development of the world's textile industry.
This year's World Textile Conference gathered about 1,200 representatives of the textile industry from 45 countries and regions, focusing on the trend of the textile industry in the world's economic pattern and jointly exploring the sustainable development of the global textile industry and the win-win path of cooperation.
Sun Ruizhe, president of the China Textile Industry Federation, said that the current pattern of global industrial division of labor, trade pattern and innovation pattern have undergone profound adjustment, and the textile industry has entered a new stage of globalization, innovation and responsible development.
Standing at the â€œcrossroadsâ€ of global textile transformation and upgrading, Sun Ruizhe said, â€œIn order for the industry to achieve sustainable development and common prosperity, it is necessary for global textile people to actively participate, each director, and share interests.â€
At the meeting, representatives of the textile industry of 45 countries and regions jointly issued the "Declaration of the World cloth supplier", which jointly expounded the development goals and vision of the global textile industry.
The "Declaration of the World cloth supplier" pointed out that facing the future, the relevant countries will adhere to openness and synergy, continue to promote the interconnection of industries and markets, and jointly improve the development level of the industrial chain; they will adhere to the scientific and technological drive, continuously strengthen basic research, applied research and technological transformation, and jointly enhance the basic capabilities of the industrial base; they will concentrate on fashion, give full play to the role of textiles and clothing as cultural carriers and cultural bridges, and jointly enhance industrial and cultural values.
Loureno Bartholomei, president of the Brazilian Fashion Designers Association, said in an interview that the release of the "Declaration of the World Textile Merchants" helps various countries to jointly improve the development level of the textile industry chain and realize the sustainable development of the textile industry.
Loureno Bartholomei, for example, the Brazilian fashion designer association has more than 130 high-end local ready-to-wear brands, the designers are committed to the design of fashion, high-end ready-to-wear products, and Keqiao also has a variety of boutique fabrics, "through this cloth business conference, we are also looking forward to Keqiao's excellent suppliers to establish contacts and seek more cooperation opportunities."
As the venue of the World cloth business conference, Keqiao has the world's largest textile market, and it is gradually building a new pattern of upgrading and opening to the outside world with its unique textile industry chain, representing China's textile image at the forefront of the world.
Shen Zhijiang, secretary of the Keqiao District Party Committee, said that Keqiao will take this cloth business conference as an opportunity to promote the textile industry towards a more open, inclusive, inclusive, balanced and win-win direction.
According to the Reuters estimate, the yuan's median price was opened at 7.08883 yuan, with a counter-cyclical impact of 460 points.
According to the RMB exchange rate formation mechanism released by the China Foreign Exchange Trading Center (CFETS), the yuan's median price against the US dollar is expected to open near 7.08883 yuan on Friday, a depreciation of about 154 points from the previous day.
In the previous day, the RMB immediately closed 7.1315 yuan against the U.S. dollar, while the median price was 7.0729 yuan.
According to the pricing mechanism, among today's mid-price changes, there are 586 points that reflect the impact of supply and demand in the market, and another 27 points of decline reflect the number of points required for the overnight basket of exchange rates to remain basically unchanged; there are still 460 points that reflect the impact of the "counter-cyclical factor".
The median price of the yuan against the U.S. dollar in the previous day was estimated by Reuters at 7.0947 yuan, a deviation of 218 points from the actual value announced by the foreign exchange trading center.
According to the middle price estimate released by CFETS, the RMB exchange rate CFETS index, the reference SDR (special drawing rights) basket index and the reference BIS (Bank for International Settlements) basket index were 91.26, 91.46 and 94.92 respectively.
The first high-rise building in northern China has been completed, and more than 100 national patent achievements have been completed.
On the afternoon of the 26th, the completion ceremony was held in the Tianjin Binhai New Area, marking the success of the collaborative management platform for high-precision BIM in the field of skyscraper construction, which was independently researched and developed by the project department of the Tianjin Chow Dafu Financial Center of the Eighth Bureau of China Construction, which has won the Global Excellence Award in the global engineering and construction industry. The collaborative management platform of the high-precision BIM model has been successful in the field of skyscraper construction.
Tianjin Chow Dafu financial center is located in the economic and technological development zone of Tianjin, the total construction area of the project reached 390,000 square meters, 4 floors underground, 100 floors above ground, building height of 530 meters, covering Class A office, luxury apartments, super five-star hotels, etc. After completion, it will become an important part of Tianjin's international landmark complex.
According to the relevant person in charge of the project department of the Tianjin Chow Taifu Financial Center of the Eighth Bureau, the amount of steel used for the entire project is more than 70,000 tons, the high-altitude group is about 376,000 meters equivalent to the height of 42.5 Everest peaks, the use of welds can circle the earth for 40 times, the number of steel components up to 42,000 pieces, more than 50% of the non-standard components, which includes the world's most single-layer twisted angle up to 90 degrees of double-tube elliptical steel pipe.
The complexity and difficulty of the steel structure of the Tianjin Chow Dafu project are unprecedented.
According to industry insiders, the Tianjin Chow Dafu financial center has taken the lead in the comprehensive implementation of building information model (BIM) management in the skyscraper projects that have been built or built in the country.
Creatively put forward and successfully implemented the "three full BIM application" model with full participation, full professional application and whole-process implementation, and developed a collaborative management platform based on a high-precision BIM model.
The person in charge said that in the construction process of Chow Taifu, the project department first carried out BIM construction in the virtual world, carried out scientific and correct verification, and then carried out material entity construction, thus eliminating the problems that may have caused demolition and rework in the construction of previous construction projects in the bud.
In 2017, the BIM innovation results of the Chow Dafu Financial Center project won the first prize of the construction group of the global engineering and construction industry global excellence award in the global engineering construction industry and the 2017 global engineering construction industry.
During the construction of the project, the project department created more than 130 national patent achievements.
It is worth mentioning that the BIM innovation achievements and scientific and technological innovation of the Tianjin Chow Taifu project have not only made the complex and numerous construction links have all achieved success, but also shortened the construction period by more than four months, which has also led to a significant increase in safety management and other aspects.
Not long ago, the Tianjin Chow Taifu Financial Center project also won the 2019 ISA International Security Award.
The 86th Sino-Myanmar-Thailand-Mekong River joint patrol law enforcement was completed.
The reporter learned from the press office of the Yunnan Provincial Department of Public Security on the 27th that at 15:30 on the same day, three Chinese law enforcement boats and two law enforcement boats participating in the 86th Sino-Laos-Myanmar-Mekong joint patrol and two law enforcement boats successfully berthed in China, marking the successful conclusion of the joint patrol and law enforcement operation.
The operation was launched on the 24th in the port, which lasted for 4 days and 3 nights, sent a total of 136 law enforcement personnel and 6 law enforcement boats.
During the operation, the team carried out joint patrols, anti-drug propaganda and other activities in key waters such as the Golden Triangle, the Lao Pandora, and Monmo.
In addition, the Chinese side has also sent a team of police actual combat instructors to the Lao People's Army's 122 and 133 frontier companies to carry out practical police combat skills exchanges, effectively improving the emergency response ability of law enforcement personnel of the two sides to jointly deal with emergencies.
It also held a law enforcement cooperation and exchange meeting in Qingsheng, Thailand, to inform each other about the recent situation of various countries in border management, the fight against drug-related crimes and the security situation in the Mekong region, and reached a consensus on strengthening the exchange of information, research and judgment, and law enforcement cooperation; and held four-country cultural and sports exchange activities to carry out competition projects such as football, rattan ball, iron ball and tug-of-war to effectively enhance the mutual understanding between law enforcement team members and the four-country law enforcement cooperation friendship.
According to the relevant person in charge of the water patrol team of the Yunnan Provincial Public Security Department, after the end of the operation, the two sides will also continue to carry out a 10-day joint stationed training and segmented joint patrol tasks to improve the police rate of the Mekong River, and make every effort to maintain the security and stability of the Mekong River Basin.
The commander-in-chief of the Thai side said that since the launch of joint patrols and law enforcement in the Mekong River, the four countries of Myanmar and Thailand have conducted close exchanges, deepened practical cooperation, and achieved fruitful results in various fields such as law enforcement and security cooperation and cultural exchanges.
It is hoped that law enforcement cooperation between the four parties will continue to deepen and expand, strive to open a new situation of law enforcement cooperation between the four countries, and make new contributions to maintaining the security and stability of the Mekong River Basin.
Iranian Defense Minister Amir Khatami said on the 25th that he was opposed to reaching any agreement with the West about Iran's missile program.
The Islamic Republic News Agency quoted Khatami as saying that any agreement reached with the United States on Iran's "missile forces" will damage Iran's capabilities.
According to Khatami, Iran’s leaders are supportive of improving the missile program.
Iran and Iran reached an agreement in 2015, and the United States withdrew from the agreement in May last year and reinstated sanctions against Iran in an attempt to renegotiate the Iranian nuclear agreement with the United States with maximum pressure in order to limit Iran's weapons programs and regional activities.
Some Western leaders used the United Nations General Assembly to mediate U.S.-Iran tensions.
British British Prime Minister Boris Johnson, German Chancellor Angela Merkel and French President Emmanuel Macron met on the sidelines of the General Assembly on the 23rd.
After the meeting, the leaders of the three countries issued a joint statement, urging Iran to participate in the dialogue on nuclear activities, missile projects and regional security issues.
Iranian President Hassan Rouhani told reporters on the 24th that Iran is willing to discuss "small changes, additions or amendments" to the Iranian nuclear agreement, provided that the United States lifts sanctions.
The 2019 Tokyo International Film Film Festival is the head of the jury.
Wang Rui, a professor at the Beijing Film Institute, is the only Chinese-language film shortlisted for the main competition unit of the 32nd Tokyo International Film Festival, which opened on October 28, and will compete with 13 other shortlisted films to compete for the Golden Kirin Award, the highest award of the Tokyo International Film Festival.
"Under the White Clouds" is the 5th film directed by Professor Wang Rui of "Peach and the World", about an ordinary Mongolian herdsmen's husband-and-wife, due to the difference in the pursuit of a certain kind of life dilemma, by the Mongolian actors Jilimutu, Tana as the protagonist.
It is reported that "under the white clouds" held two world premieres during the film festival, the release dates are October 31 and November 3.
On the afternoon of September 26, the organizing committee held a press conference on the afternoon of September 28th to November 5th this year, officially announced the list of films such as the main competition unit, "Asia's future" unit, "special hospitality works", Japanese Cinema Splash, "World Focus" and many other units.
The person in charge of the competition film introduced the Chinese film "Under the White Cloud".
Zhang is the chairman of the international jury of the main competition unit of the film festival.
"Asia's Future" unit has three Chinese-language films
In a series of units of the Tokyo International Film Festival, its important position is second only to the "Asian future" unit of the main competition, although there are only eight shortlisted films, six less than the main competition, but there are three Chinese-language films from mainland China and Hong Kong.
The two Hong Kong films are "Baby Vengeance" directed by Lu Yixin, directed by Huang Qingxun, directed by Shadow Emperor Guo Fucheng, and Yang Qianzi, who starred after the film "The Wal-Convenor", and a mainland film "Summer Night Rider" directed by the director of "Summer Night Riders".
In addition, the Sino-Japanese cooperative action-adventure film "Ice Peak Storm", which is directed and starred by the Guangshi, Zhang Jingchu and Lin Baihong, will also be released at this film festival as a "special hospitality work".
The spokesperson of the film festival and the "goddess" Hiose Alice was absent from the press conference and issued a video statement.
Well-known director Yamada.
At the press conference at the press conference, the chairman of the Tokyo International Film Festival who has just taken office in August this year, the chairman of the Tokyo International Film Festival, and the directors of the film selection of various units have successively delivered speeches, introducing the purpose of the film festival and the release of various films.
As a special guest at the press conference, the 50th work in the opening film of the "Jin Jiro" series "The Story of Yin Jiro: Welcome Homecoming" director Yamada and the two Japanese film directors who were shortlisted in the main competition, "Balopola"), "Comedy Love Wife Story", as well as the famous playwright and screenwriter Łkoshima, also appeared at this press conference to tell the experience of participating in the Tokyo Film Festival.
The international jury of the main competition is composed of five people, and the chairman of the jury consists of Zhang Ziyi of China, and the other four people are American producer Bill Geber, French actor and producer Julie Gayer, Danish director Michael Noel, and Japanese director Hirohiker.
In addition, the TIFFCOM (International Image Market), held in conjunction with the Tokyo International Film Festival, will be held from October 22nd to 24th at Ikebukuro Sunshine City Convention and Exhibition Center, and this year there will be a record number of 401 group exhibition booths, especially from 90 exhibition units from China, a sharp increase of 6.4 times compared with 14 last year.
To this end, TIFFCOM specially designated October 22 on the opening day as "CHINA DAY", held a number of lectures, seminars, etc., and invited the Japanese director Ishii Yu to also participate in the relevant activities, and the welcome dinner on the same evening was also co-hosted by China and Japan.
Chengdu "Panda planet" and giant panda breeding research base expansion project started
Xinhua News Agency, Chengdu, September 27 (Reporter Li Qianwei) to enrich the theme of giant panda cultural tourism routes, panda base in the future can accommodate 180 giant panda. "Panda planet" and giant panda bred research base expansion project officially started in Chengdu on the 25th, which means that the "panda capital" project planned and built by Chengdu was officially launched.
According to the plan, the "Panda Capital" created by Chengdu is composed of three areas in the North Lake area, Dujiangyan area and Longquan Mountain area, covering an area of 69 square kilometers.
It is planned to organically combine the ecology and cultural values of giant pandas with the urban construction of beautiful livable livable parks in Chengdu to create an ecological home for giant pandas.
"Panda planet" belongs to the North Lake area, covering an area of 35 square kilometers, combined with industrial planning, will form a "1+N+X" regional spatial structure.
One of the core attractions is the renovation and expansion project of the giant panda breeding research base; N cultural and tourism consumption scenes are created, that is, panda small town, peripient garden, dream garden and so on; X regional basic supporting facilities.
After the renovation and expansion of the giant panda breeding research base in Chengdu, the scale will reach 3,525 mu, which is generally positioned as a world-class giant panda protection demonstration site, and people and animals have a good time to share.
It is planned to accommodate 180 giant pandas and their accompanying animals (little panda and golden monkeys).
In the past few days, a number of international dignitaries and envoys from various countries have congratulated the 70th anniversary of the founding of the People's Republic of China, highly appreciating New China's development achievements and its significance for global development.
In an exclusive interview with the Central Radio and Television Station, Malian President Keita said that he has visited China many times, and China's development achievements in the past 70 years have been amazing, and it has benefited the world.
Keita: I am a friend and sincere friend of the Chinese people.
China has never developed selfishly, but has opened the door to the world and brought the greatest happiness to the peoples of the world.
We hope that China will succeed in everything, and I hope that President Xi Jinping will lead the great Chinese people to continue to realize their dreams.
Happy Happy Birthday and Bless China!
The Prime Minister of Barbados, Motley, said that he wished the People's Republic of China a happy birthday.
Say hello to the Chinese people.
I’ll never forget it, because it’s also my birthday.
A few days ago (25th), diplomatic envoys from more than 130 countries and representatives of international organizations and international organizations in China visited the "Great Achievements - A Large-scale Accomplishment Exhibition celebrating the 70th anniversary of the founding of the People's Republic of China" in Beijing.
Denisov, the Russian ambassador to China, personally saw the starting point of China's reform and opening-up policy and made too much progress compared with the situation today and more than 40 years ago.
In addition, our embassies and consulates in many countries have also held a variety of local activities in recent days to celebrate the 70th anniversary of the founding of New China with local friendly people.
A large number of foreign friends have sent sincere blessings to China.
On September 26, Baidu announced that the pilot operation of Robotaxi, an uninhabited "level 4" fully self-driving taxi team, was launched on a specific highway in Changsha City, Hunan Province.
Self-driving start-up Xiaoma Zhihang has also launched a trial operation in Guangzhou, Guangdong Province.
The trial operation of self-driving taxis supported by the Chinese government is likely to expand everywhere.
Since the 26th, Baidu has used 45 self-driving taxis for trial operation, and passengers in Changsha City can apply for a ride through a special website.
There is a "safety officer" in the driver's seat to ensure the safety of passengers.
The road providing trial operation is 50 kilometers by the end of 2019, and it is planned to be expanded to 135 kilometers in the first half of 2020.
The vehicle is China FAW Group's pure electric vehicle "Red Flag EV", equipped with Baidu set up by Baidu and supported by the "Apollo program" developed by the system.
Baidu's Apollo program, in addition to Toyota and Honda, there are more than 150 companies such as Volkswagen of Germany, Daimler in Germany, Ford Motor of the United States, Intel in the United States, Microsoft in the United States and Nvidia in the United States.
Around China's self-driving taxis, China's largest online ride-hailing service Didi Chuxing released a plan to launch 30 self-driving taxi services on the outskirts of Shanghai this year.
China's self-driving car development competition may become more intense.
Taiwanese scholars suggest that "uncertain times" Taiwanese businesses need to keep pace with the development of mainstream industries in the mainland
On the 26th and 27th, the "2019 Taiwan Business Innovation Business Model Forum" was held in Taipei for two consecutive days on the 26th and 27th.
The event invited a large number of Taiwanese business representatives and scholars to share their experiences on enterprise transformation, innovation, succession and market development.
The forum was hosted by the Taipei Institute of Business Management and co-organized by Qunyi Jinding Securities and the Outstanding Mainland Taiwan Business Association.
The two-day meeting was divided into many seminars such as transformation and upgrading mode and business strategy, and more than 100 people attended the meeting.
Chen Mingzhang, dean of the Taipei Institute of Business Management, said that trade frictions between China and the United States continue, and Taiwanese businesses are facing an "undetermined era."
He believes that Taiwanese companies need to keep pace with the times and keep pace with the mainstream industries in the development of the mainland, paying special attention to innovative products related to the fields of science and technology, culture, tourism and health.
â€œIn the past, Taiwanese companies attached importance to quality, effectiveness and delivery.
Chen Mingzhang believes that only the above-mentioned conditions are no longer sufficient.
He pointed out that Taiwanese-funded enterprises should combine speed and service, accelerate the speed of the supply chain, and attach importance to extension services and life products and services.
In addition, â€œservice value-addedâ€ is also a new area in which Taiwanese businessmen can vigorously develop.
Xu Wentang, chairman of Taishang Yamei Electronics Co., Ltd. from Guangdong, said that Yamei Electronics has experienced operational difficulties due to the sharp decline in orders, and the group has begun to improve its operating conditions from various aspects such as restructuring and revitalizing assets.
Retrieved the traditional electrical business, the transformation of vehicle electronic equipment, into the smart home appliance industry, it took three years for the company to achieve revenue.
Bai Hongzhang, general manager of Heshen (Zhuhai) Electronics Co., Ltd., proposed that if it is difficult to develop new customers, it is better to focus on "one-stop" services provided by the original customers.
The customer to replace the supplier is nothing more than poor service, high price, low quality, slow delivery speed, less variety, integrity problem six factors, as long as to solve these six points, coupled with the timely transformation of the production line and the expansion of product categories, the enterprise has become an irreplaceable supplier to customers.
On the 27th, the award ceremony of the "2019 Outstanding Mainland Taiwan Merchants Award", also sponsored by the Taipei Institute of Business Management, was held in Taipei.
According to Taiwan's "Economic Daily" reported that the operating center in Shanghai's Golden Land Company general manager Lu Zhengzhang won the "outstanding Taiwanese business and cross-strait contribution award."
The new regulations for comments: social capital needs to be qualified to obtain rural land management rights
Social capital to obtain rural land management rights need to be qualified
Measures for the Administration of the Transfer of Rural Land Management Rights to Publicly Comment on the Supervision of the Transfer of Social Capital for Industrial and Commercial Enterprises
Yesterday, the website of the Ministry of Agriculture and Rural Affairs issued a notice on the "Administrative Measures for the Transfer of Rural Land Management Rights (Revised Draft for Comment)" (hereinafter referred to as the "Draft of Opinions") for public consultation, increasing the supervision and risk prevention of the transfer of social capital to obtain land management rights such as industrial and commercial enterprises.
From now on, it will be open for public consultation with the public.
The Ministry of Agriculture and Rural Affairs said that in order to implement the newly revised Law on Rural land contracting, further consolidate and improve the basic rural management system, deepen the reform of the rural land system, and implement the "separation of three rights" system, the Ministry of Agriculture and Rural Affairs revised the "Administrative Measures for the Administration of Rural Land Contract Management Rights" and formed the "Draft of Opinions".
The Beijing Youth Daily reporter learned that there are a number of important changes in the "draft of opinions" published for the first time.
According to the newly revised "Rural land contracting law" clarifies the scope of land transfer and implements the concept of "separation of the three rights", sets up "land contract management right" and "property management right" respectively, and makes a clear distinction between the transfer, exchange and transfer of land management rights (leasing, subcontracting, equity or other means).
In the "Draft of Opinions", in order to implement the concept of â€œsegregation and separation of powersâ€, effectively respond to the "Rural Land Contracting Law's revised law", and take into account that there is a big difference between land management rights transfer and land contract management rights, transfers in terms of parties, procedures, and supervision, this revised draft defines the scope of transfer, focuses on the transfer of land management rights, including leasing and shareholding.
The transfer and exchange of land contractual management rights will be stipulated in a separate administrative measure.
In the context of â€œseparation of three rightsâ€ , it is only the right to operate land for a certain period of a certain period.
In theory, even in the event of bankruptcy and liquidation, there is only a risk that farmers will lose the right to operate for a certain period of time, so it is no longer necessary to provide for the return of the original contractor to the original contractor, and there is also a conflict with the Bankruptcy Code.
In response to the problem of preventing the risk of loss of land for farmers, in practice, preferred stocks, stocks after rent, repurchasing and other methods have been generated.
In view of the fact that preferred stocks have a more mature theoretical discussion in the company law, it is recommended to use it as an advocacy provision to prevent the risk of loss of equity.
